(232494, 13960, 2352, '<td valign="top">You took a bold gamble on this shot as to how the votes would go. It is a very interesting shot. Beautiful colors and a sharp focus for the blur. I`m not sure what I am looking at ( a reflection?)  or how you did this (filters?).  Hhmmm  I will learn something this week from this shot... -Clicker-</td>', 'You took a bold gamble on this shot as to how the votes would go. It is a very interesting shot. Beautiful colors and a sharp focus for the blur. I`m not sure what I am looking at ( a reflection?)  or how you did this (filters?).  Hhmmm  I will learn something this week from this shot... -Clicker-', '2003-03-10 01:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(232495, 13741, 6817, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture...I would have liked to see the bridge a little more.</td>', 'This is a nice picture...I would have liked to see the bridge a little more.', '2003-03-10 01:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(232496, 13892, 5318, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective zac, COOL SHOT i feel so small or short  i''m not sure which , but i know this is a  BIG bridge too</td>', 'Nice perspective zac, COOL SHOT i feel so small or short  i''m not sure which , but i know this is a  BIG bridge too', '2003-03-10 01:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
