(232657, 13531, 6999, '<td valign="top">Big grin - she''s very photogenic, Tower Bridge, isn''t she? I took a shot something like this myself, and didn''t enter it for the same reason I''m unsure about your shot - it just doesn''t quite give the impression/impact the bridge actually has: I found it a really difficult subject (perhaps because so well known), and so went and shot something else :-) Good try though (better than mine was, anyway).</td>', 'Big grin - she''s very photogenic, Tower Bridge, isn''t she? I took a shot something like this myself, and didn''t enter it for the same reason I''m unsure about your shot - it just doesn''t quite give the impression/impact the bridge actually has: I found it a really difficult subject (perhaps because so well known), and so went and shot something else :-) Good try though (better than mine was, anyway).', '2003-03-10 07:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
