(232711, 13969, 6551, '<td valign="top">Great pic!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Great pic!!!!!!!!', '2003-03-10 08:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(232713, 13947, 7073, '<td valign="top">Extremely interesting shot.... I love it!  It''s a great picture, has a great viewpoint, and was taken nicely!</td>', 'Extremely interesting shot.... I love it!  It''s a great picture, has a great viewpoint, and was taken nicely!', '2003-03-10 08:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(232714, 13903, 7073, '<td valign="top">Wow, makes you think... awesome shot!  Love it!</td>', 'Wow, makes you think... awesome shot!  Love it!', '2003-03-10 08:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(232715, 13550, 7073, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2003-03-10 08:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(232716, 13797, 6999, '<td valign="top">why b&amp;w? I''m not sure at this distance that there''s enough texture to warrant it, and I''d love to have seen the colours of the stone.</td>', 'why b&w? I''m not sure at this distance that there''s enough texture to warrant it, and I''d love to have seen the colours of the stone.', '2003-03-10 08:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(232718, 13772, 7073, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2003-03-10 08:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(232719, 13794, 6999, '<td valign="top">great colours, interesting composition. Would have liked more detail on the cathedral, but that''s being hyper-picky. Very pretty shot.</td>', 'great colours, interesting composition. Would have liked more detail on the cathedral, but that''s being hyper-picky. Very pretty shot.', '2003-03-10 08:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(232722, 13709, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and colour - proritising the vertical doesn''t work for me in this shot, which is not to say that a flat horizon would have worked either, but ...</td>', 'Nice detail and colour - proritising the vertical doesn''t work for me in this shot, which is not to say that a flat horizon would have worked either, but ...', '2003-03-10 08:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(232723, 13589, 6551, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2003-03-10 08:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(232726, 13565, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot - just a bit too obvious perhaps, for me.</td>', 'Well taken shot - just a bit too obvious perhaps, for me.', '2003-03-10 08:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(232727, 13727, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t see a good reason for the colour, or removal of colour.</td>', 'Don''t see a good reason for the colour, or removal of colour.', '2003-03-10 08:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(232730, 13768, 6202, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Did you try an unsharpening mask?</td>', 'Cute idea.  Did you try an unsharpening mask?', '2003-03-10 08:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(232732, 13750, 5865, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque shot.  I like the way the white building is framed by the trees too.</td>', 'Very picturesque shot.  I like the way the white building is framed by the trees too.', '2003-03-10 08:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(232734, 13551, 5865, '<td valign="top">I really love this photograph.  The eye is really led into the image by the  arrangement of the supports.  I also like the colour of the brick.  It is a pity about the barbed wire, but there isn''t much the photographer can do about that.  I also think that the shadow on the first support detracts from the overall image, but nevertheless it is a lovely shot.</td>', 'I really love this photograph.  The eye is really led into the image by the  arrangement of the supports.  I also like the colour of the brick.  It is a pity about the barbed wire, but there isn''t much the photographer can do about that.  I also think that the shadow on the first support detracts from the overall image, but nevertheless it is a lovely shot.', '2003-03-10 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(232737, 13824, 5865, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph because of the line that is produced by the path leading up to the bridge.  The eye naturally follows this line.  I also like the trees that are framing the bridge.  I think black and white was a good choice.  If there was foliage on the trees, perhaps it would be right to use colour then.  A lovely photograph.</td>', 'I like this photograph because of the line that is produced by the path leading up to the bridge.  The eye naturally follows this line.  I also like the trees that are framing the bridge.  I think black and white was a good choice.  If there was foliage on the trees, perhaps it would be right to use colour then.  A lovely photograph.', '2003-03-10 08:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(232739, 13799, 5865, '<td valign="top">The title is right, this is a very picturesque scene.  I am not sure about the depth of field though.  I think the scene would be improved upon if everything was in sharp focus.</td>', 'The title is right, this is a very picturesque scene.  I am not sure about the depth of field though.  I think the scene would be improved upon if everything was in sharp focus.', '2003-03-10 08:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(232740, 13581, 6202, '<td valign="top">Would be a great photo if not for the spotting.</td>', 'Would be a great photo if not for the spotting.', '2003-03-10 08:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(232746, 13706, 917, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Perhaps the odd areas in the bottom right could be eliminated by walking forward a bit.</td>', 'Excellent. Perhaps the odd areas in the bottom right could be eliminated by walking forward a bit.', '2003-03-10 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(232748, 13745, 917, '<td valign="top">Leans a bit, and the composition could be better.  Try rotating it anticlockwise about 2 degrees, and cropping closer on the right and top.</td>', 'Leans a bit, and the composition could be better.  Try rotating it anticlockwise about 2 degrees, and cropping closer on the right and top.', '2003-03-10 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(232754, 13835, 917, '<td valign="top">The sky is way too bright, but theres not alot you can do with it except revisit the site when its less overcast. Excellent composition, perhaps a tad soft, and needs the near horizontal in sharper focus.</td>', 'The sky is way too bright, but theres not alot you can do with it except revisit the site when its less overcast. Excellent composition, perhaps a tad soft, and needs the near horizontal in sharper focus.', '2003-03-10 09:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(232756, 13668, 917, '<td valign="top">I''d go for a closer ''architectural'' approach to this bridge, or try shooting at night when the sky and water dont look so bad.</td>', 'I''d go for a closer ''architectural'' approach to this bridge, or try shooting at night when the sky and water dont look so bad.', '2003-03-10 09:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(232757, 13939, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice forground interest, but it cuts iover the bridge. Maybe replacing it with a bit of driftwood would have been better.  Youve avoided an overly bright sky, and the water has a rich colour to it.</td>', 'Nice forground interest, but it cuts iover the bridge. Maybe replacing it with a bit of driftwood would have been better.  Youve avoided an overly bright sky, and the water has a rich colour to it.', '2003-03-10 09:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(232758, 13680, 1, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the shadows really hurt the overall effect.</td>', 'The reflections in the shadows really hurt the overall effect.', '2003-03-10 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(232760, 13917, 917, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly off center. Try standing a bit to the left.</td>', 'Looks slightly off center. Try standing a bit to the left.', '2003-03-10 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(232766, 13977, 2178, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, great lines leading into and thru the pic. The shadows work great to add interesting shapes on the bridge. Only suggestion to make this shot "over the top", is a tad more DOF. Great work on this !</td>', 'Love this shot, great lines leading into and thru the pic. The shadows work great to add interesting shapes on the bridge. Only suggestion to make this shot "over the top", is a tad more DOF. Great work on this !', '2003-03-10 09:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(232768, 13801, 917, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. It might work better cropped just below the railing to eliminate the white stuff behind it.</td>', 'Excellent composition. It might work better cropped just below the railing to eliminate the white stuff behind it.', '2003-03-10 09:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(232769, 13833, 1563, '<td valign="top">Bridge is cool, excellent colors, but the river does distract one from the bridge.<br/>Beautiful picture</td>', 'Bridge is cool, excellent colors, but the river does distract one from the bridge.Beautiful picture', '2003-03-10 09:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(232773, 13670, 917, '<td valign="top">Get closer, the 84 is too small. There are intersting possibilities with the verticle stripe.</td>', 'Get closer, the 84 is too small. There are intersting possibilities with the verticle stripe.', '2003-03-10 09:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(232775, 13541, 1563, '<td valign="top">This bridge does look familiar to me. Icelandic?</td>', 'This bridge does look familiar to me. Icelandic?', '2003-03-10 09:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(232785, 13911, 1570, '<td valign="top">very nice grapfic shadows and good contrast with the blue sky... striking picture, good job!</td>', 'very nice grapfic shadows and good contrast with the blue sky... striking picture, good job!', '2003-03-10 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(232787, 13960, 2000, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of abstract/impressionist paintings.  I can''t say for certain if I like it, but the title is definitely catchy.  :-)</td>', 'Reminds me of abstract/impressionist paintings.  I can''t say for certain if I like it, but the title is definitely catchy.  :-)', '2003-03-10 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(232789, 13558, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice snap of tunnel vision.  The photo is somewhat dark (I don''t know if that''s your goal), and based on the title doesn''t really capture something that''s up especially high.</td>', 'Nice snap of tunnel vision.  The photo is somewhat dark (I don''t know if that''s your goal), and based on the title doesn''t really capture something that''s up especially high.', '2003-03-10 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(232792, 13536, 1570, '<td valign="top">stunning picture, great job!</td>', 'stunning picture, great job!', '2003-03-10 09:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(232794, 13645, 2000, '<td valign="top">The memorial (is that the Lincoln?) at the end solidifies the title.  The lighting here makes it look like just before a really bad storm/tornado, and the void space above seems to work well for the shot.  I''m just not sure what really to get out of the pic.</td>', 'The memorial (is that the Lincoln?) at the end solidifies the title.  The lighting here makes it look like just before a really bad storm/tornado, and the void space above seems to work well for the shot.  I''m just not sure what really to get out of the pic.', '2003-03-10 09:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(232805, 13803, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space.  I enjoy the cropping on this quite a bit.</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space.  I enjoy the cropping on this quite a bit.', '2003-03-10 09:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(232806, 13912, 2000, '<td valign="top">Almost a good perspectives shot (would have to be bit closer to the bridge for that), but as a bridge shot it''s pretty nice.  I think it could be a bit brighter, as some of the detail is lost in the poor lighting - this appears to be quite an old bridge with a lot of very nice architectural detail.</td>', 'Almost a good perspectives shot (would have to be bit closer to the bridge for that), but as a bridge shot it''s pretty nice.  I think it could be a bit brighter, as some of the detail is lost in the poor lighting - this appears to be quite an old bridge with a lot of very nice architectural detail.', '2003-03-10 09:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(232807, 13835, 2170, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous -- excellent use of soft focus and wonderful color.  Would LOVE more detail on how this was accomplished and post-processed.  10.</td>', 'Gorgeous -- excellent use of soft focus and wonderful color.  Would LOVE more detail on how this was accomplished and post-processed.  10.', '2003-03-10 09:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(232815, 13707, 2000, '<td valign="top">The bridge looks a bit fuzzy to me, but I like the shot overall otherwise.  I hope you explained the title in your details, so I can see it after the challenge.</td>', 'The bridge looks a bit fuzzy to me, but I like the shot overall otherwise.  I hope you explained the title in your details, so I can see it after the challenge.', '2003-03-10 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(232823, 13591, 2000, '<td valign="top">Looks like something in Europe, with that castle in the background.  I was going to ask if they take EZ-Pass, but I''m guessing they don''t.  The sepia tones work well here, but that spot in the upper right corner is distracting - if only you had cropped that out.</td>', 'Looks like something in Europe, with that castle in the background.  I was going to ask if they take EZ-Pass, but I''m guessing they don''t.  The sepia tones work well here, but that spot in the upper right corner is distracting - if only you had cropped that out.', '2003-03-10 09:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(232824, 13735, 2000, '<td valign="top">I suppose that''s one thing to do with a gray day, but I really don''t like the purple.  Makes it look like a chemical spill or something.</td>', 'I suppose that''s one thing to do with a gray day, but I really don''t like the purple.  Makes it look like a chemical spill or something.', '2003-03-10 09:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(232825, 13679, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good level of detail shown here, but the one pigeon I see is a bit OOF - maybe a slightly shallower/wider depth of field.</td>', 'Good level of detail shown here, but the one pigeon I see is a bit OOF - maybe a slightly shallower/wider depth of field.', '2003-03-10 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(232827, 13536, 4729, '<td valign="top">Nice nightime exposure..well done.</td>', 'Nice nightime exposure..well done.', '2003-03-10 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(232828, 13809, 4729, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2003-03-10 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(232831, 13748, 2000, '<td valign="top">Open exposure and drag?  Not sure if I like this one - the light streams are nice, but the double bridge is confusing.</td>', 'Open exposure and drag?  Not sure if I like this one - the light streams are nice, but the double bridge is confusing.', '2003-03-10 09:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(232844, 13882, 6817, '<td valign="top">This is cool, good time of day. And even though there is a tree in the foreground the colors of the bridge make it come right through. This makes you want to be there.</td>', 'This is cool, good time of day. And even though there is a tree in the foreground the colors of the bridge make it come right through. This makes you want to be there.', '2003-03-10 09:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(232846, 13651, 6817, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of the bridge. Nice foresight to see this image for this challenge.</td>', 'Very creative use of the bridge. Nice foresight to see this image for this challenge.', '2003-03-10 09:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(232850, 13762, 6886, '<td valign="top">Great shot from the right angle</td>', 'Great shot from the right angle', '2003-03-10 09:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(232852, 13589, 6817, '<td valign="top">Wow, you folks are in some nice places. Good feature of the bridge in a very nice well composed image. This would be really nice in a panoramic aspect to open up the feel of the bridge.</td>', 'Wow, you folks are in some nice places. Good feature of the bridge in a very nice well composed image. This would be really nice in a panoramic aspect to open up the feel of the bridge.', '2003-03-10 09:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(232853, 13580, 6817, '<td valign="top">Way turn an otherwise common photo into a good interesting image.</td>', 'Way turn an otherwise common photo into a good interesting image.', '2003-03-10 09:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(232854, 13536, 6886, '<td valign="top">great shot..keep up the work!</td>', 'great shot..keep up the work!', '2003-03-10 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(232858, 13707, 6817, '<td valign="top">Very nice chilly photo. Makes me cold, which it should. Good use of the outside frame accenting the bridge''s color.</td>', 'Very nice chilly photo. Makes me cold, which it should. Good use of the outside frame accenting the bridge''s color.', '2003-03-10 09:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(232859, 13930, 6817, '<td valign="top">Although this is a gorgeous gorgeous image, I''m working to hard to find the bridge. This would be better in landscapes.</td>', 'Although this is a gorgeous gorgeous image, I''m working to hard to find the bridge. This would be better in landscapes.', '2003-03-10 09:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(232860, 13818, 6886, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2003-03-10 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(232861, 13541, 6886, '<td valign="top">Wow..great shot</td>', 'Wow..great shot', '2003-03-10 09:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(232862, 13558, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like this shot in Black &amp; White</td>', 'I like this shot in Black & White', '2003-03-10 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(232867, 13911, 6532, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.</td>', 'Good contrast.', '2003-03-10 10:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(232872, 13873, 6966, '<td valign="top">I am rather new to this so technically I can''t comment, but asthetically... I like the composition. Good perspective and hazy &amp; sharp at the same time</td>', 'I am rather new to this so technically I can''t comment, but asthetically... I like the composition. Good perspective and hazy & sharp at the same time', '2003-03-10 10:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(232873, 13588, 6806, '<td valign="top">beautiful color</td>', 'beautiful color', '2003-03-10 10:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(232874, 13659, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very unique bridge.  I like this photo and the setting but I think it may have been a little stronger composition has you brought the angle down a bit and shot it a little more from the side rather than from the top.  Very nice though!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very unique bridge.  I like this photo and the setting but I think it may have been a little stronger composition has you brought the angle down a bit and shot it a little more from the side rather than from the top.  Very nice though!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(232876, 13686, 6806, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-03-10 10:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(232877, 13955, 6806, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2003-03-10 10:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
