(232886, 13789, 6806, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2003-03-10 10:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(232887, 13659, 6806, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2003-03-10 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(232889, 13825, 6458, '<td valign="top">Seems like there''s too much foreground in this picture. Also the bit on the right pulls the eye to it, perhaps this would have been better cropped out.</td>', 'Seems like there''s too much foreground in this picture. Also the bit on the right pulls the eye to it, perhaps this would have been better cropped out.', '2003-03-10 10:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(232894, 13750, 6424, '<td valign="top">very nice image. this ia a wonderful print, its in focus and is very sharp, nice job 10</td>', 'very nice image. this ia a wonderful print, its in focus and is very sharp, nice job 10', '2003-03-10 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(232895, 13683, 6424, '<td valign="top">wonderful print, it looks fantastic 9</td>', 'wonderful print, it looks fantastic 9', '2003-03-10 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(232896, 13827, 6097, '<td valign="top">Looks like you are another of the unlucky that have lots of snow still on the ground.  I am fortunate that most of it here in MD (USA) has melted.  I think this shot suffers a bit because of all the snow.  Not much could be helped there though.  I would be interested to see this shot again when the snow is gone and there is some added color by the surrounding shrubs and such.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like you are another of the unlucky that have lots of snow still on the ground.  I am fortunate that most of it here in MD (USA) has melted.  I think this shot suffers a bit because of all the snow.  Not much could be helped there though.  I would be interested to see this shot again when the snow is gone and there is some added color by the surrounding shrubs and such.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(232897, 13648, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really wish this was all in focus, but it''s a nice idea. Even having the middle string in focus would have made me happy. It''s just the foreground draws my attention and leaves me unsatisfied, not being able to make out any detail.</td>', 'I really wish this was all in focus, but it''s a nice idea. Even having the middle string in focus would have made me happy. It''s just the foreground draws my attention and leaves me unsatisfied, not being able to make out any detail.', '2003-03-10 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
