(232904, 13574, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject.  Maybe just a tad bit overexposed but very nice composition.  I would have liked it a bit better if the birds hadn''t intruded in the upper left corner.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice subject.  Maybe just a tad bit overexposed but very nice composition.  I would have liked it a bit better if the birds hadn''t intruded in the upper left corner.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
