(232915, 13638, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful bridge!  Nice composition and the boat adds a nice touch to the photo.  IMO it''s just a little dark and I would have liked to see the image a bit larger.  Maybe try to submit your picture at the maximum 640 on the long side (I realize depending on crop this isn''t always possible).  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very beautiful bridge!  Nice composition and the boat adds a nice touch to the photo.  IMO it''s just a little dark and I would have liked to see the image a bit larger.  Maybe try to submit your picture at the maximum 640 on the long side (I realize depending on crop this isn''t always possible).  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
