(232963, 13673, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but IMO it is just a bit overexposed.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition but IMO it is just a bit overexposed.  Good luck!', '2003-03-10 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(232967, 13940, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject but the sky is well overexposed.  At the same time I do understand that it was necessary to overexpose in that area to get proper exposure on the main subject (the bridge).  More than likely a result of the cloudy day.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Nice composition and subject but the sky is well overexposed.  At the same time I do understand that it was necessary to overexpose in that area to get proper exposure on the main subject (the bridge).  More than likely a result of the cloudy day.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(232971, 13559, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject and composition but it looks like you ran in to the same issue as a lot of others for this challenge.  Overexposed sky.  :-|  In this photo it sort of gives a dreamy feeling though.  That''s the only way I can explain it.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice subject and composition but it looks like you ran in to the same issue as a lot of others for this challenge.  Overexposed sky.  :-|  In this photo it sort of gives a dreamy feeling though.  That''s the only way I can explain it.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 10:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
