(233295, 13640, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good motion stop, but weak composition. A bit too much bullseye, including more of the bridge (don''t worry about cutting of a large section of the left) would position the dog more to the left. Avoid putting the horizon line (here it is in front of the bridge) in the middle. Remember to keep space in the front of the dog, you need to show space where it can run into like you did here.</td>', 'Good motion stop, but weak composition. A bit too much bullseye, including more of the bridge (don''t worry about cutting of a large section of the left) would position the dog more to the left. Avoid putting the horizon line (here it is in front of the bridge) in the middle. Remember to keep space in the front of the dog, you need to show space where it can run into like you did here.', '2003-03-10 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
