(233345, 13843, 3032, '<td valign="top">Detail and sharpness is lost by using a too low jpeg quality. A bit of a shame as I would have liked to see the ''what seem to be flamingo''s'' in detail. Trees give the composition some punch. Avoid positioning the subject horinzon in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Detail and sharpness is lost by using a too low jpeg quality. A bit of a shame as I would have liked to see the ''what seem to be flamingo''s'' in detail. Trees give the composition some punch. Avoid positioning the subject horinzon in the middle of the frame.', '2003-03-10 13:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(233346, 13671, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice image i like it</td>', 'nice image i like it', '2003-03-10 13:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233347, 13591, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, dimensions, detail, focus. How much has the sepia tone really added to it? sure it works, but I''m a bit fed up with all the dreamy b&amp;w type approaches. Not marking you down excessively for it, be assured.</td>', 'Nice framing, dimensions, detail, focus. How much has the sepia tone really added to it? sure it works, but I''m a bit fed up with all the dreamy b&w type approaches. Not marking you down excessively for it, be assured.', '2003-03-10 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233349, 13793, 6913, '<td valign="top">I think the image woould have been stronger if you desaturated all grass as well leaving only the umbrella to stand out</td>', 'I think the image woould have been stronger if you desaturated all grass as well leaving only the umbrella to stand out', '2003-03-10 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(233351, 13531, 3032, '<td valign="top">Aha, perhaps the most famous bridge of the world.<br/>Basically nice composition, I wonder if I really like the tilt of the towers. I think that getting the horizon straight would show the building leaning forward. Probably caused by using a wideanlge lens (keystoning). <br/>Good detail and sharpness.</td>', 'Aha, perhaps the most famous bridge of the world.Basically nice composition, I wonder if I really like the tilt of the towers. I think that getting the horizon straight would show the building leaning forward. Probably caused by using a wideanlge lens (keystoning). Good detail and sharpness.', '2003-03-10 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(233352, 13809, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - is this the Orwell Bridge in Suffolk? Certainly looks like it: I almost drove out to shoot it myself, if it is. Not sure the white balance works for the sky (and here is a lot of sky here). Good stuff.</td>', 'Nice shot - is this the Orwell Bridge in Suffolk? Certainly looks like it: I almost drove out to shoot it myself, if it is. Not sure the white balance works for the sky (and here is a lot of sky here). Good stuff.', '2003-03-10 13:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(233354, 13538, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great perspective... nice, clean shot!</td>', 'Great perspective... nice, clean shot!', '2003-03-10 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(233355, 13561, 7033, '<td valign="top">I love your color saturation!  Nice twist on the subject, too!</td>', 'I love your color saturation!  Nice twist on the subject, too!', '2003-03-10 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(233356, 13831, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice aerial perspective and I love the way the bridge disappears into the background. I do wish however that the shadow area of the mountain contained a little bit more detail and also wish the sky wasn''t blown out. Possibly the use of a polarizing lens filter and a little bit more exposure would have soloved these problems.</td>', 'Very nice aerial perspective and I love the way the bridge disappears into the background. I do wish however that the shadow area of the mountain contained a little bit more detail and also wish the sky wasn''t blown out. Possibly the use of a polarizing lens filter and a little bit more exposure would have soloved these problems.', '2003-03-10 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(233358, 13788, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail, good focus. Not sure the verticals are vertical, if you see what I mean: check the nearest pillar - it seems to be leaning over. Also, some noise in the sky. It looks like it would hae been fantastic in colour too ...</td>', 'Good detail, good focus. Not sure the verticals are vertical, if you see what I mean: check the nearest pillar - it seems to be leaning over. Also, some noise in the sky. It looks like it would hae been fantastic in colour too ...', '2003-03-10 13:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(233360, 13564, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool fisheye effect. The lines and vignetting in the edge makes this a powerful composition. Excellent exposure, good sky, nice toning. One of my favs.</td>', 'Wow, cool fisheye effect. The lines and vignetting in the edge makes this a powerful composition. Excellent exposure, good sky, nice toning. One of my favs.', '2003-03-10 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233363, 13963, 3032, '<td valign="top">That''s an incomplete dam. :)<br/>Nice landscape.</td>', 'That''s an incomplete dam. :)Nice landscape.', '2003-03-10 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(233364, 13835, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and I like the earth colors too...I do wish the sky wasn''t so blown out and also find the metal plate in the background to be distracting.</td>', 'Interesting angle and I like the earth colors too...I do wish the sky wasn''t so blown out and also find the metal plate in the background to be distracting.', '2003-03-10 13:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(233367, 13550, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great golden colors of the underside of the bridge. Also like the composition and angle of the shot.</td>', 'Great golden colors of the underside of the bridge. Also like the composition and angle of the shot.', '2003-03-10 13:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(233368, 13764, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the bridge leads you into the frame and how the people are framed by the trees and stone pillars. Like the mood created by the mist.</td>', 'Nice how the bridge leads you into the frame and how the people are framed by the trees and stone pillars. Like the mood created by the mist.', '2003-03-10 13:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(233369, 13971, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of this picture but find it a bit too underexposed</td>', 'I like the starkness of this picture but find it a bit too underexposed', '2003-03-10 13:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(233370, 13793, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea to include an object that is totally alien to its surroundings. The first thing you look at is the bridge on the top and it gives a B&amp;W expectation. What a shock it is when you go down and are confronted by a big blue umbrella!<br/>Great photo!</td>', 'Great idea to include an object that is totally alien to its surroundings. The first thing you look at is the bridge on the top and it gives a B&W expectation. What a shock it is when you go down and are confronted by a big blue umbrella!Great photo!', '2003-03-10 13:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(233371, 13766, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but it seems a little underexposed to me.</td>', 'Nice shot but it seems a little underexposed to me.', '2003-03-10 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(233372, 13641, 3032, '<td valign="top">O yes, original. Good idea, nice composition.</td>', 'O yes, original. Good idea, nice composition.', '2003-03-10 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(233373, 13939, 5822, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and contrast. Very unique looking shot as well.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and contrast. Very unique looking shot as well.', '2003-03-10 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(233374, 13657, 2279, '<td valign="top">I think if you got closer or maybe shot it from the other side would have improved this shot. All of the branches in the way of the bridge distract too much and take away from the main subject of this shot.</td>', 'I think if you got closer or maybe shot it from the other side would have improved this shot. All of the branches in the way of the bridge distract too much and take away from the main subject of this shot.', '2003-03-10 13:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
