(233383, 13766, 5865, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a bridge like that one before.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a bridge like that one before.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-10 13:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233384, 13690, 6504, '<td valign="top">The picture is a little muddy.  If you had taken it on a day with a little more light, or opened up the aperture a little, this could hve been excellent.</td>', 'The picture is a little muddy.  If you had taken it on a day with a little more light, or opened up the aperture a little, this could hve been excellent.', '2003-03-10 13:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(233385, 13551, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and capture of the ligh/shadows. I guess there is only a short time that this situation exists. <br/>It is like looking into a mirror against a mirror, a seemingly never ending repetition fading into the distance. Nice how the sun gives colors to the stones. Too bad that there is a fence and barb wire there. :(</td>', 'Excellent composition and capture of the ligh/shadows. I guess there is only a short time that this situation exists. It is like looking into a mirror against a mirror, a seemingly never ending repetition fading into the distance. Nice how the sun gives colors to the stones. Too bad that there is a fence and barb wire there. :(', '2003-03-10 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(233386, 13778, 5865, '<td valign="top">The photograph seems a little bland.  Perhaps if you used an unusual viewpoint it would make things look more interesting.</td>', 'The photograph seems a little bland.  Perhaps if you used an unusual viewpoint it would make things look more interesting.', '2003-03-10 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233388, 13811, 6504, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure out that is a respresentation of a bridge, then I had a big smile. Very clever, and you did a good job with the snow.   Maybe you could have taken it from another angle eliminating the little containers across the way</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure out that is a respresentation of a bridge, then I had a big smile. Very clever, and you did a good job with the snow.   Maybe you could have taken it from another angle eliminating the little containers across the way', '2003-03-10 13:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(233391, 13835, 5865, '<td valign="top">A nice angle of view and the contrast in colour between the bridge and green foliage is nice too.</td>', 'A nice angle of view and the contrast in colour between the bridge and green foliage is nice too.', '2003-03-10 13:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(233394, 13706, 6791, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth of field! DEEP</td>', 'Excellent depth of field! DEEP', '2003-03-10 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(233395, 13655, 6504, '<td valign="top">Your title''s clever but I don''t get the one old, two new maybe I''m a little dense.<br/>The messiness in the middle is a little distracting, but you would have had a job on your hands trying to clean it up.  The compostion is good.</td>', 'Your title''s clever but I don''t get the one old, two new maybe I''m a little dense.The messiness in the middle is a little distracting, but you would have had a job on your hands trying to clean it up.  The compostion is good.', '2003-03-10 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(233396, 13688, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and nice composition, but it looks extremely soft and lacks detail. This is most certainly caused by using a too low jpeg quality. The max filesize is 150kb, this one is 40! There is plenty of room to save at a higher quality, it will give much more detail, better edge sharpness and will get rid of the soft look.<br/>It could look great.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and nice composition, but it looks extremely soft and lacks detail. This is most certainly caused by using a too low jpeg quality. The max filesize is 150kb, this one is 40! There is plenty of room to save at a higher quality, it will give much more detail, better edge sharpness and will get rid of the soft look.It could look great.', '2003-03-10 13:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(233397, 13802, 5865, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t like to be driving along that one ;)  An unusual shot that makes me look a bit longer.</td>', 'I wouldn''t like to be driving along that one ;)  An unusual shot that makes me look a bit longer.', '2003-03-10 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(233398, 13588, 6999, '<td valign="top">great to be able to spot all these London/UK photographers here. Like this a lot - I missed out Blackfriars on my walk up the river, and now really wish I hadn''t. :-) Really like the red/cream/black metal, and rivets. The bricks, and the flaring of the sky distract from things for me, but not too massively. Good work.</td>', 'great to be able to spot all these London/UK photographers here. Like this a lot - I missed out Blackfriars on my walk up the river, and now really wish I hadn''t. :-) Really like the red/cream/black metal, and rivets. The bricks, and the flaring of the sky distract from things for me, but not too massively. Good work.', '2003-03-10 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(233399, 13794, 6504, '<td valign="top">Ooh. Pretty.  I love the colors and the twinkles make it surreal.  Beautifully done</td>', 'Ooh. Pretty.  I love the colors and the twinkles make it surreal.  Beautifully done', '2003-03-10 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(233400, 13675, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity that there isn''t a canal underneath it, but that is a lovely bridge.</td>', 'It''s a pity that there isn''t a canal underneath it, but that is a lovely bridge.', '2003-03-10 13:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(233401, 13845, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very charming.  I know snow is hard to photograph but you did a good job with it.<br/>Very nice subtle colors.</td>', 'Very charming.  I know snow is hard to photograph but you did a good job with it.Very nice subtle colors.', '2003-03-10 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(233402, 13645, 5865, '<td valign="top">Very attractive shot.  I am just wondering why the water is so calm.  The trees act as a frame too.</td>', 'Very attractive shot.  I am just wondering why the water is so calm.  The trees act as a frame too.', '2003-03-10 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233403, 13816, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.  The waves are swaying with the bridge.  What about if it were a little lighter, I think it would have been excellent with more light.</td>', 'Very unusual.  The waves are swaying with the bridge.  What about if it were a little lighter, I think it would have been excellent with more light.', '2003-03-10 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(233404, 13940, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s a pit that metal sign is in the way.  I think it detracts from the image.  I always like to see covered bridges though as we don''t seem to have any in the U.K.</td>', 'It''s a pit that metal sign is in the way.  I think it detracts from the image.  I always like to see covered bridges though as we don''t seem to have any in the U.K.', '2003-03-10 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(233405, 13652, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot - way more interesting than the other Golden gate shot I''ve seen so far. A little ''noisy'' though - grainy.</td>', 'Fascinating shot - way more interesting than the other Golden gate shot I''ve seen so far. A little ''noisy'' though - grainy.', '2003-03-10 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(233406, 13707, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape and I like the way you captured the color of the water. I do find that the trees, and especially the bridge, is a bit too underexposed.</td>', 'Wonderful landscape and I like the way you captured the color of the water. I do find that the trees, and especially the bridge, is a bit too underexposed.', '2003-03-10 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(233407, 13562, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh my, looks like you were in a dangerous spot for this picture.  The things we do for a challenge.  I woud have tried this with less traffic, it''s a little distracting from the good lines.</td>', 'Oh my, looks like you were in a dangerous spot for this picture.  The things we do for a challenge.  I woud have tried this with less traffic, it''s a little distracting from the good lines.', '2003-03-10 13:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(233408, 13797, 5865, '<td valign="top">It looks as though it is going to fall down any minute :)  I think the unusual shape of the top of the bridge definately adds interest to the shot.</td>', 'It looks as though it is going to fall down any minute :)  I think the unusual shape of the top of the bridge definately adds interest to the shot.', '2003-03-10 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(233409, 13697, 3032, '<td valign="top">Detail is ruined by a much too low jpeg quality. This one is 40 out of 150kb, there is a lot of room for better compression (less of it!). It would look less soft, edges sharper and render more detail.</td>', 'Detail is ruined by a much too low jpeg quality. This one is 40 out of 150kb, there is a lot of room for better compression (less of it!). It would look less soft, edges sharper and render more detail.', '2003-03-10 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(233410, 13832, 6504, '<td valign="top">The bottom left of the picture is tood dark.  Other than that, everything looks good.</td>', 'The bottom left of the picture is tood dark.  Other than that, everything looks good.', '2003-03-10 13:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(233411, 13559, 6999, '<td valign="top">very good - great detail and atmosphere, especially on the foreground. I wonder if you might have tried a slightly faster exposure to lose some of the flare out of the top left corner - looks like the foreground would have borne it to me. Or you might even have cropped some )more) of the top out? - The menu bar of my pc has it framed that way as I write, and I think it looks great! Up with the best this week though.</td>', 'very good - great detail and atmosphere, especially on the foreground. I wonder if you might have tried a slightly faster exposure to lose some of the flare out of the top left corner - looks like the foreground would have borne it to me. Or you might even have cropped some )more) of the top out? - The menu bar of my pc has it framed that way as I write, and I think it looks great! Up with the best this week though.', '2003-03-10 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(233412, 13930, 5865, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to see the end of the bridge, it seems to get lost in the colour of the buildings.  I think that detracts from the image somewhat.  The buildings do not appear to be sharp either.  I am wondering if a UV filter may have helped things.  It''s a great scene though.</td>', 'It is difficult to see the end of the bridge, it seems to get lost in the colour of the buildings.  I think that detracts from the image somewhat.  The buildings do not appear to be sharp either.  I am wondering if a UV filter may have helped things.  It''s a great scene though.', '2003-03-10 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(233413, 13565, 6791, '<td valign="top">Classic Beauty!!!</td>', 'Classic Beauty!!!', '2003-03-10 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(233414, 13648, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see an original idea.  Well done for that.  I''m not sure about having the far string in focus and the foreground out of focus.  It might have looked better if it was the other way around.</td>', 'It''s good to see an original idea.  Well done for that.  I''m not sure about having the far string in focus and the foreground out of focus.  It might have looked better if it was the other way around.', '2003-03-10 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(233416, 13873, 5865, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful shot.  I am not sure how it was achieved, but it is a lovely effect.  I like the sepia colour too.</td>', 'That''s a beautiful shot.  I am not sure how it was achieved, but it is a lovely effect.  I like the sepia colour too.', '2003-03-10 13:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(233417, 13581, 6999, '<td valign="top">What''s gone on here? Seems to have been enormously over-sharpened, lots of pixel problems - and is that a fingerprint on the lens? And I don''t get there being someone stood on the bridge who wasn''t worth getting in shot.</td>', 'What''s gone on here? Seems to have been enormously over-sharpened, lots of pixel problems - and is that a fingerprint on the lens? And I don''t get there being someone stood on the bridge who wasn''t worth getting in shot.', '2003-03-10 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(233418, 13636, 3942, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week. A very clear and brilliant picture, I like your composition too. IMHO there is nearly nothing, what you could have done better. O.K., perhaps it could be a little better without the hidden car behind the balustrade or you could have waited for a bus or truck, which is better visible. But that''s only marginal! Good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week. A very clear and brilliant picture, I like your composition too. IMHO there is nearly nothing, what you could have done better. O.K., perhaps it could be a little better without the hidden car behind the balustrade or you could have waited for a bus or truck, which is better visible. But that''s only marginal! Good luck for the challenge!', '2003-03-10 13:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(233419, 13538, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2003-03-10 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(233420, 13625, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think there is a little too much vying for my attention here, particularly in the foreground.  I don''t know how it could be improved upon, but perhaps if a telephoto lens was used to get nearer to the subject.  An interesting scene though.</td>', 'I think there is a little too much vying for my attention here, particularly in the foreground.  I don''t know how it could be improved upon, but perhaps if a telephoto lens was used to get nearer to the subject.  An interesting scene though.', '2003-03-10 13:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(233421, 13574, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a very well composed shot.  The actual bridge goes straight through the middle of the image dividing two separate areas; the buildings in the background and the water in the foreground.  It is very pleasing to look at.</td>', 'I think that this is a very well composed shot.  The actual bridge goes straight through the middle of the image dividing two separate areas; the buildings in the background and the water in the foreground.  It is very pleasing to look at.', '2003-03-10 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(233422, 13833, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot - the saturation really works well here, almost an impression of daylight at night. Love the foreground reflections too. The winner so far, for me (that, by the way, seems to almost guarantee you little success :-))</td>', 'Very nice shot - the saturation really works well here, almost an impression of daylight at night. Love the foreground reflections too. The winner so far, for me (that, by the way, seems to almost guarantee you little success :-))', '2003-03-10 13:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(233424, 13651, 5865, '<td valign="top">Original shot.  I like the movement and the idea being portrayed.  Well done.</td>', 'Original shot.  I like the movement and the idea being portrayed.  Well done.', '2003-03-10 13:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(233425, 13659, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh thank you - a properly exposed digi photo. So few others managed it! Doesn''t quite have the leap-out-of-the-screen quality that my favourites have, but great effort all the same.</td>', 'Oh thank you - a properly exposed digi photo. So few others managed it! Doesn''t quite have the leap-out-of-the-screen quality that my favourites have, but great effort all the same.', '2003-03-10 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(233426, 13816, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting, good freezing of the waves. The road to IJburg, the killing of Durgerdam''s view on the Zuiderzee. :(</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting, good freezing of the waves. The road to IJburg, the killing of Durgerdam''s view on the Zuiderzee. :(', '2003-03-10 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(233427, 13650, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp and clear and wonderful lighting. Excellent perspective. I like the way the bridge begins at the center of the fram on the left and extends all the way to the corner of the frame on the right. 10!</td>', 'Beautifully sharp and clear and wonderful lighting. Excellent perspective. I like the way the bridge begins at the center of the fram on the left and extends all the way to the corner of the frame on the right. 10!', '2003-03-10 14:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(233428, 13687, 3032, '<td valign="top">When photographing old subjects like this one, try to avoid including modern stuff like cars and such. Sometimes you have to wait a long time, been there done that. Some people walking on the path would be ok though.</td>', 'When photographing old subjects like this one, try to avoid including modern stuff like cars and such. Sometimes you have to wait a long time, been there done that. Some people walking on the path would be ok though.', '2003-03-10 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(233429, 13584, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - pity about the quality issues, but I guess they''re the camera, certainly looks that way. have you tried a version without the cars at the foot of the image? They might ground everything, but they also seem like a distraction.</td>', 'Very nice photo - pity about the quality issues, but I guess they''re the camera, certainly looks that way. have you tried a version without the cars at the foot of the image? They might ground everything, but they also seem like a distraction.', '2003-03-10 14:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(233431, 13800, 5822, '<td valign="top">Where''s the jaggies??? I see none, so you must have one of those 5 megapix cameras...great detail and wonderful lighting.</td>', 'Where''s the jaggies??? I see none, so you must have one of those 5 megapix cameras...great detail and wonderful lighting.', '2003-03-10 14:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(233433, 13690, 5822, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed, but the subject is inherently interesting and I like the sepia tones to convey the feeling of history here.</td>', 'A bit underexposed, but the subject is inherently interesting and I like the sepia tones to convey the feeling of history here.', '2003-03-10 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(233434, 13977, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh I like this - DOF, those curves, the repetitions of the balustrades and their shadows ... I have reservations about the b&amp;w though - looks like it might have been a quite high-colour scene, though I guess the flare out out the sky is more bearable in monochrome.</td>', 'Oh I like this - DOF, those curves, the repetitions of the balustrades and their shadows ... I have reservations about the b&w though - looks like it might have been a quite high-colour scene, though I guess the flare out out the sky is more bearable in monochrome.', '2003-03-10 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(233439, 13844, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty - but the white balance is out - thus the blue/green of the snow and the green tinge to the sky. It''s correctable, and I can''t see why you haven''t.</td>', 'Pretty - but the white balance is out - thus the blue/green of the snow and the green tinge to the sky. It''s correctable, and I can''t see why you haven''t.', '2003-03-10 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(233442, 13562, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice angle and good print quality.</td>', 'nice angle and good print quality.', '2003-03-10 14:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(233444, 13690, 6202, '<td valign="top">This photo is very interesting, I would love to know exactly what is oing on here.</td>', 'This photo is very interesting, I would love to know exactly what is oing on here.', '2003-03-10 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233445, 13978, 6480, '<td valign="top">i really like the top half of the photo, but i don''t understand the bottom half. the print quality is nice too.</td>', 'i really like the top half of the photo, but i don''t understand the bottom half. the print quality is nice too.', '2003-03-10 14:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(233446, 13799, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that by putting some more emphasis on the bridge would have created a little more intrest to the picture although it is  a very good image to use nice work</td>', 'I think that by putting some more emphasis on the bridge would have created a little more intrest to the picture although it is  a very good image to use nice work', '2003-03-10 14:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(233447, 13737, 6480, '<td valign="top">Nice! i really like the color of the bridge and the background is really cool also.</td>', 'Nice! i really like the color of the bridge and the background is really cool also.', '2003-03-10 14:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233448, 13788, 6454, '<td valign="top">I like the view that you used to take this picture. Nice Work</td>', 'I like the view that you used to take this picture. Nice Work', '2003-03-10 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(233449, 13745, 4729, '<td valign="top">Intriguing! Where does it go? Nice shot...</td>', 'Intriguing! Where does it go? Nice shot...', '2003-03-10 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(233450, 13748, 3942, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this creative shot! It''s refreshing to see a different and unique picture among all the "usual" bridges. Personally I like the result of your work very much (voted 10). IMO the color and composition are well chosen, the technical execution is well done too. I''m not completely sure, how you did it. My first thought was double exposure. But where the light stripes out of the lamps are coming from? Now I think, you changed the camera position on the tripod. But then the stripes  should be vertical. Did you rotated it additionally? However (I come back in a week) a highly interesting photo. Thanks for sharing and giving me food for thought!!! Good luck for the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Congrats on this creative shot! It''s refreshing to see a different and unique picture among all the "usual" bridges. Personally I like the result of your work very much (voted 10). IMO the color and composition are well chosen, the technical execution is well done too. I''m not completely sure, how you did it. My first thought was double exposure. But where the light stripes out of the lamps are coming from? Now I think, you changed the camera position on the tripod. But then the stripes  should be vertical. Did you rotated it additionally? However (I come back in a week) a highly interesting photo. Thanks for sharing and giving me food for thought!!! Good luck for the challenge!', '2003-03-10 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(233451, 13889, 6454, '<td valign="top">I like the way in which you shot this picture it was done very nicely. Good work</td>', 'I like the way in which you shot this picture it was done very nicely. Good work', '2003-03-10 14:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(233452, 13750, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice print quality, the mood is conveyed really nicely also.</td>', 'nice print quality, the mood is conveyed really nicely also.', '2003-03-10 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(233453, 13547, 6450, '<td valign="top">good photo, but i think its too dark</td>', 'good photo, but i think its too dark', '2003-03-10 14:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(233454, 13912, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Very clear and the lighting has a great effect on the excellent quality of the image.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Very clear and the lighting has a great effect on the excellent quality of the image.', '2003-03-10 14:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(233456, 13801, 6907, '<td valign="top">I like your curvy image composition.</td>', 'I like your curvy image composition.', '2003-03-10 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(233457, 13570, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that thel ighting to thisp icture dosent help out the picture. There is to much light comming in from the back. It was a good image though nice work.</td>', 'I think that thel ighting to thisp icture dosent help out the picture. There is to much light comming in from the back. It was a good image though nice work.', '2003-03-10 14:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(233458, 13595, 6480, '<td valign="top">bridge out of focus...you should have gotten closer to the subject.</td>', 'bridge out of focus...you should have gotten closer to the subject.', '2003-03-10 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(233459, 13814, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that by adding some more light under the bridge would have helped out the picture alot.</td>', 'I think that by adding some more light under the bridge would have helped out the picture alot.', '2003-03-10 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(233460, 13529, 6480, '<td valign="top">confusing picture...the subject is not emphasised very well</td>', 'confusing picture...the subject is not emphasised very well', '2003-03-10 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(233461, 13764, 6451, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.  I really like how the lighting and the fogginess make the picture stand out. The focus of the image was also very nicely planed. Good job.</td>', 'Awesome picture.  I really like how the lighting and the fogginess make the picture stand out. The focus of the image was also very nicely planed. Good job.', '2003-03-10 14:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(233462, 13873, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Seen it before? But so well done, it doesn''t matter too much. I''ll have to see just how close to that other shot it is though ... which I have, and of course it''s really quite different. Great tones, great light, great detail, composition. I think you''re the first 9 this week</td>', 'Lovely. Seen it before? But so well done, it doesn''t matter too much. I''ll have to see just how close to that other shot it is though ... which I have, and of course it''s really quite different. Great tones, great light, great detail, composition. I think you''re the first 9 this week', '2003-03-10 14:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(233463, 13744, 6454, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture wa done very nicely good work</td>', 'I think that this picture wa done very nicely good work', '2003-03-10 14:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(233465, 13975, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The colors are great and the sunset added a lot to the image.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The colors are great and the sunset added a lot to the image.  Good job.', '2003-03-10 14:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(233466, 13770, 6450, '<td valign="top">good photo, i like how the bridge goes completly horizontal across the pic..</td>', 'good photo, i like how the bridge goes completly horizontal across the pic..', '2003-03-10 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(233467, 13571, 6454, '<td valign="top">This picture was done very nicely good work.</td>', 'This picture was done very nicely good work.', '2003-03-10 14:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(233468, 13770, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of framing technique, great composition.<br/>Nice toning</td>', 'Excellent use of framing technique, great composition.Nice toning', '2003-03-10 14:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(233469, 13558, 6450, '<td valign="top">good photo, i like the idea.</td>', 'good photo, i like the idea.', '2003-03-10 14:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(233470, 13710, 6450, '<td valign="top">good photo, i like the idea.</td>', 'good photo, i like the idea.', '2003-03-10 14:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(233471, 13737, 6450, '<td valign="top">good photo, i like the idea and the colors.</td>', 'good photo, i like the idea and the colors.', '2003-03-10 14:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(233472, 13794, 6454, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in the picture good work</td>', 'I like the lighting in the picture good work', '2003-03-10 14:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
