(233657, 13833, 5865, '<td valign="top">The colour in this shot is outstanding.  I love the reflections on the water in the foreground too.  The trees make for a nice frame for the subject and the rocks add some texture.  I really like the photograph.</td>', 'The colour in this shot is outstanding.  I love the reflections on the water in the foreground too.  The trees make for a nice frame for the subject and the rocks add some texture.  I really like the photograph.', '2003-03-10 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
