(233914, 13740, 6097, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.  I can lightly see the bridge but I wish the bridge had stood out just a bit more since the bridge is supposed to be the subject for this challenge.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.  I can lightly see the bridge but I wish the bridge had stood out just a bit more since the bridge is supposed to be the subject for this challenge.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2003-03-10 17:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
