(233916, 13723, 4494, '<td valign="top">:( it''s too small (the picture itself).  Did you know you can have a 640x480 pixel picture?</td>', ':( it''s too small (the picture itself).  Did you know you can have a 640x480 pixel picture?', '2003-03-10 17:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(233917, 13845, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice covered bridge.  Good composition and good exposure.  Getting the right exposure with snow on the ground can be very difficult.  Good shot.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Nice covered bridge.  Good composition and good exposure.  Getting the right exposure with snow on the ground can be very difficult.  Good shot.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 17:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(233918, 13573, 6150, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love pictures taken at sunset.  The colors are so much more vibrant.  Worth a 10 for sure.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love pictures taken at sunset.  The colors are so much more vibrant.  Worth a 10 for sure.', '2003-03-10 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(233921, 13735, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting bridge that might have potential... the false color and overexposed shot just don''t do it for me, though.</td>', 'Interesting bridge that might have potential... the false color and overexposed shot just don''t do it for me, though.', '2003-03-10 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(233922, 13940, 4494, '<td valign="top">Need to use a polarizing filter.  That would have prevented the bright white sky.  Plus you need to rotate your pic to the left a degree or 2.  Looks like a nice old bridge however!</td>', 'Need to use a polarizing filter.  That would have prevented the bright white sky.  Plus you need to rotate your pic to the left a degree or 2.  Looks like a nice old bridge however!', '2003-03-10 17:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233923, 13797, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very cool and interesting looking bridge.  Nice perspective in this shot.  I like that you used B&amp;W here but I would also like to have seen this shot in color.  Good exposure.  Maybe you could have sharpened up just a tad.  Looks just a little soft IMO.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very cool and interesting looking bridge.  Nice perspective in this shot.  I like that you used B&W here but I would also like to have seen this shot in color.  Good exposure.  Maybe you could have sharpened up just a tad.  Looks just a little soft IMO.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 17:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(233924, 13971, 6900, '<td valign="top">This bridge makes me want to jump off of one...but it''s not high enough!</td>', 'This bridge makes me want to jump off of one...but it''s not high enough!', '2003-03-10 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(233925, 13697, 4494, '<td valign="top">The focus isn''t very good.  Nice angle on the bridges however.</td>', 'The focus isn''t very good.  Nice angle on the bridges however.', '2003-03-10 17:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(233926, 13581, 6536, '<td valign="top">I like that it is in black &amp; white. I would have maybe cropped it differently by showing the entire person or maybe taken the picture as vertical.</td>', 'I like that it is in black & white. I would have maybe cropped it differently by showing the entire person or maybe taken the picture as vertical.', '2003-03-10 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(233927, 13818, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I really like that you used a slower shutter speed here to give a feel of motion to the water below.  Nice perspective in this shot.  Very interesting lines.  Great work!  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I really like that you used a slower shutter speed here to give a feel of motion to the water below.  Nice perspective in this shot.  Very interesting lines.  Great work!  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(233928, 13599, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range-- the oranges really bring out the character of the aging concrete.</td>', 'Nice tonal range-- the oranges really bring out the character of the aging concrete.', '2003-03-10 17:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
