(233945, 13974, 4494, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  Great job!  It''s a tiny bit on the under-exposed but the blur (or whatever you used) more then makes up for it.  8.</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  Great job!  It''s a tiny bit on the under-exposed but the blur (or whatever you used) more then makes up for it.  8.', '2003-03-10 17:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(233946, 13690, 6097, '<td valign="top">Is this actually a bridge?  Looks more like a pier?  Photo feels old.  If that''s what you were going for you have accomplished this.  Because the structures look old and are falling down I feel that the old feel fits well.  The sepia tone also adds a nice touch IMO.  Good work!  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Is this actually a bridge?  Looks more like a pier?  Photo feels old.  If that''s what you were going for you have accomplished this.  Because the structures look old and are falling down I feel that the old feel fits well.  The sepia tone also adds a nice touch IMO.  Good work!  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
