(233954, 13822, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat interesting shot.  I like how all of the lines come together in the center of the shot.  Very interesting.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'This is a really neat interesting shot.  I like how all of the lines come together in the center of the shot.  Very interesting.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-10 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
