(233972, 13729, 2823, '<td valign="top">maybe could have benefitted from a change in colour tone...  channel mixer?  greyscale?  and the right side of the bridge is cut off...</td>', 'maybe could have benefitted from a change in colour tone...  channel mixer?  greyscale?  and the right side of the bridge is cut off...', '2003-03-10 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
