(233976, 13664, 4494, '<td valign="top">The quality of the picture is really bad.  Everything is blurry and washed out.  Looks like you scanned a really old picture with a $20 scanner.  I love the perspective of the shot however but the pic quality isn''t there. :(</td>', 'The quality of the picture is really bad.  Everything is blurry and washed out.  Looks like you scanned a really old picture with a $20 scanner.  I love the perspective of the shot however but the pic quality isn''t there. :(', '2003-03-10 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
