(233980, 13831, 7033, '<td valign="top">I love the highlights on the substructure of the bridge, but the darkness of the bottom of the frame overwhelms the shot.  Perhaps it would benefit from a slight increase in gamma?</td>', 'I love the highlights on the substructure of the bridge, but the darkness of the bottom of the frame overwhelms the shot.  Perhaps it would benefit from a slight increase in gamma?', '2003-03-10 17:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
