(234070, 13681, 4494, '<td valign="top">Exposure is terrible.  Use "Exposure Lock" next time if your camera has it...  Focus/zoom on the bridge (which is darker) and then hold the "Exposure Lock" button.  This will retain the expsure setting.. Then zoom out/recompose the shot to include the snow and then snap it.  <br/></td>', 'Exposure is terrible.  Use "Exposure Lock" next time if your camera has it...  Focus/zoom on the bridge (which is darker) and then hold the "Exposure Lock" button.  This will retain the expsure setting.. Then zoom out/recompose the shot to include the snow and then snap it.  ', '2003-03-10 18:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
