(234141, 13552, 806, '<td valign="top">please turn off the date/time stamp on your camera.<br/>You must have taken this photo while traveling in your car. Pretty cool bridge. Too bad you couldn''t get a better view over the guard rail.</td>', 'please turn off the date/time stamp on your camera.You must have taken this photo while traveling in your car. Pretty cool bridge. Too bad you couldn''t get a better view over the guard rail.', '2003-03-10 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
