(234236, 13930, 6328, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the skyline and the bridge, but the bridge sort of washes out suddenly into the darker buildings of the skyline. . .  I sure like the way the buildings reflect back onto the water!</td>', 'Good shot of the skyline and the bridge, but the bridge sort of washes out suddenly into the darker buildings of the skyline. . .  I sure like the way the buildings reflect back onto the water!', '2003-03-10 20:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
