(234451, 13678, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the "present" bridge really dominates -- I almost missed the "past" one.  Interesting take.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the "present" bridge really dominates -- I almost missed the "past" one.  Interesting take.', '2003-03-10 22:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
