(234459, 13564, 7222, '<td valign="top">Wow, unusual perspective, very original picture. Good, I''m tired of seing those same old shots of this bridge. Very well done.</td>', 'Wow, unusual perspective, very original picture. Good, I''m tired of seing those same old shots of this bridge. Very well done.', '2003-03-10 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(234460, 13876, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the colour and the perspective shown by the pairs of cables.</td>', 'I like the colour and the perspective shown by the pairs of cables.', '2003-03-10 22:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(234461, 13627, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this is a fairly unexciting shot.  I also wonder if b&amp;w really adds anything to this shot.</td>', 'Unfortunately this is a fairly unexciting shot.  I also wonder if b&w really adds anything to this shot.', '2003-03-10 22:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(234462, 13873, 7222, '<td valign="top">Wow, very well done. Love it. You got my best vote so far.</td>', 'Wow, very well done. Love it. You got my best vote so far.', '2003-03-10 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(234465, 13936, 1647, '<td valign="top">I might have tried taking this shot from lower down - closer to the water.  The image also looks slightly over sharpened in some places.  Having said that - nice idea and I do like the reflections of the water</td>', 'I might have tried taking this shot from lower down - closer to the water.  The image also looks slightly over sharpened in some places.  Having said that - nice idea and I do like the reflections of the water', '2003-03-10 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(234467, 13571, 1647, '<td valign="top">The image is very soft - which makes it feel like an old photo...  Very nice.  The thing I don''t like about this photo is the border - too chunky and absolute in it''s colours.  Perhaps a thinner black, with a fine off-white inner line would be better.</td>', 'The image is very soft - which makes it feel like an old photo...  Very nice.  The thing I don''t like about this photo is the border - too chunky and absolute in it''s colours.  Perhaps a thinner black, with a fine off-white inner line would be better.', '2003-03-10 22:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(234470, 13827, 1647, '<td valign="top">Such a dramatic crop for a photo that is supposed to be of a bridge.  With the snow I had to look for a minute to identify the bridge properly.  An interesting shot, but not what I would consider a good shot of a bridge.</td>', 'Such a dramatic crop for a photo that is supposed to be of a bridge.  With the snow I had to look for a minute to identify the bridge properly.  An interesting shot, but not what I would consider a good shot of a bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(234474, 13796, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - one of the very few "interesting" photo''s this week.  Normally I don''t like negative-style photo''s but this works so well.  Also, great composition and focus.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this photo - one of the very few "interesting" photo''s this week.  Normally I don''t like negative-style photo''s but this works so well.  Also, great composition and focus.  Well done.', '2003-03-10 23:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(234478, 13969, 1647, '<td valign="top">So many pretty lights.  It''s a really nice photo, but it is hard to see the bridge (except the main pier).  Very crisp for a long exposure.</td>', 'So many pretty lights.  It''s a really nice photo, but it is hard to see the bridge (except the main pier).  Very crisp for a long exposure.', '2003-03-10 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(234481, 13844, 1647, '<td valign="top">You''re bridge is very small, but being so isolated it kind of becomes a focal point.  The tree and the building do compete for attention though.  I wonder if a shot closer to the bridge, taken from close to the ground, would have worked better.  That aside your focus and exposure is very good.</td>', 'You''re bridge is very small, but being so isolated it kind of becomes a focal point.  The tree and the building do compete for attention though.  I wonder if a shot closer to the bridge, taken from close to the ground, would have worked better.  That aside your focus and exposure is very good.', '2003-03-10 23:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(234482, 13683, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but would have chanced walking through and not having the movoment.</td>', 'I like the shot, but would have chanced walking through and not having the movoment.', '2003-03-10 23:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(234484, 13641, 3569, '<td valign="top">interesting take, sharpness very good<br/></td>', 'interesting take, sharpness very good', '2003-03-10 23:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(234485, 13719, 1647, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you didn''t focus purely on the main bridge structure - it has some great shapes in it.  Your border is nice - it ties in with the size of the bridge.</td>', 'I wonder why you didn''t focus purely on the main bridge structure - it has some great shapes in it.  Your border is nice - it ties in with the size of the bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(234487, 13565, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wow, blue sky!</td>', 'Wow, blue sky!', '2003-03-10 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(234489, 13746, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like the perspective on the bridge.  I might have considered cropping the right edge a bit closer (between the two upright posts) so that the top of the bridge disappears closer to the corner, rather than near the middle.  I like the colours and texture in the wood.  Focus (being on the nearest upright) is wonderful.  Well done</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like the perspective on the bridge.  I might have considered cropping the right edge a bit closer (between the two upright posts) so that the top of the bridge disappears closer to the corner, rather than near the middle.  I like the colours and texture in the wood.  Focus (being on the nearest upright) is wonderful.  Well done', '2003-03-10 23:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(234490, 13652, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great study...</td>', 'Great study...', '2003-03-10 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(234492, 13842, 1647, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the left edge being cropped out.  Focus is good though.</td>', 'I don''t like the left edge being cropped out.  Focus is good though.', '2003-03-10 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(234493, 13783, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the colour and light of this shot - looks like late afternoon or early morning according to the shadows.  The water hasa nice texture.  Is this bridge curved?  If not, I might have tried to be more central between the pilons.</td>', 'I like the colour and light of this shot - looks like late afternoon or early morning according to the shadows.  The water hasa nice texture.  Is this bridge curved?  If not, I might have tried to be more central between the pilons.', '2003-03-10 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(234494, 13528, 3569, '<td valign="top">Beaufiful...</td>', 'Beaufiful...', '2003-03-10 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(234495, 13595, 1647, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped more of the road out (maybe the bottom third of the picture) and tried to show more detail on the bridge.  It looks like it would have some real character up close.</td>', 'I would have cropped more of the road out (maybe the bottom third of the picture) and tried to show more detail on the bridge.  It looks like it would have some real character up close.', '2003-03-10 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(234497, 13761, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the nearest bridge is a touch too close to the top of the photo.  Also the right pilons is partly cropped - I would have included the entire pilon.  The bird is a nice addition and doesn''t steal the photo from the bridge.</td>', 'I think the nearest bridge is a touch too close to the top of the photo.  Also the right pilons is partly cropped - I would have included the entire pilon.  The bird is a nice addition and doesn''t steal the photo from the bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(234498, 13584, 1647, '<td valign="top">The tops of the cars are a little distracting but I''m not sure that cropping them out would help since you''d lose the bottom of the pilons.  I like the perspective of the bridge.</td>', 'The tops of the cars are a little distracting but I''m not sure that cropping them out would help since you''d lose the bottom of the pilons.  I like the perspective of the bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(234500, 13744, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.   You might have tried cropping just right of the sign to cut out the pole and sign.</td>', 'Nice photo.   You might have tried cropping just right of the sign to cut out the pole and sign.', '2003-03-10 23:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(234501, 13818, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the structure of this bridge, and the long exposure on the water is a nice inclusion - but thankfully doesn''t steal the focal point away from the bridge.  Great work.</td>', 'I love the structure of this bridge, and the long exposure on the water is a nice inclusion - but thankfully doesn''t steal the focal point away from the bridge.  Great work.', '2003-03-10 23:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(234502, 13770, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  A bit different view.  Nice shot looking out at the larger part of the bridge.</td>', 'Hmm.  A bit different view.  Nice shot looking out at the larger part of the bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(234503, 13690, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the title - very witty.  The photo has an old quality to it (both in the subjects photoed and the sepia toning).  I like it.  The person on the beach is a little bit distracting, but nothing major.</td>', 'I like the title - very witty.  The photo has an old quality to it (both in the subjects photoed and the sepia toning).  I like it.  The person on the beach is a little bit distracting, but nothing major.', '2003-03-10 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(234505, 13960, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - a reflection in the water flipped upside down.  A little more clarity would be better, but I''m sure you had no control over the smoothness of the water.  Colours are nice.</td>', 'Interesting photo - a reflection in the water flipped upside down.  A little more clarity would be better, but I''m sure you had no control over the smoothness of the water.  Colours are nice.', '2003-03-10 23:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(234507, 13823, 6328, '<td valign="top">I''m from this area, and you could have gotten a better picture than this.  It seems a mite out of focus for some reason or other.  Why not back up to the other side and get a shot of the entire bridge showing the ocean off, too?</td>', 'I''m from this area, and you could have gotten a better picture than this.  It seems a mite out of focus for some reason or other.  Why not back up to the other side and get a shot of the entire bridge showing the ocean off, too?', '2003-03-10 23:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(234508, 13698, 3569, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2003-03-10 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(234511, 13969, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-03-10 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(234512, 13783, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hey.  Nice photo.  almost wish you were a bit more centered so you could see right through there like a tunnel!  Like the colour on the concrete.  And the shadows created by the sun.  Nice job.</td>', 'Hey.  Nice photo.  almost wish you were a bit more centered so you could see right through there like a tunnel!  Like the colour on the concrete.  And the shadows created by the sun.  Nice job.', '2003-03-10 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(234513, 13801, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  You''ve captured a really nice photograph.  That curve in the wall leads you straight into the bridge on the other side.  good job, good color.</td>', 'Nice work.  You''ve captured a really nice photograph.  That curve in the wall leads you straight into the bridge on the other side.  good job, good color.', '2003-03-10 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(234515, 13543, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts...</td>', 'Nice contrasts...', '2003-03-10 23:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(234516, 13575, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Colours are nice.  Blue bridge, nicely painted, unusual color for a bridge.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Colours are nice.  Blue bridge, nicely painted, unusual color for a bridge.', '2003-03-10 23:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(234517, 13821, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Almost didn''t see that bridge.  The reflections of the tree''s on the water make a nice photo.</td>', 'Wow.  Almost didn''t see that bridge.  The reflections of the tree''s on the water make a nice photo.', '2003-03-10 23:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(234518, 13528, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice and diferent for the Challenge.</td>', 'Nice and diferent for the Challenge.', '2003-03-10 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
