(234897, 13680, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is a nice twist to the bridges them.  Very nice shot.  Can''t really make out what this is in the reflection but I think it is a little distracting.  I think this would have been a stronger guitar bridge shot had you used artificial lighting and minimized any reflection in the gloss finish of the guitar.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'This is a nice twist to the bridges them.  Very nice shot.  Can''t really make out what this is in the reflection but I think it is a little distracting.  I think this would have been a stronger guitar bridge shot had you used artificial lighting and minimized any reflection in the gloss finish of the guitar.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-11 10:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(234898, 13776, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a good photo composition and I like the toning as well, but I am at a complete loss as to how this fits in the ''bridge'' theme... - setzler</td>', 'This is definitely a good photo composition and I like the toning as well, but I am at a complete loss as to how this fits in the ''bridge'' theme... - setzler', '2003-03-11 10:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
