(234917, 13551, 6667, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...Super effect.  Title is right on and fits the theme.  Hope you are up there in the ratings.  Good luck. Qyestion though, was there a deck on this bridge?</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...Super effect.  Title is right on and fits the theme.  Hope you are up there in the ratings.  Good luck. Qyestion though, was there a deck on this bridge?', '2003-03-11 11:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
