(235193, 13975, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like this photo - although the sky seems to have a purple tinge to it.  Did you fiddle with the colours of this photo or did the whitebalance go a little silly?  I like the stillness of the water and the focus is quite good.</td>', 'I like this photo - although the sky seems to have a purple tinge to it.  Did you fiddle with the colours of this photo or did the whitebalance go a little silly?  I like the stillness of the water and the focus is quite good.', '2003-03-11 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
