(235199, 13882, 1647, '<td valign="top">This bridge looks really interesting - I''d love to see it in action.  Good composition.</td>', 'This bridge looks really interesting - I''d love to see it in action.  Good composition.', '2003-03-11 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
