(235203, 13822, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry of this bridge/tridge.  Your title is witty also.  This is one of the few photo''s this week worthy of printing - well done.</td>', 'I love the symmetry of this bridge/tridge.  Your title is witty also.  This is one of the few photo''s this week worthy of printing - well done.', '2003-03-11 16:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(235204, 13746, 7244, '<td valign="top">This is one of those things you love finding out in the woods.  Found one once before.</td>', 'This is one of those things you love finding out in the woods.  Found one once before.', '2003-03-11 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(235205, 13835, 7244, '<td valign="top">INteresting but fuzzy</td>', 'INteresting but fuzzy', '2003-03-11 16:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(235206, 13755, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - was is necessary to go black and white though?  The reflection in the water is very good.</td>', 'Great photo - was is necessary to go black and white though?  The reflection in the water is very good.', '2003-03-11 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(235207, 13802, 7244, '<td valign="top">Looks like the end of the bridge under construction in West Palm Beach at I 95 interchange at the airport.  Can''t remember the road name.</td>', 'Looks like the end of the bridge under construction in West Palm Beach at I 95 interchange at the airport.  Can''t remember the road name.', '2003-03-11 16:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(235209, 13764, 7244, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing and setting</td>', 'Interesting framing and setting', '2003-03-11 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(235210, 13808, 7244, '<td valign="top">I like the "out of the box" thinking.</td>', 'I like the "out of the box" thinking.', '2003-03-11 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(235211, 13940, 1647, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had weather similar to myself!  I like the bridge however the sky is a little bright - perhaps you could have used curves in photoshop to wind it back a little.</td>', 'Looks like you had weather similar to myself!  I like the bridge however the sky is a little bright - perhaps you could have used curves in photoshop to wind it back a little.', '2003-03-11 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(235212, 13831, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - such as interesting time to take this shot.  It''s very dark and moody, but that works kind of well.</td>', 'Good work - such as interesting time to take this shot.  It''s very dark and moody, but that works kind of well.', '2003-03-11 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(235214, 13818, 3032, '<td valign="top">That''s a powerful leading line trough this photo. I like it how it seems to cut the scene in half, the stream beneath it, the forest behind it. The color of it fits the image and the way the lines of the bridge itself work is cool. <br/>Motion of the water adds dynamics. Good job.</td>', 'That''s a powerful leading line trough this photo. I like it how it seems to cut the scene in half, the stream beneath it, the forest behind it. The color of it fits the image and the way the lines of the bridge itself work is cool. Motion of the water adds dynamics. Good job.', '2003-03-11 16:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(235219, 13939, 1647, '<td valign="top">It seems that the plant in the foreground is in focus rather than the bridge - perhaps I don''t understand the title.  For the challenge though I think the bridge should have been in focus.  Other than that it''s a good shot.</td>', 'It seems that the plant in the foreground is in focus rather than the bridge - perhaps I don''t understand the title.  For the challenge though I think the bridge should have been in focus.  Other than that it''s a good shot.', '2003-03-11 16:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(235223, 13648, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I''m not sure why you chose to focus in the furthest string, rather than the middle one.  I like the border, I love the lighting - it''s really a good shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I''m not sure why you chose to focus in the furthest string, rather than the middle one.  I like the border, I love the lighting - it''s really a good shot.', '2003-03-11 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(235229, 13678, 2223, '<td valign="top">wow, this is beautiful! you got the right time of day to get the perfect  highlights and shadows, good job.</td>', 'wow, this is beautiful! you got the right time of day to get the perfect  highlights and shadows, good job.', '2003-03-11 17:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(235231, 13975, 2223, '<td valign="top">very pretty, how did you get those colors? almost looks painted.</td>', 'very pretty, how did you get those colors? almost looks painted.', '2003-03-11 17:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
