(235497, 13602, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very well executed photo.  Nice and simple and effective!  The pale sky and the foreground are complimentary, and the bridge is emotive.  Only suggestion is to think about making more or less use of the water under the bridge.  Watch the rule of thirds.  Well done!</td>', 'Very well executed photo.  Nice and simple and effective!  The pale sky and the foreground are complimentary, and the bridge is emotive.  Only suggestion is to think about making more or less use of the water under the bridge.  Watch the rule of thirds.  Well done!', '2003-03-11 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(235498, 13827, 6328, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice if you''d shot from a bit further back and shown more bridge instead of shooting straight down like this.  it lacks something like this. . .</td>', 'Would have been nice if you''d shot from a bit further back and shown more bridge instead of shooting straight down like this.  it lacks something like this. . .', '2003-03-11 21:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
