(235515, 13599, 6328, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like a column of a bridge.  I don''t see what you''re trying to tell me though.</td>', 'Sure looks like a column of a bridge.  I don''t see what you''re trying to tell me though.', '2003-03-11 21:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(235516, 13575, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but i think you should have taken the photo closer to the bridge. (i''m sure that would have been hard to do because that would be in the water) but it''s still good</td>', 'nice picture, but i think you should have taken the photo closer to the bridge. (i''m sure that would have been hard to do because that would be in the water) but it''s still good', '2003-03-11 21:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(235517, 13783, 6480, '<td valign="top">good job, this picture is much better than most of the ones from underneath a bridge because you can actually tell what this image is of...well done</td>', 'good job, this picture is much better than most of the ones from underneath a bridge because you can actually tell what this image is of...well done', '2003-03-11 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(235518, 13695, 6480, '<td valign="top">i don''t really like the trees on the left side and the photo looks kind of blurry. it''s not a bad picture though..</td>', 'i don''t really like the trees on the left side and the photo looks kind of blurry. it''s not a bad picture though..', '2003-03-11 21:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(235519, 13791, 4877, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Like the style and the use of curves in the bridge to good effect!  Good depth and leading.  Makes me wonder what I''ll find at the end of the bridge.  The bright end point could possibly have been used to more effect by having someone stand there, or another object to give a silhouette effect...  Well done!</td>', 'Nice picture.  Like the style and the use of curves in the bridge to good effect!  Good depth and leading.  Makes me wonder what I''ll find at the end of the bridge.  The bright end point could possibly have been used to more effect by having someone stand there, or another object to give a silhouette effect...  Well done!', '2003-03-11 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(235520, 13824, 6480, '<td valign="top">i like the b&amp;w, nice mood conveyed</td>', 'i like the b&w, nice mood conveyed', '2003-03-11 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(235521, 13823, 6480, '<td valign="top">good angle, the water looks nice too</td>', 'good angle, the water looks nice too', '2003-03-11 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(235523, 13793, 4877, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of colour!  Love the combination of greens and blues, with an almost B&amp;W background.  Nice use of the tracks and the curve in the bridge.  Touch of fall colours in the leaves adds that little extra depth to the photo.  You''ve done yourself proud.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Brilliant use of colour!  Love the combination of greens and blues, with an almost B&W background.  Nice use of the tracks and the curve in the bridge.  Touch of fall colours in the leaves adds that little extra depth to the photo.  You''ve done yourself proud.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-03-11 21:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(235524, 13800, 6480, '<td valign="top">geez, this is too good. great angle and clarity 8</td>', 'geez, this is too good. great angle and clarity 8', '2003-03-11 21:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(235525, 13609, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice angle, but i think there is too much going on at the top of the photo</td>', 'nice angle, but i think there is too much going on at the top of the photo', '2003-03-11 21:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(235526, 13701, 6480, '<td valign="top">Nice Angle</td>', 'Nice Angle', '2003-03-11 21:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(235527, 13940, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but i think it would have been better in b&amp;w.</td>', 'nice photo, but i think it would have been better in b&w.', '2003-03-11 21:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(235528, 13842, 6480, '<td valign="top">it does seem to tell a story..well done</td>', 'it does seem to tell a story..well done', '2003-03-11 21:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(235529, 13809, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice angle and clarity</td>', 'nice angle and clarity', '2003-03-11 21:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(235530, 13767, 6480, '<td valign="top">nice job, i like the angle you shot this photo in..</td>', 'nice job, i like the angle you shot this photo in..', '2003-03-11 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(235531, 13846, 4877, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, like the bridge of choice and the waterfall in the background.  Seems a little complicated and distracting with so many points of interest, it takes a brief second to locate the bridge itself.  Under the circumstances (snow etc) you have done well.  I like the splashes of green to break up the snow a bit.  Image may have lost some impact through compression.</td>', 'Nice setting, like the bridge of choice and the waterfall in the background.  Seems a little complicated and distracting with so many points of interest, it takes a brief second to locate the bridge itself.  Under the circumstances (snow etc) you have done well.  I like the splashes of green to break up the snow a bit.  Image may have lost some impact through compression.', '2003-03-11 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(235532, 13976, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The track reflection is superb!  Excellent lighting and tone to the photo.  Bridge element fits the challenge well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful!  The track reflection is superb!  Excellent lighting and tone to the photo.  Bridge element fits the challenge well.  Good luck!', '2003-03-11 21:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(235534, 13680, 4877, '<td valign="top">Nice variation on the "bridge" theme.  I really like the reflections in the guitar, and the colour.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice variation on the "bridge" theme.  I really like the reflections in the guitar, and the colour.  Well done!', '2003-03-11 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(235535, 13528, 4877, '<td valign="top">Nice use of nature to fulfill the "bridge" theme!  I think it is a nice photo, well thought out.  Seems to have lost some clarity through image compression though.</td>', 'Nice use of nature to fulfill the "bridge" theme!  I think it is a nice photo, well thought out.  Seems to have lost some clarity through image compression though.', '2003-03-11 21:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(235536, 13549, 6667, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...Can I ask why you went to black and white when you entitled it "rusty"? How about sepia?</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...Can I ask why you went to black and white when you entitled it "rusty"? How about sepia?', '2003-03-11 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(235537, 13619, 6505, '<td valign="top">Way too much going on here.  Lets see, should i focus on the yucas, or the plane, or that tree to the left.  Oh, i almost forgot about the bridge and i can''t really see it.  I do like the colors though.</td>', 'Way too much going on here.  Lets see, should i focus on the yucas, or the plane, or that tree to the left.  Oh, i almost forgot about the bridge and i can''t really see it.  I do like the colors though.', '2003-03-11 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(235538, 13589, 4877, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has captured the essence of the location!  Great use of the bridge to break the image into two distinct backgrounds!  Well composed.  I like it a lot!</td>', 'I think this photo has captured the essence of the location!  Great use of the bridge to break the image into two distinct backgrounds!  Well composed.  I like it a lot!', '2003-03-11 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(235540, 13745, 6938, '<td valign="top">Cool the way it makes you want to step on and follow the track `round the corner.  The lean is a bit distracting once you notice it.  Its great how the greens and the sharpness make the bridge stand out.  Excellent selection of a unique bridge.</td>', 'Cool the way it makes you want to step on and follow the track `round the corner.  The lean is a bit distracting once you notice it.  Its great how the greens and the sharpness make the bridge stand out.  Excellent selection of a unique bridge.', '2003-03-11 21:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(235541, 13903, 1666, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Shot. I think thios is the winner.</td>', 'Fantastic Shot. I think thios is the winner.', '2003-03-11 21:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(235542, 13960, 4877, '<td valign="top">Made me think for a second :-)  Interesting use of reflection to protray the bridge.  I think it is very creative and nice colours, but it is hard to look at for long periods of time since there is no clear definition of a subject.  If the water was dead still I think this would have been great!  Points for creativity!</td>', 'Made me think for a second :-)  Interesting use of reflection to protray the bridge.  I think it is very creative and nice colours, but it is hard to look at for long periods of time since there is no clear definition of a subject.  If the water was dead still I think this would have been great!  Points for creativity!', '2003-03-11 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(235544, 13794, 4536, '<td valign="top">Awesome, my favorite so far. Compositionally excellent and your choice to shoot at night makes this shot work. The only thing I don''t like is the building being slightly blurred.</td>', 'Awesome, my favorite so far. Compositionally excellent and your choice to shoot at night makes this shot work. The only thing I don''t like is the building being slightly blurred.', '2003-03-11 21:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(235548, 13532, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  Amazing use of light to good effect.  Adds a little mystery to the shot.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Very interesting!  Amazing use of light to good effect.  Adds a little mystery to the shot.  Keep up the good work!', '2003-03-11 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(235550, 13695, 4877, '<td valign="top">Love the curves.  Very good detail photo and well composed!</td>', 'Love the curves.  Very good detail photo and well composed!', '2003-03-11 22:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(235552, 13713, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Nice colour contrasts and intricate detail in the bridge, stonework and trees.  Great composition! Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Nice colour contrasts and intricate detail in the bridge, stonework and trees.  Great composition! Well done!', '2003-03-11 22:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(235554, 13948, 6597, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2003-03-11 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(235555, 13852, 6597, '<td valign="top">Father and Son add to the photography</td>', 'Father and Son add to the photography', '2003-03-11 22:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(235557, 13835, 4877, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting.  I dont mind that there are soft points in this photo.  I like the emotive effect you have achieved.  Nice subtle detail in the wood grain, and the composition is brilliant!  Well done!</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting.  I dont mind that there are soft points in this photo.  I like the emotive effect you have achieved.  Nice subtle detail in the wood grain, and the composition is brilliant!  Well done!', '2003-03-11 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(235558, 13584, 6505, '<td valign="top">Needs to be cropped higher - above cars.  There looks to be alot of noise or jpg artifacts.  Both these issues make a 7 point shot a 5.</td>', 'Needs to be cropped higher - above cars.  There looks to be alot of noise or jpg artifacts.  Both these issues make a 7 point shot a 5.', '2003-03-11 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(235559, 13821, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and looks like a fun place to photograph. I think that you should crop a bit off the bottom, the blue at the bottom distracts.</td>', 'This is interesting and looks like a fun place to photograph. I think that you should crop a bit off the bottom, the blue at the bottom distracts.', '2003-03-11 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(235561, 13841, 2170, '<td valign="top">Stark coloring gives this the look of a 40s or 50s postcard -- excellent!  The tree branches distract somewhat, but overall a strong image.</td>', 'Stark coloring gives this the look of a 40s or 50s postcard -- excellent!  The tree branches distract somewhat, but overall a strong image.', '2003-03-11 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(235562, 13861, 2170, '<td valign="top">You can almost see the bus from "Speed" leaping over the gap.</td>', 'You can almost see the bus from "Speed" leaping over the gap.', '2003-03-11 22:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(235563, 13532, 2170, '<td valign="top">The image is too dark, unfortunately, to see what exactly is going on.  That''s unfortunate, as the detail in the water and the crisp focus make this seem like it could be an excellent photo.</td>', 'The image is too dark, unfortunately, to see what exactly is going on.  That''s unfortunate, as the detail in the water and the crisp focus make this seem like it could be an excellent photo.', '2003-03-11 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(235564, 13969, 2170, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty difficult to discernthe bridge in the foreground from the background of this photo.  The bridges in the far background are the ones that most pop out at me, but I don''t think that was your intent?</td>', 'It''s pretty difficult to discernthe bridge in the foreground from the background of this photo.  The bridges in the far background are the ones that most pop out at me, but I don''t think that was your intent?', '2003-03-11 22:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(235565, 13701, 2170, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the angle of this, but the post in the foreground is SO prominent that it takes away from the rest of the bridge.  I could see this photo cropped without the post and presented as a tall and skinny image to balance out the depth of the bridge.</td>', 'I really enjoy the angle of this, but the post in the foreground is SO prominent that it takes away from the rest of the bridge.  I could see this photo cropped without the post and presented as a tall and skinny image to balance out the depth of the bridge.', '2003-03-11 22:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(235567, 13589, 6110, '<td valign="top">spectacular view.</td>', 'spectacular view.', '2003-03-11 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(235568, 13644, 2170, '<td valign="top">The trees, unfortunately, take away from the image of the bridge.  Instead of making it look abandoned, they just look kind of in the way.</td>', 'The trees, unfortunately, take away from the image of the bridge.  Instead of making it look abandoned, they just look kind of in the way.', '2003-03-11 22:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(235569, 13543, 2170, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  Although the image looks dark and sinister, I''m just twisted enough to love it.</td>', 'Beautiful!!  Although the image looks dark and sinister, I''m just twisted enough to love it.', '2003-03-11 22:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(235572, 13876, 4877, '<td valign="top">I like the depth!  Effective use of a well known icon!</td>', 'I like the depth!  Effective use of a well known icon!', '2003-03-11 22:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(235573, 13772, 2170, '<td valign="top">nice image...and although i don''t much care for borders, this is very very nicely framed.</td>', 'nice image...and although i don''t much care for borders, this is very very nicely framed.', '2003-03-11 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(235574, 13674, 2170, '<td valign="top">My bridge picture was taken over a Sugar Creek too!  And it''s a covered bridge too!  Oh, yeah...nice image.  :)</td>', 'My bridge picture was taken over a Sugar Creek too!  And it''s a covered bridge too!  Oh, yeah...nice image.  :)', '2003-03-11 22:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(235575, 13808, 6340, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I was looking for a photo that was an original "bridge" and found it here.</td>', 'Clever.  I was looking for a photo that was an original "bridge" and found it here.', '2003-03-11 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(235576, 13876, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and great use of the rule of thirds.<br/></td>', 'Nicely framed and great use of the rule of thirds.', '2003-03-11 22:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(235577, 13552, 6340, '<td valign="top">Hazy.  Time in corner is aggravating.  See no purpose in it.</td>', 'Hazy.  Time in corner is aggravating.  See no purpose in it.', '2003-03-11 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(235578, 13822, 6110, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.</td>', 'excellent composition.', '2003-03-11 22:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(235579, 13830, 6340, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Just a little too much open space for my taste.</td>', 'Cool.  Just a little too much open space for my taste.', '2003-03-11 22:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(235580, 13878, 2170, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Fabulous image.  Definitely ribbon-worthy.  Great capture with the fog.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Fabulous image.  Definitely ribbon-worthy.  Great capture with the fog.', '2003-03-11 22:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(235581, 13762, 6340, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2003-03-11 22:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(235582, 13670, 6340, '<td valign="top">Nice but little interest.</td>', 'Nice but little interest.', '2003-03-11 22:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(235583, 13603, 2170, '<td valign="top">I would NOT want to cross that bridge.  <br/> <br/>I see where you are going with this, comparing the tiny bridge with the awesomeness of the gorge -- but in this case, I think the bridge might be too teeny.  You can barely see it, and definitely can''t really tell that it''s the subject of the photo.</td>', 'I would NOT want to cross that bridge.   I see where you are going with this, comparing the tiny bridge with the awesomeness of the gorge -- but in this case, I think the bridge might be too teeny.  You can barely see it, and definitely can''t really tell that it''s the subject of the photo.', '2003-03-11 22:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(235584, 13835, 6340, '<td valign="top">Fuzzy focus but I like it.  Colors comfortable.</td>', 'Fuzzy focus but I like it.  Colors comfortable.', '2003-03-11 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(235585, 13576, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, historic and emotive!  I''m a history buff and love images like this!  Well executed photo!  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful, historic and emotive!  I''m a history buff and love images like this!  Well executed photo!  Good luck!', '2003-03-11 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(235587, 13564, 2170, '<td valign="top">What an interesting capture!  I enjoy this quite a bit.</td>', 'What an interesting capture!  I enjoy this quite a bit.', '2003-03-11 22:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(235589, 13549, 6340, '<td valign="top">Bold.  A fun perspective.  Being black and white works for this photo.</td>', 'Bold.  A fun perspective.  Being black and white works for this photo.', '2003-03-11 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(235590, 13680, 2170, '<td valign="top">Peekaboo...I see you.</td>', 'Peekaboo...I see you.', '2003-03-11 22:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(235591, 13768, 6340, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-03-11 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(235592, 13644, 6340, '<td valign="top">The bridge being closed is a nice twist.</td>', 'The bridge being closed is a nice twist.', '2003-03-11 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(235593, 13974, 2170, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft focus and coloring.  Very excellent.</td>', 'Lovely soft focus and coloring.  Very excellent.', '2003-03-11 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(235594, 13701, 6340, '<td valign="top">A strong photo.</td>', 'A strong photo.', '2003-03-11 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(235595, 13872, 6803, '<td valign="top">Photo could use more color</td>', 'Photo could use more color', '2003-03-11 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(235596, 13686, 6340, '<td valign="top">Over exposed?  Out of focus.</td>', 'Over exposed?  Out of focus.', '2003-03-11 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(235597, 13651, 2170, '<td valign="top">Fun!  Great idea!</td>', 'Fun!  Great idea!', '2003-03-11 22:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(235598, 13641, 6340, '<td valign="top">Clever. Nice photo technique.</td>', 'Clever. Nice photo technique.', '2003-03-11 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(235599, 13794, 2170, '<td valign="top">This may have been more powerful in black and white...  The greenishness of the castle is odd when contrasted with the gold of the bridge -- and the sky wouldn''t have the green overcast either.</td>', 'This may have been more powerful in black and white...  The greenishness of the castle is odd when contrasted with the gold of the bridge -- and the sky wouldn''t have the green overcast either.', '2003-03-11 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(235600, 13802, 2170, '<td valign="top">Adjusting the levels of this would make the colors pop better, I''ll bet.</td>', 'Adjusting the levels of this would make the colors pop better, I''ll bet.', '2003-03-11 22:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(235601, 13543, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of contrasts.  I like the shot.  Well composed!</td>', 'Very interesting use of contrasts.  I like the shot.  Well composed!', '2003-03-11 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(235602, 13833, 6340, '<td valign="top">Love the sparkles.  Would have been more dramatic if top of picture was cut off -- but of course, that''s where the bridge is...</td>', 'Love the sparkles.  Would have been more dramatic if top of picture was cut off -- but of course, that''s where the bridge is...', '2003-03-11 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(235603, 13940, 6340, '<td valign="top">Hazy.</td>', 'Hazy.', '2003-03-11 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(235604, 13818, 6340, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water was captured.</td>', 'I like the way the water was captured.', '2003-03-11 22:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(235605, 13740, 2170, '<td valign="top">The bridge is way too dark.  I would completely miss it if I weren''t looking for it.</td>', 'The bridge is way too dark.  I would completely miss it if I weren''t looking for it.', '2003-03-11 22:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(235606, 13793, 6340, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the umbrella but I love the rest of the picture.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the umbrella but I love the rest of the picture.', '2003-03-11 22:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(235609, 13747, 6340, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2003-03-11 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(235610, 13781, 6340, '<td valign="top">The shadows are nice.  I liked the way the photo did not come out hazy on a hazy day.</td>', 'The shadows are nice.  I liked the way the photo did not come out hazy on a hazy day.', '2003-03-11 22:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
