(235723, 13662, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of curves, lighting and reflection!  You''ve done a great job capturing this bridge!  Well composed, and has a great mood.  Would have liked to see a larger version of this image!  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful use of curves, lighting and reflection!  You''ve done a great job capturing this bridge!  Well composed, and has a great mood.  Would have liked to see a larger version of this image!  Well done!', '2003-03-12 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
