(236105, 13750, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2003-03-12 15:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(236115, 13821, 6458, '<td valign="top">This shot is really really eye catching, but it suffers technically. It seems washed out, and the bridge is hiding back there. All the white makes it hard to focus on anything. A little bit of post-processing would have made this better, I think. Perhaps increasing the contrast and decreasing the brightness would be all it would have taken. Needless, great photo!</td>', 'This shot is really really eye catching, but it suffers technically. It seems washed out, and the bridge is hiding back there. All the white makes it hard to focus on anything. A little bit of post-processing would have made this better, I think. Perhaps increasing the contrast and decreasing the brightness would be all it would have taken. Needless, great photo!', '2003-03-12 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(236116, 13803, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo.. all the blue negative space is wonderful. However, I wish there was more detail on the bridge to the right - it looks like you used neatimage and it erased much of that detail. Too bad! 8 for a great photo anyway!</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo.. all the blue negative space is wonderful. However, I wish there was more detail on the bridge to the right - it looks like you used neatimage and it erased much of that detail. Too bad! 8 for a great photo anyway!', '2003-03-12 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(236117, 13597, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the covered bridge pictures, in my opinion. You''ve resisted the temptation to show the whole bridge, and instead shown us something that makes it more than just another bridge! Congrats on a good photo!</td>', 'This is the best of the covered bridge pictures, in my opinion. You''ve resisted the temptation to show the whole bridge, and instead shown us something that makes it more than just another bridge! Congrats on a good photo!', '2003-03-12 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
