(236209, 13690, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting photo... the sepia gives it a nice sense of age but the exposure is just a little dark and the tonal range is a little flat also... I could be wrong, but this looks like a pier moreso than a bridge... good luck :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting photo... the sepia gives it a nice sense of age but the exposure is just a little dark and the tonal range is a little flat also... I could be wrong, but this looks like a pier moreso than a bridge... good luck :) - setzler', '2003-03-12 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(236212, 13814, 3569, '<td valign="top">Over-exposed a bit on leve paintings.  4th street ?</td>', 'Over-exposed a bit on leve paintings.  4th street ?', '2003-03-12 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(236216, 13777, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great timing anfd shot....</td>', 'Great timing anfd shot....', '2003-03-12 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(236219, 13611, 2361, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone further reduces what little interest there is in this picture.</td>', 'The sepia tone further reduces what little interest there is in this picture.', '2003-03-12 17:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(236226, 13833, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, I really like the foreground very much!  As the picture goes into the distance, it''s attraction lowers.  The bridge is very dark and lacks detail (it looks like it could be a really cool bridge!).  6 Swash</td>', 'Ohhh, I really like the foreground very much!  As the picture goes into the distance, it''s attraction lowers.  The bridge is very dark and lacks detail (it looks like it could be a really cool bridge!).  6 Swash', '2003-03-12 18:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(236227, 13948, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really good focus on the subject bridge.  Railing seems too new for sepia, though the rock piling seems to fit it.  I have to ask:  why such a (I am assuming) small portion of the bridge?  6 Swash</td>', 'Really good focus on the subject bridge.  Railing seems too new for sepia, though the rock piling seems to fit it.  I have to ask:  why such a (I am assuming) small portion of the bridge?  6 Swash', '2003-03-12 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(236229, 13591, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, me thinks I scored this one too quickly.....It has grown on me considerably.  I really like the old buildings in the far background.  Use of sepia seems very appropriate here.  (Wish the sky was just a bit more dramatic, but that''s not fair to score against)  Score upgrade from 6 to 9 (really blew this one!!  Sorry)  Swash</td>', 'Hmmm, me thinks I scored this one too quickly.....It has grown on me considerably.  I really like the old buildings in the far background.  Use of sepia seems very appropriate here.  (Wish the sky was just a bit more dramatic, but that''s not fair to score against)  Score upgrade from 6 to 9 (really blew this one!!  Sorry)  Swash', '2003-03-12 18:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(236230, 13674, 6328, '<td valign="top">you''ve got a lovely photograph here, the white railings leading up to the red covered bridge looks great as does the stone pillars/supports.  nice coloring on the ground and river/ice too. nice sharp focus/image.</td>', 'you''ve got a lovely photograph here, the white railings leading up to the red covered bridge looks great as does the stone pillars/supports.  nice coloring on the ground and river/ice too. nice sharp focus/image.', '2003-03-12 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(236231, 13707, 6328, '<td valign="top">The snow and rushing water looks great but your bridge looks out of focus and loses color. . .</td>', 'The snow and rushing water looks great but your bridge looks out of focus and loses color. . .', '2003-03-12 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(236232, 13796, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting coloration, but I don''t like appearance as a whole.  The wires and darker part of the foreground bridge are really great, but the almost white parts don''t seem as attractive.  On the other hand, the bridge in the background really seemed to take the coloration well!  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'Interesting coloration, but I don''t like appearance as a whole.  The wires and darker part of the foreground bridge are really great, but the almost white parts don''t seem as attractive.  On the other hand, the bridge in the background really seemed to take the coloration well!  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash', '2003-03-12 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(236233, 13729, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice, like the reflections in the water of the bridge and trees, did you crop off the bridge to the right on purpose?</td>', 'Really nice, like the reflections in the water of the bridge and trees, did you crop off the bridge to the right on purpose?', '2003-03-12 18:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(236236, 13611, 6328, '<td valign="top">Why is it a troubled bridge?  Is it in disrepair?  It looks like it in a few spots, but could you hve given us something more to look at as a bigger picture?  I really like the color that you''ve captured, and the part of the river just below the bridge.</td>', 'Why is it a troubled bridge?  Is it in disrepair?  It looks like it in a few spots, but could you hve given us something more to look at as a bigger picture?  I really like the color that you''ve captured, and the part of the river just below the bridge.', '2003-03-12 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(236238, 13690, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sepia use for this shot seems to me to be extremely appropriate.  Focus doesn''t seem very strong (could be due to the "fog"?)  I have to question your bridge, it seems more like a pier to me (showing me the far end of this "bridge" would convince me better).  (Take more time spelling your titles, please)  6 Swash</td>', 'Sepia use for this shot seems to me to be extremely appropriate.  Focus doesn''t seem very strong (could be due to the "fog"?)  I have to question your bridge, it seems more like a pier to me (showing me the far end of this "bridge" would convince me better).  (Take more time spelling your titles, please)  6 Swash', '2003-03-12 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(236239, 13753, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colour that you''ve captured here, different angle that you''ve used which is unusual in itself.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colour that you''ve captured here, different angle that you''ve used which is unusual in itself.', '2003-03-12 18:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(236241, 13625, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really like the colours that you''ve been able to capture with the engine and the train and also the automobile.  The various colours of the bridge and brickwork are great also, along with the tree line, grass, etc.  Nice job.</td>', 'Really like the colours that you''ve been able to capture with the engine and the train and also the automobile.  The various colours of the bridge and brickwork are great also, along with the tree line, grass, etc.  Nice job.', '2003-03-12 18:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(236242, 13764, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken photo, I like the fog.  The bridge (to me) seems more like foreground material than subject.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nicely taken photo, I like the fog.  The bridge (to me) seems more like foreground material than subject.  6 Swash', '2003-03-12 18:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(236243, 13800, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of all those cables hanging together.  What a nice weave they make.  Like the yellow line too, but what''s it for, a bike path?</td>', 'Nice photo of all those cables hanging together.  What a nice weave they make.  Like the yellow line too, but what''s it for, a bike path?', '2003-03-12 18:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(236245, 13641, 6328, '<td valign="top">A bit unique, using your brain, duh, I''m not sure, huh?  Certainly different.  Now what would someone say if you wanted this photo critiqued??</td>', 'A bit unique, using your brain, duh, I''m not sure, huh?  Certainly different.  Now what would someone say if you wanted this photo critiqued??', '2003-03-12 18:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(236246, 13675, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really different for a bridge, but your bridge does seem to be out of focus on the left side compared to the right side, or is it that tree that just makes it seem that way??  I like the idea of standing over on the left side to take the photo instead of standing dead centre in the middle of the road.  Nice shades of grays.</td>', 'Really different for a bridge, but your bridge does seem to be out of focus on the left side compared to the right side, or is it that tree that just makes it seem that way??  I like the idea of standing over on the left side to take the photo instead of standing dead centre in the middle of the road.  Nice shades of grays.', '2003-03-12 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236247, 13710, 6328, '<td valign="top">You like to live dangerously close to the edge?  Great shot of the bridge and it''s decaying features.  The red rusty colours of great as are the shots of the bolts and the reflection of the water.  nice shot.</td>', 'You like to live dangerously close to the edge?  Great shot of the bridge and it''s decaying features.  The red rusty colours of great as are the shots of the bolts and the reflection of the water.  nice shot.', '2003-03-12 18:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(236248, 13955, 6328, '<td valign="top">You don''t really show enough of what seems to be a beautiful bridge, aside from a few trees and some red lettering under a tunnel.</td>', 'You don''t really show enough of what seems to be a beautiful bridge, aside from a few trees and some red lettering under a tunnel.', '2003-03-12 18:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(236249, 13638, 1005, '<td valign="top">Contrasts seem good, focus must be pretty sharp, too, but if I''m not mistaken, the structure of the bridge has compression effects (seems jaggy and less than sharp).  The boat on the river seems really sharp (justification to say the focus is good).  Contrast seems about right.  (joke - half score for half a bridge).<br/>Actual score 6 - Swash</td>', 'Contrasts seem good, focus must be pretty sharp, too, but if I''m not mistaken, the structure of the bridge has compression effects (seems jaggy and less than sharp).  The boat on the river seems really sharp (justification to say the focus is good).  Contrast seems about right.  (joke - half score for half a bridge).Actual score 6 - Swash', '2003-03-12 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(236256, 13588, 6110, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, nice sharp photo</td>', 'Interesting perspective, nice sharp photo', '2003-03-12 19:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(236259, 13574, 6110, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good detail.  Wish it was bigger.</td>', 'Nice composition, good detail.  Wish it was bigger.', '2003-03-12 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(236260, 13777, 6110, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped out that rouge branch in the upper left, but this is a great shot anyway.</td>', 'I might have cropped out that rouge branch in the upper left, but this is a great shot anyway.', '2003-03-12 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(236262, 13785, 6110, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2003-03-12 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(236263, 13636, 6110, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, really grabs the eye</td>', 'Great perspective, really grabs the eye', '2003-03-12 20:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236266, 13793, 6505, '<td valign="top">I would love this if the umbrella wasn''t there.  The moss, the old wood, and the grey leaves are incredible.  Damn that umbrella!</td>', 'I would love this if the umbrella wasn''t there.  The moss, the old wood, and the grey leaves are incredible.  Damn that umbrella!', '2003-03-12 20:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(236267, 13536, 6110, '<td valign="top">A beauty!  Great composition &amp; exposure</td>', 'A beauty!  Great composition & exposure', '2003-03-12 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(236268, 13692, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is a magnificent photo - the tonal range whilst keeping detail in the sky and clouds is wonderful, and something achieved by so few others. Not quite my favourite, but technically the best so far, congratulations.</td>', 'This is a magnificent photo - the tonal range whilst keeping detail in the sky and clouds is wonderful, and something achieved by so few others. Not quite my favourite, but technically the best so far, congratulations.', '2003-03-12 20:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(236270, 13823, 6505, '<td valign="top">Yes, my kind of shot!  Oh man, i think i''m feeling sick.  Got to get away from the edge!  Seriously, there some noise in the photo that distracts.   Great shot though.</td>', 'Yes, my kind of shot!  Oh man, i think i''m feeling sick.  Got to get away from the edge!  Seriously, there some noise in the photo that distracts.   Great shot though.', '2003-03-12 20:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(236271, 13939, 6999, '<td valign="top">What an odd (in a good way) shot this is: it looks almost like a sudio shot, probably because of the evenness of the light. Love that weed, too.</td>', 'What an odd (in a good way) shot this is: it looks almost like a sudio shot, probably because of the evenness of the light. Love that weed, too.', '2003-03-12 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(236272, 13748, 6110, '<td valign="top">Very creative, very will done.  Please explain the technique, I''d love to try it sometime.</td>', 'Very creative, very will done.  Please explain the technique, I''d love to try it sometime.', '2003-03-12 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236273, 13701, 6999, '<td valign="top">Another lovely shot - there''re too many this week, I can''t choose! One thing though - is your lens/glass a bit dirty? There are a few dark spots in this shot ...</td>', 'Another lovely shot - there''re too many this week, I can''t choose! One thing though - is your lens/glass a bit dirty? There are a few dark spots in this shot ...', '2003-03-12 20:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236274, 13653, 4338, '<td valign="top">maybe a different angle to this shot would have made it stand out more. Like being closer to the bridge and shooting towards the other side so It looks liek the bridge is going away from you,</td>', 'maybe a different angle to this shot would have made it stand out more. Like being closer to the bridge and shooting towards the other side so It looks liek the bridge is going away from you,', '2003-03-12 20:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(236275, 13681, 4338, '<td valign="top">did you try to adjust the white balance, I know winter shots like this are hard to get the color and white balance just right</td>', 'did you try to adjust the white balance, I know winter shots like this are hard to get the color and white balance just right', '2003-03-12 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(236276, 13787, 6999, '<td valign="top">Amazing, how bizarre.</td>', 'Amazing, how bizarre.', '2003-03-12 20:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(236277, 13677, 4338, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting shot, jst wish there was a little more light towards the center</td>', 'this is an interesting shot, jst wish there was a little more light towards the center', '2003-03-12 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(236278, 13751, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shot - though I''m not sure about the treatment colour-wise. The sky/clouds look good, but perhaps the main subjects are a little too uniform in texture to benefit from a near-monochrome effect? Also, for me, there have been too many shots unneccesarily made b&amp;w this week, which is of course pure bad luck.</td>', 'Good shot - though I''m not sure about the treatment colour-wise. The sky/clouds look good, but perhaps the main subjects are a little too uniform in texture to benefit from a near-monochrome effect? Also, for me, there have been too many shots unneccesarily made b&w this week, which is of course pure bad luck.', '2003-03-12 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(236280, 13573, 4338, '<td valign="top">WOW...beautiful shot.....i love it</td>', 'WOW...beautiful shot.....i love it', '2003-03-12 20:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(236281, 13748, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa! I guess it must be a ''legal'' shot, but I cannot make out how it works at all! The winner so far for me though</td>', 'Whoa! I guess it must be a ''legal'' shot, but I cannot make out how it works at all! The winner so far for me though', '2003-03-12 20:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(236282, 13713, 4679, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture.  I love the bright red.</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture.  I love the bright red.', '2003-03-12 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(236283, 13772, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition you chose on this photo... The exposure on this photo is quite excellent.. i really like the dark theme, but the bridge is silhouetted nicely against the dark sky.  The reflections on the water also add a nice element to this shot... nice work :) = 9 - setzler</td>', 'I really like the composition you chose on this photo... The exposure on this photo is quite excellent.. i really like the dark theme, but the bridge is silhouetted nicely against the dark sky.  The reflections on the water also add a nice element to this shot... nice work :) = 9 - setzler', '2003-03-12 20:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(236284, 13565, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... I never seem to get tired of seeing photos of this wonderful bridge... Your blue saturation in the sky is showing just a very slight amount of noise... possibly from pushing the blue saturation level?  None-the-less, this is a great shot... i hope you decide to make a print available from this :) = 8 - setzler</td>', 'very nice composition... I never seem to get tired of seeing photos of this wonderful bridge... Your blue saturation in the sky is showing just a very slight amount of noise... possibly from pushing the blue saturation level?  None-the-less, this is a great shot... i hope you decide to make a print available from this :) = 8 - setzler', '2003-03-12 20:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(236285, 13793, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, but I find myself wondering what the role of the umbrella is.  I think this image would be a very strong black and white without the umbrella as well... the umbrella offers a nice touch of color to the monochrome scene, but I simply can''t determine what meaning it has or what role it plays in the shot... good work, none-the-less :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, but I find myself wondering what the role of the umbrella is.  I think this image would be a very strong black and white without the umbrella as well... the umbrella offers a nice touch of color to the monochrome scene, but I simply can''t determine what meaning it has or what role it plays in the shot... good work, none-the-less :) - setzler', '2003-03-12 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(236286, 13681, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good bridge for a photo, for sure... The exposure seems a little flat.. the tonal ranges are quite narrow... maybe a slightly longer exposure would help out :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a good bridge for a photo, for sure... The exposure seems a little flat.. the tonal ranges are quite narrow... maybe a slightly longer exposure would help out :) - setzler', '2003-03-12 20:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(236288, 13674, 6520, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice subject you just got bumped up to an 8! I only gave two others.Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Great shot, nice subject you just got bumped up to an 8! I only gave two others.Keep up the good work.', '2003-03-12 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(236291, 13794, 6520, '<td valign="top">I was going two give you an 8 like only two others but I changed my mind you get my top mark a 9! Great shot, fantastic lines. Were you using a star filter?Keep up the good work hope you grab that ribbon!</td>', 'I was going two give you an 8 like only two others but I changed my mind you get my top mark a 9! Great shot, fantastic lines. Were you using a star filter?Keep up the good work hope you grab that ribbon!', '2003-03-12 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(236292, 13538, 6520, '<td valign="top">Great shot. fantastic setting.keep up the good work!</td>', 'Great shot. fantastic setting.keep up the good work!', '2003-03-12 20:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(236294, 13576, 6520, '<td valign="top">I must say unfair advantage as to where you live! My ancestor Duncan McVickie left Scotland in the 1600''s. I have never been.Great shot, love the reflection of the inner arches on the water.You get and deserve my second highest mark an 8.</td>', 'I must say unfair advantage as to where you live! My ancestor Duncan McVickie left Scotland in the 1600''s. I have never been.Great shot, love the reflection of the inner arches on the water.You get and deserve my second highest mark an 8.', '2003-03-12 20:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(236296, 13821, 2352, '<td valign="top">A sharp focus on this would have really made a difference. Nice composition and color, but a bit over exposed. I love the reflections! You did nice work here. I love the mystery to it! Nice shot!  -Clicker-</td>', 'A sharp focus on this would have really made a difference. Nice composition and color, but a bit over exposed. I love the reflections! You did nice work here. I love the mystery to it! Nice shot!  -Clicker-', '2003-03-12 20:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(236302, 13794, 4338, '<td valign="top">this is a very good shot!!!!!!</td>', 'this is a very good shot!!!!!!', '2003-03-12 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(236309, 13751, 4136, '<td valign="top">Liked the bridge &amp; the lines, but might have given it higher marks with natural colors. Then again, I might not have. :)</td>', 'Liked the bridge & the lines, but might have given it higher marks with natural colors. Then again, I might not have. :)', '2003-03-12 21:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(236310, 13670, 6938, '<td valign="top">The path leads to the bridge nicely.</td>', 'The path leads to the bridge nicely.', '2003-03-12 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(236312, 13608, 6938, '<td valign="top">Well croped.</td>', 'Well croped.', '2003-03-12 21:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(236314, 13787, 4136, '<td valign="top">Nicely said.</td>', 'Nicely said.', '2003-03-12 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(236316, 13822, 4136, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overexposed (is that water or ice or snow below the bridges). But, the lines and framing are very nice.</td>', 'Seems a little overexposed (is that water or ice or snow below the bridges). But, the lines and framing are very nice.', '2003-03-12 21:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(236317, 13584, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Should have cropped out the cars.</td>', 'Nice picture. Should have cropped out the cars.', '2003-03-12 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(236318, 13764, 4136, '<td valign="top">Each time I look at this, I wonder if the people help or hurt the photo. Then I tell myself I''ll figure it out next time. Well done.</td>', 'Each time I look at this, I wonder if the people help or hurt the photo. Then I tell myself I''ll figure it out next time. Well done.', '2003-03-12 21:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(236319, 13708, 6938, '<td valign="top">A very picturesque bridge - nice stonework.  Is the Urn feature at the left coppied on the right (out of shot)?Hmm, There also seems to be a Lean to the pillars.....</td>', 'A very picturesque bridge - nice stonework.  Is the Urn feature at the left coppied on the right (out of shot)?Hmm, There also seems to be a Lean to the pillars.....', '2003-03-12 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(236320, 13895, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice angle on the bridge.  I like the inclusion of the rocks, as they give a solid edge to the water (which has a fascinating ''texture'').</td>', 'Nice angle on the bridge.  I like the inclusion of the rocks, as they give a solid edge to the water (which has a fascinating ''texture'').', '2003-03-12 21:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(236322, 13954, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  The diagonals are a bit distracting to the patturn. I think I would have prefered the photo to be ''lower'', cutting out the diagonal steal in the top left,  with a crop to put the top edge of the concrete in the top left corner.</td>', 'Nice angle.  The diagonals are a bit distracting to the patturn. I think I would have prefered the photo to be ''lower'', cutting out the diagonal steal in the top left,  with a crop to put the top edge of the concrete in the top left corner.', '2003-03-12 21:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(236323, 13876, 6938, '<td valign="top">How did you get this angle?   The cityscape has becme the center of attention for me.</td>', 'How did you get this angle?   The cityscape has becme the center of attention for me.', '2003-03-12 21:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(236328, 13541, 6110, '<td valign="top">Nice composition &amp; lighting, I wish it could have been bigger, I realize you were up against the 150K limit.</td>', 'Nice composition & lighting, I wish it could have been bigger, I realize you were up against the 150K limit.', '2003-03-12 22:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236335, 13801, 6575, '<td valign="top">very crisp, nice rythym or flow</td>', 'very crisp, nice rythym or flow', '2003-03-12 22:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(236337, 13912, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful...I love the tones and the way the central arch is reflecting. The shadows underneath the arches are so rich and black they provide great contrast.  There is excellent coherence of all the colors...even the sky is a wonderful shade of gold. You''re really captured the feeling of the evening setting sun. Bravo!!!</td>', 'Very beautiful...I love the tones and the way the central arch is reflecting. The shadows underneath the arches are so rich and black they provide great contrast.  There is excellent coherence of all the colors...even the sky is a wonderful shade of gold. You''re really captured the feeling of the evening setting sun. Bravo!!!', '2003-03-12 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(236339, 13930, 5822, '<td valign="top">The bridge is so dark and small that it''s hard to see...and it should be the main subject of the picture...Maybe a telephoto lens would have improved it.</td>', 'The bridge is so dark and small that it''s hard to see...and it should be the main subject of the picture...Maybe a telephoto lens would have improved it.', '2003-03-12 22:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(236340, 13538, 5982, '<td valign="top">Besides the frame this is a very nice picture</td>', 'Besides the frame this is a very nice picture', '2003-03-12 22:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(236341, 13671, 5982, '<td valign="top">interesting movements but we cannot see  it is a bridge unfortunately</td>', 'interesting movements but we cannot see  it is a bridge unfortunately', '2003-03-12 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(236342, 13878, 5822, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot!!! Very futuristic looking...and very well done as well.  Focus and contrast are excellent and aerial perspective really adds to the shot.</td>', 'GREAT shot!!! Very futuristic looking...and very well done as well.  Focus and contrast are excellent and aerial perspective really adds to the shot.', '2003-03-12 22:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(236355, 13799, 2764, '<td valign="top">If you canoe a bit upstream you come to my house,  I just this minute recalibrated my monitor, this is the first picture I''ve looked at and it is WAY off - I think I better go check my settings</td>', 'If you canoe a bit upstream you come to my house,  I just this minute recalibrated my monitor, this is the first picture I''ve looked at and it is WAY off - I think I better go check my settings', '2003-03-12 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(236357, 13543, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is truly an unbelievable shot...I love it! The lighting is terrific and there is so much to look at.  The only thing I may have done differently is crop some of the foreground water out...but it''s still an outstanding photograph...10...and I hope it wins.</td>', 'This is truly an unbelievable shot...I love it! The lighting is terrific and there is so much to look at.  The only thing I may have done differently is crop some of the foreground water out...but it''s still an outstanding photograph...10...and I hope it wins.', '2003-03-12 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(236365, 13723, 6413, '<td valign="top">this is too small - it is hard to see</td>', 'this is too small - it is hard to see', '2003-03-12 23:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(236366, 13830, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of this photo, almost like frozen time...and the blue of the wtaer and sky contrast nicely with the pink in the horizon...nice job.</td>', 'I like the feeling of this photo, almost like frozen time...and the blue of the wtaer and sky contrast nicely with the pink in the horizon...nice job.', '2003-03-12 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(236368, 13740, 6413, '<td valign="top">very nice pic but it''s a bit hard to distinguish the bridge - it blends a bit too much withthe background (i really love the light comign through the clouds and the color)</td>', 'very nice pic but it''s a bit hard to distinguish the bridge - it blends a bit too much withthe background (i really love the light comign through the clouds and the color)', '2003-03-12 23:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(236369, 13650, 4871, '<td valign="top">Its amazing how quickly it gets back under the arches - wonderful use of the suns position! Overall nice lighting.</td>', 'Its amazing how quickly it gets back under the arches - wonderful use of the suns position! Overall nice lighting.', '2003-03-12 23:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(236370, 13778, 4871, '<td valign="top">The bridge itself is pretty ordinary, but I''ve always loved</td>', 'The bridge itself is pretty ordinary, but I''ve always loved', '2003-03-12 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(236372, 13535, 4871, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite figure this picture out - the perspective has left me very confused! It kind of looks like the drawing of starcases where whichever way you look at it you see a different perspective. I love the colors in the sky, backed with the ''industrial'' background! Gave it 10!</td>', 'I can''t quite figure this picture out - the perspective has left me very confused! It kind of looks like the drawing of starcases where whichever way you look at it you see a different perspective. I love the colors in the sky, backed with the ''industrial'' background! Gave it 10!', '2003-03-12 23:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(236373, 13889, 4871, '<td valign="top">Ahhh serenity! Love it!</td>', 'Ahhh serenity! Love it!', '2003-03-12 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(236374, 13701, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective.</td>', 'Very nice perspective.', '2003-03-12 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(236375, 13823, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great color in the water..but wish the sky wasn''t so washed out.</td>', 'Great color in the water..but wish the sky wasn''t so washed out.', '2003-03-12 23:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(236376, 13878, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow! Longest bridge I''ve ever seen. Love how you''e captured the reflection - many attempt but its hard to get a good reflection. And the mist? WOW! Gave a 9!</td>', 'Wow! Longest bridge I''ve ever seen. Love how you''e captured the reflection - many attempt but its hard to get a good reflection. And the mist? WOW! Gave a 9!', '2003-03-12 23:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(236377, 13551, 4871, '<td valign="top">When it first started coming up I thought it was boring. I was mistaken! I don''t think this shot could have been composed better!</td>', 'When it first started coming up I thought it was boring. I was mistaken! I don''t think this shot could have been composed better!', '2003-03-12 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(236379, 13708, 4871, '<td valign="top">That reflection is great! I was looking at it and thinking the debri weren''t there it''d be a perfect reflection. Would it have been possible to have framed this so as to have taken in more of the reflection? It seems that we are missing something that would definitely be adding to the shot. Love it how it is though!</td>', 'That reflection is great! I was looking at it and thinking the debri weren''t there it''d be a perfect reflection. Would it have been possible to have framed this so as to have taken in more of the reflection? It seems that we are missing something that would definitely be adding to the shot. Love it how it is though!', '2003-03-12 23:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236380, 13811, 4871, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really thrill me. It doesn''t seem to really be bridging anything - that is if its the crate that is supposed to be the bridge. I would have liked to see the crate a bit more prominently.</td>', 'Doesn''t really thrill me. It doesn''t seem to really be bridging anything - that is if its the crate that is supposed to be the bridge. I would have liked to see the crate a bit more prominently.', '2003-03-12 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(236381, 13680, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clear photo.  But I cannot score this photo very high.  I''m a Gibson man myself so it would be unethical to do so.  j/k!  Nice image and good use of creative license for the bridge thing.  This makes me fear seeing an oral appliance now for "bridge".  Good Luck!</td>', 'Nice crisp clear photo.  But I cannot score this photo very high.  I''m a Gibson man myself so it would be unethical to do so.  j/k!  Nice image and good use of creative license for the bridge thing.  This makes me fear seeing an oral appliance now for "bridge".  Good Luck!', '2003-03-12 23:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(236382, 13747, 4871, '<td valign="top">Great position to have taken this photo. The perspective is really good, but its emphasised by how low to the ground it is taken. Great!</td>', 'Great position to have taken this photo. The perspective is really good, but its emphasised by how low to the ground it is taken. Great!', '2003-03-12 23:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(236383, 13791, 4871, '<td valign="top">Should have called it "The light at the end of the tunnel" - Looks great. Don''t know if I''d be driving my car through it though!</td>', 'Should have called it "The light at the end of the tunnel" - Looks great. Don''t know if I''d be driving my car through it though!', '2003-03-12 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(236384, 13948, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the overall tones of this picture.  It is a little soft though especially in the branches.   A difficult exposure with the snow and the dark pier in the middle of the river.  You did a pretty good job of figuring out the right balance though.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the overall tones of this picture.  It is a little soft though especially in the branches.   A difficult exposure with the snow and the dark pier in the middle of the river.  You did a pretty good job of figuring out the right balance though.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-12 23:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(236385, 13563, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! I love the retouch! This is a beautiful picture, but cute is also the word that comes to mind. Gave it a 10.</td>', 'Wow!!! I love the retouch! This is a beautiful picture, but cute is also the word that comes to mind. Gave it a 10.', '2003-03-12 23:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(236386, 13677, 3540, '<td valign="top">Could be much better if it were exposed more.  There seems to be much detail lost in the darkness of this photo.</td>', 'Could be much better if it were exposed more.  There seems to be much detail lost in the darkness of this photo.', '2003-03-12 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
