(236510, 13940, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hi.  nice compostion.  good color, good focus.  I think the rain shows more color at times, don''t you?  The greens come out greener as do the yellow signs.  As in the photo, you get some of that foggy feeling was out beyong the bridge. . . I think you could have straightened your shot up just a mite, it seems to be leaning to the right a slight bit.  Great shot though.</td>', 'Hi.  nice compostion.  good color, good focus.  I think the rain shows more color at times, don''t you?  The greens come out greener as do the yellow signs.  As in the photo, you get some of that foggy feeling was out beyong the bridge. . . I think you could have straightened your shot up just a mite, it seems to be leaning to the right a slight bit.  Great shot though.', '2003-03-13 02:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(236511, 13594, 6328, '<td valign="top">I think your wide black frame takes away from your snow scened bridge, perhaps a 5/10 pixel would have been better.  You''ve done a nice job using the tree as a picture frame on the left side, did you really need an outside frame?  Nice wintery photography.</td>', 'I think your wide black frame takes away from your snow scened bridge, perhaps a 5/10 pixel would have been better.  You''ve done a nice job using the tree as a picture frame on the left side, did you really need an outside frame?  Nice wintery photography.', '2003-03-13 02:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236513, 13765, 6328, '<td valign="top">Ah, a very nice photo of your bridge.  I just love the color on the side of your bridge and the cold water flowing through the openings.  You''ve shown some of the nice brickwork that went into the making of this bridge, congratulations.<br/></td>', 'Ah, a very nice photo of your bridge.  I just love the color on the side of your bridge and the cold water flowing through the openings.  You''ve shown some of the nice brickwork that went into the making of this bridge, congratulations.', '2003-03-13 02:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(236515, 13576, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely. Lots of colour on the rock and stonework, and the reflections off the water looks great.  The greens of the grass are nice. Good crisp photo, nice visual impact, holds onto one''s attention.</td>', 'Lovely, just lovely. Lots of colour on the rock and stonework, and the reflections off the water looks great.  The greens of the grass are nice. Good crisp photo, nice visual impact, holds onto one''s attention.', '2003-03-13 02:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(236517, 13695, 6328, '<td valign="top">Talk about old bridges and trestles.  This one must have taken a lot of back breaking work to complete.  Is it still a working train trestle?  You''ve camptured quite a bit of history here my friend.  just look at thos beams of lumber sitting on top of each other, depending on one and other for strength to hold the next one up. . .  Look at the different colors in the wood, the bolts and nuts.  Excellent!!</td>', 'Talk about old bridges and trestles.  This one must have taken a lot of back breaking work to complete.  Is it still a working train trestle?  You''ve camptured quite a bit of history here my friend.  just look at thos beams of lumber sitting on top of each other, depending on one and other for strength to hold the next one up. . .  Look at the different colors in the wood, the bolts and nuts.  Excellent!!', '2003-03-13 03:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236519, 13566, 6328, '<td valign="top">it''s a bear and a fish, but what else?  I don''t get it?</td>', 'it''s a bear and a fish, but what else?  I don''t get it?', '2003-03-13 03:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(236520, 13960, 6328, '<td valign="top">So it another piece of abstract and it makes no sense to me whatsoever.  I''ve got to give you a five for trying</td>', 'So it another piece of abstract and it makes no sense to me whatsoever.  I''ve got to give you a five for trying', '2003-03-13 03:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(236523, 13814, 6328, '<td valign="top">Okay.  The bridge is okay, but I''ve gotta tell you, that the artwork on the banks is absolutely tremendous.  You want to talk to DP Personnel and get about 50 photographers together and get out there and take shots of all that ART and then get it all put into a special GALLERY so that it can be preserved ! ! ! DO YOU KNOW WHAT I''M SAYING HERE???  The bridge rates about a 5.  The art on the Banks rate a 10</td>', 'Okay.  The bridge is okay, but I''ve gotta tell you, that the artwork on the banks is absolutely tremendous.  You want to talk to DP Personnel and get about 50 photographers together and get out there and take shots of all that ART and then get it all put into a special GALLERY so that it can be preserved ! ! ! DO YOU KNOW WHAT I''M SAYING HERE???  The bridge rates about a 5.  The art on the Banks rate a 10', '2003-03-13 03:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(236525, 13762, 3942, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, your composition makes this usual modern bridge an interesting shot. Good eye to catch this!</td>', 'Great perspective, your composition makes this usual modern bridge an interesting shot. Good eye to catch this!', '2003-03-13 03:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
