(236539, 13663, 3942, '<td valign="top">O.K., you are creative and tried for a different and unique shot, but I don''t like the result. Don''t get my wrong: IMHO there is nothing to say at all against nudity, I just don''t like this one I see here. Mostly I dislike the posture of the model, the position looks like (...don''t know the english words for my thoughts...). The direct lighting from above ist to strong and causes partial overexposion. Additionally I''m not sure about your decision to add this blur and grainy effect. But that''s yust me ;-)</td>', 'O.K., you are creative and tried for a different and unique shot, but I don''t like the result. Don''t get my wrong: IMHO there is nothing to say at all against nudity, I just don''t like this one I see here. Mostly I dislike the posture of the model, the position looks like (...don''t know the english words for my thoughts...). The direct lighting from above ist to strong and causes partial overexposion. Additionally I''m not sure about your decision to add this blur and grainy effect. But that''s yust me ;-)', '2003-03-13 03:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(236540, 13543, 5865, '<td valign="top">A beautiful composition.  Personally I would have cropped some of the water off, but that is just my preference</td>', 'A beautiful composition.  Personally I would have cropped some of the water off, but that is just my preference', '2003-03-13 03:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(236542, 13912, 5865, '<td valign="top">That''s one beautiful bridge.  I love the colour of the brickwork.</td>', 'That''s one beautiful bridge.  I love the colour of the brickwork.', '2003-03-13 03:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(236548, 13574, 3540, '<td valign="top">The only thing I''d like to see different about this picture is some blue in the sky.  Very nice besides that.</td>', 'The only thing I''d like to see different about this picture is some blue in the sky.  Very nice besides that.', '2003-03-13 04:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236549, 13803, 4805, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...very good eye. There seems to be some unfortunate moirée patterning in the sky (pretty sure it''s not my monitor as I can scroll up and down and it moves with the image) but that''s a purely technical issue which mightn''t be avoidable. This would make a good black and white, too.</td>', 'Beautiful...very good eye. There seems to be some unfortunate moirée patterning in the sky (pretty sure it''s not my monitor as I can scroll up and down and it moves with the image) but that''s a purely technical issue which mightn''t be avoidable. This would make a good black and white, too.', '2003-03-13 04:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(236550, 13747, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I like lines and shapes and these are great.  The pattern of the posts really sells me on this shot.  Too bad that little rock is stuck in the middle of the road.  Nice Find.  Good luck</td>', 'Excellent.  I like lines and shapes and these are great.  The pattern of the posts really sells me on this shot.  Too bad that little rock is stuck in the middle of the road.  Nice Find.  Good luck', '2003-03-13 04:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236551, 13727, 3540, '<td valign="top">What is so bright on the bottom right corner of this page as to wash out a little?  Would''ve like to have seen this from a little further back to capture a little more of the bridge and not concentrate so hard on the ducks.   NIce color tones.</td>', 'What is so bright on the bottom right corner of this page as to wash out a little?  Would''ve like to have seen this from a little further back to capture a little more of the bridge and not concentrate so hard on the ducks.   NIce color tones.', '2003-03-13 04:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(236554, 13592, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''d have really concentrated on getting the reflection of this bridge in he water.  Not a bad photo but it needs osmething more to grab the viewer.</td>', 'I''d have really concentrated on getting the reflection of this bridge in he water.  Not a bad photo but it needs osmething more to grab the viewer.', '2003-03-13 04:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236555, 13740, 3540, '<td valign="top">Difficult to expose this one correctly with the bright sky and dark land.  The underexposure on the bottom half is hard to overcome.</td>', 'Difficult to expose this one correctly with the bright sky and dark land.  The underexposure on the bottom half is hard to overcome.', '2003-03-13 04:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236556, 13655, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really dreary picture.   Mine is also dreary so i did the same thing, take out the colors to lighten the effect of the dreary.  I''d have concentrated more on the train than the water for this photo</td>', 'This is a really dreary picture.   Mine is also dreary so i did the same thing, take out the colors to lighten the effect of the dreary.  I''d have concentrated more on the train than the water for this photo', '2003-03-13 04:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(236557, 13648, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this ultra shallow DOF for this photo.  It could''ve been greater with a slower shutter speed and done differently IMO.  There is too much blurry in this photo.  I''m a Gibson man anyway.... :)</td>', 'I don''t like this ultra shallow DOF for this photo.  It could''ve been greater with a slower shutter speed and done differently IMO.  There is too much blurry in this photo.  I''m a Gibson man anyway.... :)', '2003-03-13 05:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(236558, 13563, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good tones in terms of colors of this photo.  I think the bridge is too high up in the frame and would''ve been more effective down a little.  Nice subject!</td>', 'Good tones in terms of colors of this photo.  I think the bridge is too high up in the frame and would''ve been more effective down a little.  Nice subject!', '2003-03-13 05:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236559, 13761, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture needs a little more clarity.  The white sky is not helping either.   The heron is nice but I think the bridges would''ve been a better subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'This picture needs a little more clarity.  The white sky is not helping either.   The heron is nice but I think the bridges would''ve been a better subject.  Good luck.', '2003-03-13 05:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(236560, 13663, 3540, '<td valign="top">Unusual approach to this challenge.  I can see how this can be taken by folks to be of poor taste.  I don''t think this fuzzy of a photo will ever do very well here.  Naked chicks are cool, but I was really caught off guard by this photo which I''m sure was part of your intention. It looks like a photo taken in the ''20s.  Interpretive way to portray a bridge, however I don''t feel its terrible effective either.</td>', 'Unusual approach to this challenge.  I can see how this can be taken by folks to be of poor taste.  I don''t think this fuzzy of a photo will ever do very well here.  Naked chicks are cool, but I was really caught off guard by this photo which I''m sure was part of your intention. It looks like a photo taken in the ''20s.  Interpretive way to portray a bridge, however I don''t feel its terrible effective either.', '2003-03-13 05:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(236562, 13770, 3540, '<td valign="top">Difficult exposure conditions.  Not badly done, but could stand to fixed somehow.  If it was me I''d have concentrated my efforts on the bigger bridge in the background and got out from under this one to make the exposure game a fair one.</td>', 'Difficult exposure conditions.  Not badly done, but could stand to fixed somehow.  If it was me I''d have concentrated my efforts on the bigger bridge in the background and got out from under this one to make the exposure game a fair one.', '2003-03-13 05:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(236563, 13581, 3540, '<td valign="top">The big blur in the middle of the photograph is serious flaw that I don''t think anything can overcome.  Cutting off the person''s head is another.</td>', 'The big blur in the middle of the photograph is serious flaw that I don''t think anything can overcome.  Cutting off the person''s head is another.', '2003-03-13 05:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(236564, 13688, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little sharper would''ve been better.  At the time this was taken, I''d have waited a few more minutes and tried to get this bridge all lit up.</td>', 'A little sharper would''ve been better.  At the time this was taken, I''d have waited a few more minutes and tried to get this bridge all lit up.', '2003-03-13 05:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236565, 13764, 3540, '<td valign="top">The haze makes this photo.  Excellent photo!  The people in the background are definitely a great addition to this already great photo.  This has a little more of the metaphoric stuff than most or all of the other shots.  Great capture.  Good luck this week.  this  is a 10 from me</td>', 'The haze makes this photo.  Excellent photo!  The people in the background are definitely a great addition to this already great photo.  This has a little more of the metaphoric stuff than most or all of the other shots.  Great capture.  Good luck this week.  this  is a 10 from me', '2003-03-13 05:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(236566, 13713, 3540, '<td valign="top">The picture is pretty good except for all the colors except red are really sort of dull.  A little nicer day might''ve worked out better for you.   I really like the approaches to the bridge.  That''s a lot of attractive stonework</td>', 'The picture is pretty good except for all the colors except red are really sort of dull.  A little nicer day might''ve worked out better for you.   I really like the approaches to the bridge.  That''s a lot of attractive stonework', '2003-03-13 05:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(236567, 13723, 3540, '<td valign="top">Size Matters!</td>', 'Size Matters!', '2003-03-13 05:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(236568, 13824, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good use of black and white.  Nice bridge.  Very well framed and nicely taken</td>', 'Good use of black and white.  Nice bridge.  Very well framed and nicely taken', '2003-03-13 05:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(236569, 13821, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  great reflections.  The bridge could be a little more prominent in the photo, but I think it works the way it is.  Great job - 9</td>', 'Excellent photo.  great reflections.  The bridge could be a little more prominent in the photo, but I think it works the way it is.  Great job - 9', '2003-03-13 05:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(236570, 13594, 3540, '<td valign="top">I admire the way you used the limb to frame the picture in but I think it''s not focused enough.  Good little bridge portrayal in snow which is always tough to shoot it.  You''ve exposed it just about right.  Nice photo.</td>', 'I admire the way you used the limb to frame the picture in but I think it''s not focused enough.  Good little bridge portrayal in snow which is always tough to shoot it.  You''ve exposed it just about right.  Nice photo.', '2003-03-13 05:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(236571, 13536, 4927, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, let''s see...we have the USX Tower, One Mellon Center, and the biggest clue of all which is the name of the bridge! Could this bridge be in Pittsburgh? Let me go even further out on a limb here and make a guess that this is Alan Freed''s photo. lol. <br/> <br/>Another great night shot. Nice side perspective and the star effect on the lights adds to the photo as well. Looks like you have two dead or hot pixels in the upper left quadrant. Hope your camera is still under warranty.</td>', 'Hmmm, let''s see...we have the USX Tower, One Mellon Center, and the biggest clue of all which is the name of the bridge! Could this bridge be in Pittsburgh? Let me go even further out on a limb here and make a guess that this is Alan Freed''s photo. lol.  Another great night shot. Nice side perspective and the star effect on the lights adds to the photo as well. Looks like you have two dead or hot pixels in the upper left quadrant. Hope your camera is still under warranty.', '2003-03-13 05:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(236572, 13903, 4927, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love how the bridge fades into the fog. The B&amp;W was a surefire choice, as I feel it accents the mysterious feel that the fog already creates.</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love how the bridge fades into the fog. The B&W was a surefire choice, as I feel it accents the mysterious feel that the fog already creates.', '2003-03-13 05:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
