(236576, 13753, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - I both like and dislike the tilt of camera: seems to emphasise the height of the nearer tower, but I also find ''realistic'' shots, I mean where the whole subject is visible, angled shots quite distracting. Good shooting though - love the city-light on those clouds</td>', 'Interesting shot - I both like and dislike the tilt of camera: seems to emphasise the height of the nearer tower, but I also find ''realistic'' shots, I mean where the whole subject is visible, angled shots quite distracting. Good shooting though - love the city-light on those clouds', '2003-03-13 06:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(236577, 13903, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think this will win. Powerful composition, a great capture, and I''d be showing all my friends if I''d taken it :-)</td>', 'I think this will win. Powerful composition, a great capture, and I''d be showing all my friends if I''d taken it :-)', '2003-03-13 06:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
