(236663, 13589, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, and I really like this style of bridge too.  Lighting seems good, colors too - the picture is a bit grainy though, at ~75k.  Did you save the photo at a high enough compression quality?</td>', 'Very nice scene, and I really like this style of bridge too.  Lighting seems good, colors too - the picture is a bit grainy though, at ~75k.  Did you save the photo at a high enough compression quality?', '2003-03-13 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
