(236668, 13824, 917, '<td valign="top">What is it with these covered bridges, I mean ist not like they needed to keep the river dry.  Photographically, the branch intrudes in front of the bridge, it might have been better to shoot from the other side, except theres probably a chemical plant or pylon in the background then.</td>', 'What is it with these covered bridges, I mean ist not like they needed to keep the river dry.  Photographically, the branch intrudes in front of the bridge, it might have been better to shoot from the other side, except theres probably a chemical plant or pylon in the background then.', '2003-03-13 11:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
