(236754, 13764, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent - thank god you didn''t turn this b&amp;w as way too many other shots have been. &lt;edit&gt; Now I''ve seen them all, and had a few days to think, this is the shot that has stayed with me most this week: you get the ten.</td>', 'Excellent - thank god you didn''t turn this b&w as way too many other shots have been. <edit> Now I''ve seen them all, and had a few days to think, this is the shot that has stayed with me most this week: you get the ten.', '2003-03-13 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
