(236796, 13583, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo, but a bit dark (snow may have affected the light adjustment).  Challenge met.  I''m not sure, but you might have a water droplet on the lens (look past the bridge, just before the brush).  Interest is on the low side and the far background doesn''t help.  5 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo, but a bit dark (snow may have affected the light adjustment).  Challenge met.  I''m not sure, but you might have a water droplet on the lens (look past the bridge, just before the brush).  Interest is on the low side and the far background doesn''t help.  5 Swash', '2003-03-13 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(236797, 13648, 6663, '<td valign="top">Great idea but would have been better with more depth of field</td>', 'Great idea but would have been better with more depth of field', '2003-03-13 15:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(236801, 13697, 6097, '<td valign="top">Seems just a little soft on the focus side but I really like the composition and lines.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Seems just a little soft on the focus side but I really like the composition and lines.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-13 15:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(236803, 13588, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Good composition and very interesting to look at.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'I really like this.  Good composition and very interesting to look at.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-03-13 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(236809, 13723, 772, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful landscape shot... i really like train bridges :)  I think the image would have more impact if it was a bit larger... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful landscape shot... i really like train bridges :)  I think the image would have more impact if it was a bit larger... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-13 16:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(236810, 13830, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice color in this shot and the perspective is good as well :)  The image needs a slight counter clockwise rotation to level the horizon... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice color in this shot and the perspective is good as well :)  The image needs a slight counter clockwise rotation to level the horizon... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-13 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(236815, 13756, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Photograph.  Lovely natural wood bulding with the water wheel beside it and then that beautiful red building behind it with the white trim.  Great beauty!  and the greenery, and the frozen creek and snow, what a magnificent shot you''ve created, and then I''ve just noticed the outcropping of rock on the right! and the Red roof, I can''t stop finding things.... absolutely great. . .</td>', 'Beautiful Photograph.  Lovely natural wood bulding with the water wheel beside it and then that beautiful red building behind it with the white trim.  Great beauty!  and the greenery, and the frozen creek and snow, what a magnificent shot you''ve created, and then I''ve just noticed the outcropping of rock on the right! and the Red roof, I can''t stop finding things.... absolutely great. . .', '2003-03-13 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(236819, 13777, 6328, '<td valign="top">Just Beautiful! !  The Noise that must be going through your ears!  I wish I were with you. . .  The color you\''ve captured of that Engine 9861 is Awsome!  The Union Pacific Flag, the Yellow, The Red Bonnet, what is there, 1,2,3, 4 Engines?and the detail in the wood Trestle. . . and the weeds growing up out from under it, and the bluish sky.  What a great job!  Then I\''ve just noticed the hoses hanging down and the coupler. . .  Wow, and the headlamps. . . I can\''t stop looking! ! !  Look at the white railings,  The Red Numbering on the side of the Engine  The focus is great, depth of field super, nice and crisp, - will you please email me and tell me where this was taken?  I''m and N-scale Train buff  This is a fantastic photograph  Congratulations!!!</td>', 'Just Beautiful! !  The Noise that must be going through your ears!  I wish I were with you. . .  The color you\''ve captured of that Engine 9861 is Awsome!  The Union Pacific Flag, the Yellow, The Red Bonnet, what is there, 1,2,3, 4 Engines?and the detail in the wood Trestle. . . and the weeds growing up out from under it, and the bluish sky.  What a great job!  Then I\''ve just noticed the hoses hanging down and the coupler. . .  Wow, and the headlamps. . . I can\''t stop looking! ! !  Look at the white railings,  The Red Numbering on the side of the Engine  The focus is great, depth of field super, nice and crisp, - will you please email me and tell me where this was taken?  I''m and N-scale Train buff  This is a fantastic photograph  Congratulations!!!', '2003-03-13 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(236820, 13799, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is nice.  I would like to have seen more of the wooden bridge, but this is really dramatic.  I like the way part of the rocks are reflected in the water. Unfotunately, most of the bareness of the trees gives the photo a real blah look to it, wonder what it would have looked like later on during the day when the daylight started to fade away a bit. . .</td>', 'Wow, this is nice.  I would like to have seen more of the wooden bridge, but this is really dramatic.  I like the way part of the rocks are reflected in the water. Unfotunately, most of the bareness of the trees gives the photo a real blah look to it, wonder what it would have looked like later on during the day when the daylight started to fade away a bit. . .', '2003-03-13 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(236821, 13749, 6328, '<td valign="top">It''s seen a long life, hasn''t it?  Love the water flowing out of the pipe, the strength that it shows by it''s fast flow. . . the color you''ve got in the rocks and the concrete and the steel.  Nice photo.</td>', 'It''s seen a long life, hasn''t it?  Love the water flowing out of the pipe, the strength that it shows by it''s fast flow. . . the color you''ve got in the rocks and the concrete and the steel.  Nice photo.', '2003-03-13 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236823, 13536, 6893, '<td valign="top">I find this to be very asthetic.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I find this to be very asthetic.  Nice shot!', '2003-03-13 16:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236824, 13690, 6328, '<td valign="top">Talk about stormy weather.  Good photograph and you were on the spot at the precise moment.  Perfect shot for photojournalism.  Sure hope no one was caught out at the end of that bridge.</td>', 'Talk about stormy weather.  Good photograph and you were on the spot at the precise moment.  Perfect shot for photojournalism.  Sure hope no one was caught out at the end of that bridge.', '2003-03-13 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(236825, 13768, 6893, '<td valign="top">Aren''t kids great.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Aren''t kids great.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-13 16:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(236826, 13840, 6328, '<td valign="top">lovely shot of a winter scene.  Like the water flowing over the rocks like that. Cropping is good, good focus, good color on the rocks and bridge.</td>', 'lovely shot of a winter scene.  Like the water flowing over the rocks like that. Cropping is good, good focus, good color on the rocks and bridge.', '2003-03-13 16:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(236828, 13768, 6328, '<td valign="top">lots of imagination for this photo and challenge.  Your photo seems to be a bit out of focus both on the green truck and the blue truck.</td>', 'lots of imagination for this photo and challenge.  Your photo seems to be a bit out of focus both on the green truck and the blue truck.', '2003-03-13 16:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(236830, 13908, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo with good color.  Interest - moderate to low.  (No idea what to suggest, it would have been corny to ask the people to wave....sorry, nothing''s coming to mind)  6 Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo with good color.  Interest - moderate to low.  (No idea what to suggest, it would have been corny to ask the people to wave....sorry, nothing''s coming to mind)  6 Swash', '2003-03-13 16:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(236832, 13971, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo.   I know it''s all gray outside, but still seems a bit dark.  I like the birds flying around, nice touch.  What are the orange balls on the right edge?  6 Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo.   I know it''s all gray outside, but still seems a bit dark.  I like the birds flying around, nice touch.  What are the orange balls on the right edge?  6 Swash', '2003-03-13 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(236834, 13652, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow, what color, what great intricate architecture.  It looks like Reds, oranges, Grays, What a fantastic colorful photograph.  And the depth!  And the shadows!<br/>The strength that this represents. . .  The only tiniest little mistake - your horizon was off by the smallest amount - but who cares. . .  Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow, what color, what great intricate architecture.  It looks like Reds, oranges, Grays, What a fantastic colorful photograph.  And the depth!  And the shadows!The strength that this represents. . .  The only tiniest little mistake - your horizon was off by the smallest amount - but who cares. . .  Congratulations!', '2003-03-13 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(236835, 13772, 6938, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-03-13 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(236836, 13895, 1005, '<td valign="top">This one has grown on me since I voted.  The mist/fog adds a nice amount of eirie appeal.  The sepia tones for this, too, are growing better for me.  The reflection is the best part, naturally.  I am torn - I like the photo cropped more at the top (no shoreline at all), but that takes away the fog, which I like.  Score upgrade 6 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'This one has grown on me since I voted.  The mist/fog adds a nice amount of eirie appeal.  The sepia tones for this, too, are growing better for me.  The reflection is the best part, naturally.  I am torn - I like the photo cropped more at the top (no shoreline at all), but that takes away the fog, which I like.  Score upgrade 6 to 7.  Swash', '2003-03-13 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(236837, 13639, 6938, '<td valign="top">"Barrier"? - Perhaps if the "two worlds" were being shown.....<br/>Is that another bridge in the background?</td>', '"Barrier"? - Perhaps if the "two worlds" were being shown.....Is that another bridge in the background?', '2003-03-13 16:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(236840, 13791, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the low angle of this shot.  Actually, this is growing on me as I comment.  Nice patterns.  Good contrast.  There''s a light at the end of the "tunnel".  Nicely done.  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'I like the low angle of this shot.  Actually, this is growing on me as I comment.  Nice patterns.  Good contrast.  There''s a light at the end of the "tunnel".  Nicely done.  Score upgrade from 6 to 7.  Swash', '2003-03-13 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(236841, 13779, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice shot of the tower, but I think you should have given us the whole thing, moved back a bit. . .</td>', 'nice shot of the tower, but I think you should have given us the whole thing, moved back a bit. . .', '2003-03-13 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(236843, 13562, 1005, '<td valign="top">Some freeway designer had a lot of fun with this one!  Very clear photo.  Nice perspective (the road leading away from you).  Winter is heck on outside photography.  Interest is moderate to mod/low (sorry).  6 Swash</td>', 'Some freeway designer had a lot of fun with this one!  Very clear photo.  Nice perspective (the road leading away from you).  Winter is heck on outside photography.  Interest is moderate to mod/low (sorry).  6 Swash', '2003-03-13 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(236844, 13963, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo.  Perhaps the ''bridge'' could have been brought into focus a bit more: a child building it perhaps?</td>', 'Nice Photo.  Perhaps the ''bridge'' could have been brought into focus a bit more: a child building it perhaps?', '2003-03-13 16:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(236845, 13830, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice clear photo of this bridge, like the colors of the sky and the waters, sure is one long bridge, wouldn''t want to travel it in a snow storm.  .  .</td>', 'Really nice clear photo of this bridge, like the colors of the sky and the waters, sure is one long bridge, wouldn''t want to travel it in a snow storm.  .  .', '2003-03-13 16:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(236847, 13657, 6328, '<td valign="top">What a place for a bridge to be found.  very colorful place too.</td>', 'What a place for a bridge to be found.  very colorful place too.', '2003-03-13 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(236849, 13830, 6938, '<td valign="top">Interesting colouring of the photo: gives a nice cold morning effeect.</td>', 'Interesting colouring of the photo: gives a nice cold morning effeect.', '2003-03-13 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(236850, 13612, 6328, '<td valign="top">You show a nice amount of water coming down the rocks, but would have appreciated some cropping at the higher rocks and seeing some more of the bridge with water on the upper rock.  The bridge is too far away to be appreciated much.</td>', 'You show a nice amount of water coming down the rocks, but would have appreciated some cropping at the higher rocks and seeing some more of the bridge with water on the upper rock.  The bridge is too far away to be appreciated much.', '2003-03-13 17:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(236860, 13977, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the curves and vertical lines in this image - it really leads you over the bridge.  Great work.</td>', 'I love the curves and vertical lines in this image - it really leads you over the bridge.  Great work.', '2003-03-13 17:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(236861, 13908, 1647, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice and balanced but it does have a kind of snapshot feel to it.  Focus looks crisp and colour is good.</td>', 'The composition is nice and balanced but it does have a kind of snapshot feel to it.  Focus looks crisp and colour is good.', '2003-03-13 17:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
