(237057, 13686, 6893, '<td valign="top">You were right to emphasis the Architectual features.  Nice.</td>', 'You were right to emphasis the Architectual features.  Nice.', '2003-03-13 21:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237058, 13903, 6893, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel that refreshing fog. Great angle, nice shot.</td>', 'I can almost feel that refreshing fog. Great angle, nice shot.', '2003-03-13 21:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237059, 13535, 6893, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The light on the suspenders and the triangular supports bring the eye right up from the river front.  7!</td>', 'I like this shot.  The light on the suspenders and the triangular supports bring the eye right up from the river front.  7!', '2003-03-13 21:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(237060, 13628, 6938, '<td valign="top">Very Industrialised look. I''d suggest cropping the rail out of the bottom to remove that distraction, and in on the right to the second building to center the bridge more.  There also seems to be a lean on things.</td>', 'Very Industrialised look. I''d suggest cropping the rail out of the bottom to remove that distraction, and in on the right to the second building to center the bridge more.  There also seems to be a lean on things.', '2003-03-13 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237061, 13528, 6938, '<td valign="top">a closer shot would have given a better ''bridge'' effect ranther that the ''rock'' effect I''m seeing.</td>', 'a closer shot would have given a better ''bridge'' effect ranther that the ''rock'' effect I''m seeing.', '2003-03-13 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237062, 13558, 6893, '<td valign="top">The feeling is well captured here.  Nice!</td>', 'The feeling is well captured here.  Nice!', '2003-03-13 21:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237063, 13825, 6893, '<td valign="top">Thank you for giving a different look.  Nice monochromatic feel.</td>', 'Thank you for giving a different look.  Nice monochromatic feel.', '2003-03-13 21:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237064, 13880, 6893, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2003-03-13 21:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237065, 13766, 6938, '<td valign="top">Its a very interesting bridge, but there is too much going n around it...</td>', 'Its a very interesting bridge, but there is too much going n around it...', '2003-03-13 21:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237066, 13539, 6893, '<td valign="top">Your getting low has resulted in an intereswting shot.  Good work.</td>', 'Your getting low has resulted in an intereswting shot.  Good work.', '2003-03-13 21:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(237068, 13793, 7067, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning photograph!</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning photograph!', '2003-03-13 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(237071, 13564, 1570, '<td valign="top">what a marvelous shot!</td>', 'what a marvelous shot!', '2003-03-13 22:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(237075, 13939, 6328, '<td valign="top">it seems you''re more intent on being focused on the weed than on the bridge, but you captured a nice photo.</td>', 'it seems you''re more intent on being focused on the weed than on the bridge, but you captured a nice photo.', '2003-03-13 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237077, 13895, 6328, '<td valign="top">from your point of view, it''s a piece of art, I like the way the bridge is reflected in the water, but I would like to have seen the bridge in the whole</td>', 'from your point of view, it''s a piece of art, I like the way the bridge is reflected in the water, but I would like to have seen the bridge in the whole', '2003-03-13 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237079, 13761, 1570, '<td valign="top">what a great shot!</td>', 'what a great shot!', '2003-03-13 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(237080, 13554, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice black and white photograph.  shows a lot of details, nice dof, good focus, are you shooting from a train?</td>', 'nice black and white photograph.  shows a lot of details, nice dof, good focus, are you shooting from a train?', '2003-03-13 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237081, 13645, 6328, '<td valign="top">were you using infrared?  good shadows, lot of white, not to my liking, personally.</td>', 'were you using infrared?  good shadows, lot of white, not to my liking, personally.', '2003-03-13 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237082, 13687, 6328, '<td valign="top">so where''s the bridge?</td>', 'so where''s the bridge?', '2003-03-13 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237083, 13751, 6328, '<td valign="top">This is nice and cute.  never saw a bridge like this one before.  nice detail, good dof, good crisp details, nice to see the children on the bridge.</td>', 'This is nice and cute.  never saw a bridge like this one before.  nice detail, good dof, good crisp details, nice to see the children on the bridge.', '2003-03-13 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(237084, 13543, 6328, '<td valign="top">pretty dark for black and white, but would love to have seen this in color</td>', 'pretty dark for black and white, but would love to have seen this in color', '2003-03-13 22:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(237086, 13974, 6328, '<td valign="top">just too soft for me, can''t see enough details to say much about it</td>', 'just too soft for me, can''t see enough details to say much about it', '2003-03-13 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237087, 13852, 6328, '<td valign="top">hey, this is cute, looks like a real loonnng walking bridge, nice dof, good color on the two young guys and the baloon, and the two kids are in step, too!</td>', 'hey, this is cute, looks like a real loonnng walking bridge, nice dof, good color on the two young guys and the baloon, and the two kids are in step, too!', '2003-03-13 22:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237089, 13842, 6328, '<td valign="top">Man, just look at all the art work on that bridge.  Good job capturing it.</td>', 'Man, just look at all the art work on that bridge.  Good job capturing it.', '2003-03-13 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237090, 13595, 6328, '<td valign="top">Whoa, and that thing is still standing?  Look at all that rust you''ve captured on film! Is the town not ashamed at not being able to afford to paint it?  Nice photo of bridges being neglected. . .</td>', 'Whoa, and that thing is still standing?  Look at all that rust you''ve captured on film! Is the town not ashamed at not being able to afford to paint it?  Nice photo of bridges being neglected. . .', '2003-03-13 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237093, 13811, 6328, '<td valign="top">Where''s the bridge?  Make due?  I''ll give ya two!</td>', 'Where''s the bridge?  Make due?  I''ll give ya two!', '2003-03-13 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237094, 13573, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice shot at sunset.  you''ve captured the bridge with an unusual cast of the sun upon it.  good shot, nice clouds, nice rays from the sun.</td>', 'nice shot at sunset.  you''ve captured the bridge with an unusual cast of the sun upon it.  good shot, nice clouds, nice rays from the sun.', '2003-03-13 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237095, 13561, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hey, nice idea, good imagination at use here, nice colors, good focus, nice and sharp, excellent lighting, great photography.</td>', 'Hey, nice idea, good imagination at use here, nice colors, good focus, nice and sharp, excellent lighting, great photography.', '2003-03-13 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237096, 13565, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot of a beautiful bridge.  Just love that colour.  And that shadow in the water of the bridge is a nice touch also.</td>', 'Really nice shot of a beautiful bridge.  Just love that colour.  And that shadow in the water of the bridge is a nice touch also.', '2003-03-13 22:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(237098, 13573, 6942, '<td valign="top">The sil·hou·ette idea is terrific. I love it. 10!</td>', 'The sil·hou·ette idea is terrific. I love it. 10!', '2003-03-13 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237101, 13963, 6477, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I like the colors very much</td>', 'Great picture, I like the colors very much', '2003-03-13 23:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237102, 13818, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the appearance of rushing water - is it Deception Falls becuase the water fall itself is a bit hidden?  I like the detail shown here, and the contrast that makes the bridge stand out against a fairly dark background.</td>', 'I like the appearance of rushing water - is it Deception Falls becuase the water fall itself is a bit hidden?  I like the detail shown here, and the contrast that makes the bridge stand out against a fairly dark background.', '2003-03-13 23:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237103, 13976, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit too desaturated - there''s too much darkness, and not enough contrast.  I do, however, quite like the bridge reflection visible in the rail.</td>', 'I think this is a bit too desaturated - there''s too much darkness, and not enough contrast.  I do, however, quite like the bridge reflection visible in the rail.', '2003-03-13 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(237105, 13721, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and I like how the bridge leads the eye to the background of the photo.</td>', 'Nice colors, and I like how the bridge leads the eye to the background of the photo.', '2003-03-13 23:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(237106, 13547, 2000, '<td valign="top">Creative view of grafitti, but I think this photo is a bit dark.</td>', 'Creative view of grafitti, but I think this photo is a bit dark.', '2003-03-13 23:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237107, 13940, 2000, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit more white space at the top than I think is necessary - otherwise a very nice photo.</td>', 'There''s a bit more white space at the top than I think is necessary - otherwise a very nice photo.', '2003-03-13 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237108, 13903, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great retro pic.  Looks like it was taken in the 50''s.  Good job</td>', 'Great retro pic.  Looks like it was taken in the 50''s.  Good job', '2003-03-13 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237109, 13745, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cool impression of an old song title.  The DoF here makes the trees in the background look almost painted (are you familiar with that PBS bearded guy who painted ''happy trees''?) - It works well in this photo.</td>', 'Cool impression of an old song title.  The DoF here makes the trees in the background look almost painted (are you familiar with that PBS bearded guy who painted ''happy trees''?) - It works well in this photo.', '2003-03-13 23:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237112, 13832, 2000, '<td valign="top">The frame doesn''t seem even R-L, though it''s size and color accent this photo well.  I like the detail of the mold on the bottom of the bridge - it makes it seem somewhat neglected, which I think plays well in this shot.</td>', 'The frame doesn''t seem even R-L, though it''s size and color accent this photo well.  I like the detail of the mold on the bottom of the bridge - it makes it seem somewhat neglected, which I think plays well in this shot.', '2003-03-13 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237113, 13755, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the light reflections off the bottom of the bridge.  Better with out all the stuff in the water.  quality photo</td>', 'I like the light reflections off the bottom of the bridge.  Better with out all the stuff in the water.  quality photo', '2003-03-13 23:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(237114, 13727, 2000, '<td valign="top">This seems flat to me - I think the color adjustments (sepia, I imagine) were not done quite right, and the colors are off.  Sepia I think has more contrast, with the orange/brown colors taking the place of grays.</td>', 'This seems flat to me - I think the color adjustments (sepia, I imagine) were not done quite right, and the colors are off.  Sepia I think has more contrast, with the orange/brown colors taking the place of grays.', '2003-03-13 23:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(237115, 13535, 2000, '<td valign="top">Controversial or not, that is one cool bridge - I like the straight-cablestay/ suspension bridges.  You picked a good time of day to take this also - the sunset colors contrast well off this bridge''s colors and angles.</td>', 'Controversial or not, that is one cool bridge - I like the straight-cablestay/ suspension bridges.  You picked a good time of day to take this also - the sunset colors contrast well off this bridge''s colors and angles.', '2003-03-13 23:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237116, 13550, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the distorted reflections in the water and likewise the reflections from the water on the bottom of the bridge.  I''m not real sure about the angle this was taken from .  i think from a little further back it would''ve revealed a little more of those awesome reflections.</td>', 'I like the distorted reflections in the water and likewise the reflections from the water on the bottom of the bridge.  I''m not real sure about the angle this was taken from .  i think from a little further back it would''ve revealed a little more of those awesome reflections.', '2003-03-13 23:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237118, 13917, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of diminishing space from the tunnel effect.  It seems off somehow, like off center or something - not sure exactly, but there''s just that little something about it.  I hope someone else commented that with more useful information.</td>', 'I like the perspective of diminishing space from the tunnel effect.  It seems off somehow, like off center or something - not sure exactly, but there''s just that little something about it.  I hope someone else commented that with more useful information.', '2003-03-13 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(237119, 13768, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Just cute.  Nice detail level, and the train going over the top adds a nice touch of action and color.</td>', 'Cute.  Just cute.  Nice detail level, and the train going over the top adds a nice touch of action and color.', '2003-03-13 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(237120, 13595, 3540, '<td valign="top">Clarity is a huge issue with this picture.   The angle and perspective of this photo are not really conducive to showing the essential elements of this bridge.</td>', 'Clarity is a huge issue with this picture.   The angle and perspective of this photo are not really conducive to showing the essential elements of this bridge.', '2003-03-13 23:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(237121, 13766, 2000, '<td valign="top">This is one of those unique bridge shots that can really only be taken in a few areas.  I like the background, and I like the ripple detail in the water.  The people, however, are a bit dark and blend into the builiding directly behind them.</td>', 'This is one of those unique bridge shots that can really only be taken in a few areas.  I like the background, and I like the ripple detail in the water.  The people, however, are a bit dark and blend into the builiding directly behind them.', '2003-03-13 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237122, 13677, 2000, '<td valign="top">Your title provides a new way to think about the arches in bridge trestles, and I think creating a new viewpoint is a very good thing to do.  I like the repeating effect created by your through-shot - i wonder if that part (not the bridge overall) could be a bit more centered - the second trestle looks off by the smallest amount.</td>', 'Your title provides a new way to think about the arches in bridge trestles, and I think creating a new viewpoint is a very good thing to do.  I like the repeating effect created by your through-shot - i wonder if that part (not the bridge overall) could be a bit more centered - the second trestle looks off by the smallest amount.', '2003-03-13 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237123, 13698, 2000, '<td valign="top">You''re fortunate to have such a bridge available to you to photograph.  I like the color contrast and pretty much everything about this photo.  I also like those signs on the side of the bridge showing the 11''5" height in an area where there really shouldn''t be any vehicles in the first place.</td>', 'You''re fortunate to have such a bridge available to you to photograph.  I like the color contrast and pretty much everything about this photo.  I also like those signs on the side of the bridge showing the 11''5" height in an area where there really shouldn''t be any vehicles in the first place.', '2003-03-13 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237125, 13842, 2000, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t ride over this bridge, but it''s a fairly nice photograph.</td>', 'I wouldn''t ride over this bridge, but it''s a fairly nice photograph.', '2003-03-13 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237127, 13796, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like it came out of the movie TRON.  This effect works for this photo.  I have a feeling you''re going to have a lot of "love it" votes and "hate it" votes.  I really like this photo.  The part I really love is the buildings in the background more than the bridges in the foreground in all honesty.  Great photo and effect. -10</td>', 'Looks like it came out of the movie TRON.  This effect works for this photo.  I have a feeling you''re going to have a lot of "love it" votes and "hate it" votes.  I really like this photo.  The part I really love is the buildings in the background more than the bridges in the foreground in all honesty.  Great photo and effect. -10', '2003-03-13 23:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(237128, 13947, 2000, '<td valign="top">A time-exposure shot - I think that''s the only one I''ve seen in this challenge.  This is done quite well - the only motion visible in the shot is the vehicle''s trailing taillights.</td>', 'A time-exposure shot - I think that''s the only one I''ve seen in this challenge.  This is done quite well - the only motion visible in the shot is the vehicle''s trailing taillights.', '2003-03-13 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237129, 13765, 2000, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking you might have waited like 30 minutes to take this shot - the sun glare on the side of the bridge washes out some of the detail to my view.  It''s a nice shot otherwise - good camera placement and framing, and good colors outside of the washed out portion of the bridge.</td>', 'I''m thinking you might have waited like 30 minutes to take this shot - the sun glare on the side of the bridge washes out some of the detail to my view.  It''s a nice shot otherwise - good camera placement and framing, and good colors outside of the washed out portion of the bridge.', '2003-03-13 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237130, 13637, 3540, '<td valign="top">There is too much foreground stuff.  A hint here or there would''ve been good but I don''t think this much is necessary.  Actually it''s quite distracting to this wonderful bridge.</td>', 'There is too much foreground stuff.  A hint here or there would''ve been good but I don''t think this much is necessary.  Actually it''s quite distracting to this wonderful bridge.', '2003-03-13 23:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237131, 13770, 2000, '<td valign="top">Taking a shot of a bridge from underneath that same bridge - not something that can usually be done easily.  The view and framing are good, but the suspension span seems a bit either OOF or washed out, I can''t really tell which.</td>', 'Taking a shot of a bridge from underneath that same bridge - not something that can usually be done easily.  The view and framing are good, but the suspension span seems a bit either OOF or washed out, I can''t really tell which.', '2003-03-13 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(237132, 13804, 2000, '<td valign="top">A suspension bridge in the woods - what a rare find.  I like this panoramic shot, but it''s a bit dark/over-sepiaed to my eye.</td>', 'A suspension bridge in the woods - what a rare find.  I like this panoramic shot, but it''s a bit dark/over-sepiaed to my eye.', '2003-03-13 23:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237133, 13878, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  The perspective is great.  I like the little bit of reflections in the wetlands below.  Its a nice taste without choking on it and it remains very clear.  Very, very well done - 10</td>', 'Awesome.  The perspective is great.  I like the little bit of reflections in the wetlands below.  Its a nice taste without choking on it and it remains very clear.  Very, very well done - 10', '2003-03-13 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(237134, 13576, 2000, '<td valign="top">The first thing I really saw was the ''face'' of the tower - two upper windows (eyes), center (nose) and gate (mouth).  Very nice capture - I hope you specified the location in your details.  It looks like one of the walled cities in Germany I saw last summer.</td>', 'The first thing I really saw was the ''face'' of the tower - two upper windows (eyes), center (nose) and gate (mouth).  Very nice capture - I hope you specified the location in your details.  It looks like one of the walled cities in Germany I saw last summer.', '2003-03-13 23:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(237135, 13638, 2000, '<td valign="top">It was a dark and stormy looking photograph, and there''s something (maybe from the lighting) in the left third/quad that looks like a heavy line running all the way from the sky to the water.</td>', 'It was a dark and stormy looking photograph, and there''s something (maybe from the lighting) in the left third/quad that looks like a heavy line running all the way from the sky to the water.', '2003-03-13 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237136, 13575, 2000, '<td valign="top">For your next photo submission, try keeping the file size larger if you can (higher JPEG quality) - the clarity that is a little lacking in this photograph would be corrected by that adjustment IMO.</td>', 'For your next photo submission, try keeping the file size larger if you can (higher JPEG quality) - the clarity that is a little lacking in this photograph would be corrected by that adjustment IMO.', '2003-03-13 23:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237137, 13840, 3540, '<td valign="top">The snow on the rocks is great.  The bridge is well camoflauged into the background.  It is a nice photo but not because of the bridge IMO.</td>', 'The snow on the rocks is great.  The bridge is well camoflauged into the background.  It is a nice photo but not because of the bridge IMO.', '2003-03-13 23:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237138, 13653, 3540, '<td valign="top">This could be just a little sharper.  The dreary weather is not helping things at all.  I think going greyscale would''ve been an option worth exploring.</td>', 'This could be just a little sharper.  The dreary weather is not helping things at all.  I think going greyscale would''ve been an option worth exploring.', '2003-03-13 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237139, 13948, 2000, '<td valign="top">A little too green - sepias are usually orangeish from my experience, and this, while a fairly good photograph overall, loses a lot by it''s color.</td>', 'A little too green - sepias are usually orangeish from my experience, and this, while a fairly good photograph overall, loses a lot by it''s color.', '2003-03-13 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237141, 13681, 3540, '<td valign="top">Underexposed and lacking contrast.  Everything is just a little too grey.  The car underneath is not really helping anything.</td>', 'Underexposed and lacking contrast.  Everything is just a little too grey.  The car underneath is not really helping anything.', '2003-03-13 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(237142, 13749, 2000, '<td valign="top">A very nice ''Before and After'' type shot.  The lower portion of the photo is somewhat dark IMO, but I like the level of detail and framing.</td>', 'A very nice ''Before and After'' type shot.  The lower portion of the photo is somewhat dark IMO, but I like the level of detail and framing.', '2003-03-13 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237143, 13778, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo under the bridge.</td>', 'Nice clear photo under the bridge.', '2003-03-13 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237144, 13549, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on this throwback to the sixties shot.  The greyscale gives it that sixties mood I think.  Nice job</td>', 'Great perspective on this throwback to the sixties shot.  The greyscale gives it that sixties mood I think.  Nice job', '2003-03-13 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237145, 13678, 2000, '<td valign="top">Like the \''Before and After\'' challenge from a little while back.  Nice capture, and I like the shadows and ripples/reflection visible in the water.</td>', 'Like the \''Before and After\'' challenge from a little while back.  Nice capture, and I like the shadows and ripples/reflection visible in the water.', '2003-03-13 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237150, 13764, 7285, '<td valign="top">great photo!</td>', 'great photo!', '2003-03-14 00:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(237155, 13719, 7065, '<td valign="top">NICE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/></td>', 'NICE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-03-14 00:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237156, 13688, 7065, '<td valign="top">Awsome!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Awsome!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-03-14 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237157, 13800, 7065, '<td valign="top">How did you get that?</td>', 'How did you get that?', '2003-03-14 00:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237159, 13808, 7065, '<td valign="top">I''v seen a guitar but this is amazing!</td>', 'I''v seen a guitar but this is amazing!', '2003-03-14 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237160, 13713, 7065, '<td valign="top">Love it keep it up.<br/></td>', 'Love it keep it up.', '2003-03-14 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(237161, 13841, 7065, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2003-03-14 00:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(237162, 13766, 7065, '<td valign="top">Neat!</td>', 'Neat!', '2003-03-14 00:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(237164, 13678, 7065, '<td valign="top">That is nice Really.</td>', 'That is nice Really.', '2003-03-14 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237165, 13709, 7065, '<td valign="top">Neat</td>', 'Neat', '2003-03-14 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
