(237167, 13844, 7065, '<td valign="top">That''s cool</td>', 'That''s cool', '2003-03-14 00:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(237168, 13816, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot and subject. I wish you could have had more punch in the bridge - it just lays there  and the water sparkles.</td>', 'Good shot and subject. I wish you could have had more punch in the bridge - it just lays there  and the water sparkles.', '2003-03-14 00:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237169, 13895, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good potential. I have found water and reflections are very hard - I have not unlocked their secrets. But I think the top part of the image is too soft and out of focus - maybe you could have shot just the reflections.</td>', 'Good potential. I have found water and reflections are very hard - I have not unlocked their secrets. But I think the top part of the image is too soft and out of focus - maybe you could have shot just the reflections.', '2003-03-14 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(237171, 13842, 6325, '<td valign="top">Seems the point is not a "train", but the art painted on the bridge. Maybe move in on the artwork and work on focus.</td>', 'Seems the point is not a "train", but the art painted on the bridge. Maybe move in on the artwork and work on focus.', '2003-03-14 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(237172, 13864, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great subject - the bridge. Maybe move in closer to the water and lose the close-in material.</td>', 'Great subject - the bridge. Maybe move in closer to the water and lose the close-in material.', '2003-03-14 01:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237174, 13846, 6325, '<td valign="top">Fantastic bridge and snow. How did you get in position to get the shot? Everything is so flat, it is hard to appreciate the potential. I am struggling for concrete suggestions to help the image. Maybe add to the flatness - go to black and white, crop out some of the top and right, pump up brightness for a white-on-white image.</td>', 'Fantastic bridge and snow. How did you get in position to get the shot? Everything is so flat, it is hard to appreciate the potential. I am struggling for concrete suggestions to help the image. Maybe add to the flatness - go to black and white, crop out some of the top and right, pump up brightness for a white-on-white image.', '2003-03-14 01:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237177, 13663, 6605, '<td valign="top">She has beautiful hair, a nice slim figure, but I''m  j u s t not seeing a bridge pic here.  I assume theirs a bridge to the left of this pic.  It''s not even in focus.  I''ll give you a 2 for your effort.  Actually put her on a bridge, in focus, and I bet your pic would get a  l o t  more attention.</td>', 'She has beautiful hair, a nice slim figure, but I''m  j u s t not seeing a bridge pic here.  I assume theirs a bridge to the left of this pic.  It''s not even in focus.  I''ll give you a 2 for your effort.  Actually put her on a bridge, in focus, and I bet your pic would get a  l o t  more attention.', '2003-03-14 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237184, 13588, 6328, '<td valign="top">quite imaginative bridge to say the least.  very colorful, lots of red''s, like the brickwork.</td>', 'quite imaginative bridge to say the least.  very colorful, lots of red''s, like the brickwork.', '2003-03-14 03:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(237185, 13645, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, the composition is very appealing. This photo would have done well in the leading lines contest with the bridge leading to that building out the back. The lines on the water are amazing. Good shot.</td>', 'This is good, the composition is very appealing. This photo would have done well in the leading lines contest with the bridge leading to that building out the back. The lines on the water are amazing. Good shot.', '2003-03-14 03:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237186, 13608, 6328, '<td valign="top">my, what an excellent photograph.  Love the blue sky and the blue waters.  those clouds are lovely too.  the bridge us just tremendous looking.  Good job.</td>', 'my, what an excellent photograph.  Love the blue sky and the blue waters.  those clouds are lovely too.  the bridge us just tremendous looking.  Good job.', '2003-03-14 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(237187, 13801, 5728, '<td valign="top">The curve on the wall leading up to the bridge is a good touch, although it tends to lead my eyes off the photo before I get to the bridge. Otherwise a very good photo.</td>', 'The curve on the wall leading up to the bridge is a good touch, although it tends to lead my eyes off the photo before I get to the bridge. Otherwise a very good photo.', '2003-03-14 03:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237188, 13659, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice shot looking down like this.  lots of color n the garden, like the gnarled wood that the bridge is made out of.</td>', 'nice shot looking down like this.  lots of color n the garden, like the gnarled wood that the bridge is made out of.', '2003-03-14 03:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237189, 13588, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very good perspective and you have composed it very well. The detail and colors are wonderful.</td>', 'This is a very good perspective and you have composed it very well. The detail and colors are wonderful.', '2003-03-14 03:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237190, 13841, 6328, '<td valign="top">lovely picture to be taken in the winter with all the snow and ice freezing over the water.  It must look just beautiful here in the summer time.  You''ve got a beautul blue sky up there too.</td>', 'lovely picture to be taken in the winter with all the snow and ice freezing over the water.  It must look just beautiful here in the summer time.  You''ve got a beautul blue sky up there too.', '2003-03-14 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(237191, 13872, 6328, '<td valign="top">lovely photo in a jungle setting?  like the way it''s mirrored in the reflection of the watter also.  lots of trees and greenery to look at also.  nice job</td>', 'lovely photo in a jungle setting?  like the way it''s mirrored in the reflection of the watter also.  lots of trees and greenery to look at also.  nice job', '2003-03-14 03:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237192, 13558, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice black and white that you''ve taken here my friend.  Looks like a very long walk from one end to the other, and you would feel trapped if you had any kind of mental illness, wouldn''t you?  once again, nice photograph, nice dof.</td>', 'Really nice black and white that you''ve taken here my friend.  Looks like a very long walk from one end to the other, and you would feel trapped if you had any kind of mental illness, wouldn''t you?  once again, nice photograph, nice dof.', '2003-03-14 03:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(237193, 13570, 6328, '<td valign="top">really falling apart from the looks of things, isn''t it? you''ve done a nice job of capturing it all on your film.  Great shadows, good colors, good cropping, sharpness is there.  nicely done.</td>', 'really falling apart from the looks of things, isn''t it? you''ve done a nice job of capturing it all on your film.  Great shadows, good colors, good cropping, sharpness is there.  nicely done.', '2003-03-14 03:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(237194, 13539, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is so cute to see that dog come walking along the bridge like this.  You did a nice job of taking this picture, getting low down to the deck where you need to be.  Really good job.</td>', 'Wow, this is so cute to see that dog come walking along the bridge like this.  You did a nice job of taking this picture, getting low down to the deck where you need to be.  Really good job.', '2003-03-14 03:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237195, 13791, 6328, '<td valign="top">It looks like a bridge that''s been forgotten.  I really like the way you''ve gotten down close to the planking to take this photo.  One can see the grain in the wood, and your depth of field is really great.  One can tell tht a lot of work went into building this old bridge, a lot of great workmanship.  A lovely Black and White photograph.  Congratulations! !</td>', 'It looks like a bridge that''s been forgotten.  I really like the way you''ve gotten down close to the planking to take this photo.  One can see the grain in the wood, and your depth of field is really great.  One can tell tht a lot of work went into building this old bridge, a lot of great workmanship.  A lovely Black and White photograph.  Congratulations! !', '2003-03-14 03:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237196, 13681, 6328, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job of capturing the bridge up on top of the roadway, you show the blackness of it and the yellow paint on the railing below on the road, but I really don''t like the way you''ve faded the picture out,making it soft or something. . .</td>', 'You did a nice job of capturing the bridge up on top of the roadway, you show the blackness of it and the yellow paint on the railing below on the road, but I really don''t like the way you''ve faded the picture out,making it soft or something. . .', '2003-03-14 03:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237198, 13551, 6328, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph, but I don''t see how this can be part of a bridge.  I really like the colouring of the bricks and the continual supports as shown, but I would have to see a bigger picture to see how it all fits in with a bridge?</td>', 'I love this photograph, but I don''t see how this can be part of a bridge.  I really like the colouring of the bricks and the continual supports as shown, but I would have to see a bigger picture to see how it all fits in with a bridge?', '2003-03-14 03:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
