(237228, 13802, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an original idea, and it has a lot of impact! Very good crop here, I have no idea of knowing how high this bridge is, but somehow this photo gives me the feeling that it is very very high. Good job, you deserve a "high" score here.</td>', 'This is an original idea, and it has a lot of impact! Very good crop here, I have no idea of knowing how high this bridge is, but somehow this photo gives me the feeling that it is very very high. Good job, you deserve a "high" score here.', '2003-03-14 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
