(237324, 13716, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot, very nice.  This is an angle I would have never thought of.  The patterns from the stanchions and lights are very appealing.  The stuff in the lower foreground isn''t as appealing, somewhat out of your control, but maybe worth trying a different location.  6 Swash</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot, very nice.  This is an angle I would have never thought of.  The patterns from the stanchions and lights are very appealing.  The stuff in the lower foreground isn''t as appealing, somewhat out of your control, but maybe worth trying a different location.  6 Swash', '2003-03-14 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(237330, 13708, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like your use of black and white here.  You have managed to capture the details in the shadows without burning out your highlights.  That is not necessarily easy to do. Good detail in the stones as well.  I really like the way you have cropped this into almost a panorama.  The only small thing I find wrong with this photograph is the small amount of tilt.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like your use of black and white here.  You have managed to capture the details in the shadows without burning out your highlights.  That is not necessarily easy to do. Good detail in the stones as well.  I really like the way you have cropped this into almost a panorama.  The only small thing I find wrong with this photograph is the small amount of tilt.', '2003-03-14 15:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
