(237350, 13564, 6328, '<td valign="top">came back to this after rating it and just realized - did you take it with a fisheye? Still left you with a 4 though, it''s so hard to judge looking at it this way.</td>', 'came back to this after rating it and just realized - did you take it with a fisheye? Still left you with a 4 though, it''s so hard to judge looking at it this way.', '2003-03-14 16:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237351, 13552, 6328, '<td valign="top">really nice shot but that timing thing at the bottom really takes away from your work.  Like your angle and all. . .</td>', 'really nice shot but that timing thing at the bottom really takes away from your work.  Like your angle and all. . .', '2003-03-14 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237353, 13670, 6328, '<td valign="top">you''ve got nice color here, I like the red bricks, etc, the white painting, the interior of the tunnel, the grass and water, but how do I know it''s a bridge, you don''t go back far enough to show me any details, which would have been nice, and what kind of bridge is it, a rail/road/pedestrian?</td>', 'you''ve got nice color here, I like the red bricks, etc, the white painting, the interior of the tunnel, the grass and water, but how do I know it''s a bridge, you don''t go back far enough to show me any details, which would have been nice, and what kind of bridge is it, a rail/road/pedestrian?', '2003-03-14 16:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237357, 13662, 6328, '<td valign="top">much too small to appreciate.  You''re allowed to send your photo up to 640x480 150k total in size.  this is way to small to comment on your photo, although the lighting looks really great, a larger size would have been much better to give more detail, especially at night.</td>', 'much too small to appreciate.  You''re allowed to send your photo up to 640x480 150k total in size.  this is way to small to comment on your photo, although the lighting looks really great, a larger size would have been much better to give more detail, especially at night.', '2003-03-14 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(237359, 13748, 6328, '<td valign="top">sorry, I just don\''t see what you see, nice ighting at night, nice way you''ve got it colored b.lue/purple</td>', 'sorry, I just don\''t see what you see, nice ighting at night, nice way you''ve got it colored b.lue/purple', '2003-03-14 16:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237360, 13628, 6328, '<td valign="top">really busy little place with the homes and the freeway running through it, prbably makes a lot of noise.  very colorful with the houses and the car lot down at the bottom.</td>', 'really busy little place with the homes and the freeway running through it, prbably makes a lot of noise.  very colorful with the houses and the car lot down at the bottom.', '2003-03-14 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237364, 13597, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice wintery scene you''ve got here.  captured some nice grain on the wooden bridge and what looks like rain/snow/hail coming down at the same time.<br/>nice interior work on the bridge too.</td>', 'nice wintery scene you''ve got here.  captured some nice grain on the wooden bridge and what looks like rain/snow/hail coming down at the same time.nice interior work on the bridge too.', '2003-03-14 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237368, 13802, 6328, '<td valign="top">I would not want to be up there on a windy day.  What a photo!  Look at that flag waving at people.  What a picture!  Look at the strength of that thing just sitting in the air waiting for the rest of it. . .  Great job in taking this photograph!</td>', 'I would not want to be up there on a windy day.  What a photo!  Look at that flag waving at people.  What a picture!  Look at the strength of that thing just sitting in the air waiting for the rest of it. . .  Great job in taking this photograph!', '2003-03-14 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(237369, 13873, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You''ve captured my attention with this photograph. . .<br/>I''m waiting for a sailboat to come silently sailing through the fog. . .<br/>You''ve captured great detail, the ladders on the concrete, the trees in the foggy background, I can almost hear a foghorn blowing. . .<br/>Great job! !</td>', 'Wow!  You''ve captured my attention with this photograph. . .I''m waiting for a sailboat to come silently sailing through the fog. . .You''ve captured great detail, the ladders on the concrete, the trees in the foggy background, I can almost hear a foghorn blowing. . .Great job! !', '2003-03-14 17:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237371, 13746, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Talk about old!  You captured imagination here.  Look at those old rusty bolts, discolored timbers, the colorful forest.  Is this in South America?  Still in use?<br/>Look at the colour on those timbers!!  What a photograph.  Great job.  Good clarity, good focus, great exposure, fantastic DOF!  Please let me know where this is, as I''m a railway fan in N-scale.</td>', 'Wow!  Talk about old!  You captured imagination here.  Look at those old rusty bolts, discolored timbers, the colorful forest.  Is this in South America?  Still in use?Look at the colour on those timbers!!  What a photograph.  Great job.  Good clarity, good focus, great exposure, fantastic DOF!  Please let me know where this is, as I''m a railway fan in N-scale.', '2003-03-14 17:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237374, 13969, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hey, great night shot of that bridge!  I really like the reflective lighting on the water from the shoreside lighting.  You did a good job of getting this photograph.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Hey, great night shot of that bridge!  I really like the reflective lighting on the water from the shoreside lighting.  You did a good job of getting this photograph.  Congratulations!', '2003-03-14 17:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237376, 13636, 6328, '<td valign="top">really nice photo, nice shot of the bridge all the way to the other end.</td>', 'really nice photo, nice shot of the bridge all the way to the other end.', '2003-03-14 17:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237381, 13637, 6328, '<td valign="top">I just love this picture of this bridge, but I would have taken a saw and cut that damn tree down with all the branches in the way, all it does is clutter up a nice photograph!!!<br/>I like the reflections in the water, nice crisp red colors of the bridge, but all those damn branches.........</td>', 'I just love this picture of this bridge, but I would have taken a saw and cut that damn tree down with all the branches in the way, all it does is clutter up a nice photograph!!!I like the reflections in the water, nice crisp red colors of the bridge, but all those damn branches.........', '2003-03-14 17:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(237382, 13809, 6328, '<td valign="top">seems a bit out of focus on the first pillar here, the land seems more in focus, your emphasis seems more on the land and water than on the bridge,</td>', 'seems a bit out of focus on the first pillar here, the land seems more in focus, your emphasis seems more on the land and water than on the bridge,', '2003-03-14 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(237383, 13644, 6328, '<td valign="top">Well, nice shot of an old bridge, but a shot head on would have done better, just too many branches in the way causing too much interference, would like to have seen some interior details.</td>', 'Well, nice shot of an old bridge, but a shot head on would have done better, just too many branches in the way causing too much interference, would like to have seen some interior details.', '2003-03-14 17:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237384, 13846, 6328, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to make any sense out of this at all.  I can''t distinguish the bridge from the rest of the scenery/rock formations.  Came back to this 4 times and I finally see the bridge and the falls, it just seems to come all together as one piece of picture, hard to distinguish as parts of a scenery, almost as if you were hiding "waldo" on me.  I''ve change you from a 3 to a six.  Nice job,</td>', 'I can''t seem to make any sense out of this at all.  I can''t distinguish the bridge from the rest of the scenery/rock formations.  Came back to this 4 times and I finally see the bridge and the falls, it just seems to come all together as one piece of picture, hard to distinguish as parts of a scenery, almost as if you were hiding "waldo" on me.  I''ve change you from a 3 to a six.  Nice job,', '2003-03-14 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237385, 13680, 2223, '<td valign="top">i had the EXACT same guitar once!!</td>', 'i had the EXACT same guitar once!!', '2003-03-14 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(237386, 13637, 4224, '<td valign="top">such striking color in such a bleak looking world</td>', 'such striking color in such a bleak looking world', '2003-03-14 17:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237387, 13794, 811, '<td valign="top">I love how the bridge "bounces" you to the cathedral.  Wonderful night shot.  And I lvoe the effect on the lights (star filter?)</td>', 'I love how the bridge "bounces" you to the cathedral.  Wonderful night shot.  And I lvoe the effect on the lights (star filter?)', '2003-03-14 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(237388, 13536, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful exposure.  The lights are blown out, yet you can still see a great deal fo detail in the bridge and water.  Wonderful</td>', 'Wonderful exposure.  The lights are blown out, yet you can still see a great deal fo detail in the bridge and water.  Wonderful', '2003-03-14 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(237389, 13947, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have composed this with the other building in the background and on the left.  Great exposure.</td>', 'I really like how you have composed this with the other building in the background and on the left.  Great exposure.', '2003-03-14 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237390, 13561, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  A little bright on the upper left parts, but otherwise, very nicely done.</td>', 'Great composition.  A little bright on the upper left parts, but otherwise, very nicely done.', '2003-03-14 17:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237391, 13873, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice "use" of the fog.  I also like the color tones (or lack thereof) you ahve used here.</td>', 'Nice "use" of the fog.  I also like the color tones (or lack thereof) you ahve used here.', '2003-03-14 17:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(237392, 13801, 811, '<td valign="top">The counter curving motion really adds a lot of dynamics to this shot, I think.</td>', 'The counter curving motion really adds a lot of dynamics to this shot, I think.', '2003-03-14 17:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(237393, 13753, 811, '<td valign="top">The surreal tilt of this shot really adds interest.  Great exposure.</td>', 'The surreal tilt of this shot really adds interest.  Great exposure.', '2003-03-14 17:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(237394, 13974, 811, '<td valign="top">A ver nice shot, effectively using a soft focus.  I think this shot works well for showing the difference between "out of focus" and "soft focus."  I think cropping it a little more on the left, and not centering the  "covering" so much would have given it more dynamics.</td>', 'A ver nice shot, effectively using a soft focus.  I think this shot works well for showing the difference between "out of focus" and "soft focus."  I think cropping it a little more on the left, and not centering the  "covering" so much would have given it more dynamics.', '2003-03-14 17:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(237395, 13878, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast level you ahve used in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the contrast level you ahve used in this shot.', '2003-03-14 17:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237396, 13573, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the sun between the supports, and i like the effect the blue sky has</td>', 'Nice placement of the sun between the supports, and i like the effect the blue sky has', '2003-03-14 17:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(237397, 13564, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective.  REally makes you stop and look, I think</td>', 'Cool perspective.  REally makes you stop and look, I think', '2003-03-14 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(237398, 13750, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the quietness  and "quaintness" of this shot.  Very peaceful looking.  I  wish you had a blue sky this week, this would have been really nice contrasted with the green grass and greenish tints of the roofs.</td>', 'I like the quietness  and "quaintness" of this shot.  Very peaceful looking.  I  wish you had a blue sky this week, this would have been really nice contrasted with the green grass and greenish tints of the roofs.', '2003-03-14 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237399, 13797, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a little more room in the top left of the picture (where the "swell" is).  I feel like I am going to bump my head. :-)  Great capture of the detail in the bridge, though, and bw works very well here, I think.</td>', 'I think it needs a little more room in the top left of the picture (where the "swell" is).  I feel like I am going to bump my head. :-)  Great capture of the detail in the bridge, though, and bw works very well here, I think.', '2003-03-14 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(237400, 13903, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it needs to be just a touch tighter on the left, with maybe more of the bridge showing on the right.  I really like the bw -- it gives it a mysterious feeling.</td>', 'I think it needs to be just a touch tighter on the left, with maybe more of the bridge showing on the right.  I really like the bw -- it gives it a mysterious feeling.', '2003-03-14 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237403, 13576, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...just wish the sky had some more detail and color.</td>', 'Beautiful shot...just wish the sky had some more detail and color.', '2003-03-14 18:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237404, 13680, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I"m not sure I like the reflections in the trees or window all that much</td>', 'Nice colors, but I"m not sure I like the reflections in the trees or window all that much', '2003-03-14 18:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237413, 13960, 6855, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! What a fun, creative approach!  I really love it.</td>', 'Gorgeous! What a fun, creative approach!  I really love it.', '2003-03-14 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237414, 13789, 6855, '<td valign="top">Clever approach, and I like the tonal finish!</td>', 'Clever approach, and I like the tonal finish!', '2003-03-14 19:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237415, 13737, 6855, '<td valign="top">Very cute bridge and the sky looked gorgeous that day!  The shadows and sunlight made a wonderful effect as well.  Great shot!</td>', 'Very cute bridge and the sky looked gorgeous that day!  The shadows and sunlight made a wonderful effect as well.  Great shot!', '2003-03-14 19:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(237417, 13791, 6855, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on this bridge!  Seems cropped a little tight at the top, but still very interesting to look at!</td>', 'Great perspective on this bridge!  Seems cropped a little tight at the top, but still very interesting to look at!', '2003-03-14 19:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237418, 13636, 6855, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot - looks more like a painting.  The lighting is incredible.  Great job.</td>', 'Fascinating shot - looks more like a painting.  The lighting is incredible.  Great job.', '2003-03-14 19:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
