(237470, 13583, 6752, '<td valign="top">is this taken the same place as the "alone" photo ?</td>', 'is this taken the same place as the "alone" photo ?', '2003-03-14 21:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(237471, 13581, 6752, '<td valign="top">is this take the same place at "footbrigde"  ? the ice  on the bridge is the same im sure and also there is a spot of something the same place in the photo e.g. dirt/rain on the lence .</td>', 'is this take the same place at "footbrigde"  ? the ice  on the bridge is the same im sure and also there is a spot of something the same place in the photo e.g. dirt/rain on the lence .', '2003-03-14 22:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237473, 13806, 5822, '<td valign="top">You did a very nice job of capturing the atomosphere in this shot.</td>', 'You did a very nice job of capturing the atomosphere in this shot.', '2003-03-14 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237475, 13748, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Surreal, abstract.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Surreal, abstract.', '2003-03-14 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(237476, 13740, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I don''t really see the bridge.  The "Glory" is glorious though!  :-)</td>', 'Very nice, but I don''t really see the bridge.  The "Glory" is glorious though!  :-)', '2003-03-14 22:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237483, 13713, 1280, '<td valign="top">What a classic!  Very nice.</td>', 'What a classic!  Very nice.', '2003-03-14 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(237486, 13903, 6870, '<td valign="top">Stunning. This is my favorite of all. But perhaps too much negative space on the left? 10</td>', 'Stunning. This is my favorite of all. But perhaps too much negative space on the left? 10', '2003-03-14 23:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(237487, 13801, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasts here, and I like the darkness and tones. You have nice main lines that lead the eye, but it does tend to get a bit busy after that. Nice work. 9</td>', 'I love the contrasts here, and I like the darkness and tones. You have nice main lines that lead the eye, but it does tend to get a bit busy after that. Nice work. 9', '2003-03-14 23:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237488, 13576, 6870, '<td valign="top">A good sky for light, but a nice sky would have been good to have behind this bridge. Well composed and sharp.</td>', 'A good sky for light, but a nice sky would have been good to have behind this bridge. Well composed and sharp.', '2003-03-14 23:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237489, 13727, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this image. I also like how the ducks are slightly blurred in relation to the motionless bridge. That ivymakes all the difference. I think that this is well composed and that a lot of thought went into it. Your objectives seem clear and the choices leading to that seem appropriate, so I''m giving it a 9. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the tones in this image. I also like how the ducks are slightly blurred in relation to the motionless bridge. That ivymakes all the difference. I think that this is well composed and that a lot of thought went into it. Your objectives seem clear and the choices leading to that seem appropriate, so I''m giving it a 9. Nice work.', '2003-03-14 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(237490, 13824, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sharp! and the wonderland of lines works. You have the right perspective here,and I love the tones. 9</td>', 'Sharp! and the wonderland of lines works. You have the right perspective here,and I love the tones. 9', '2003-03-14 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237491, 13582, 6870, '<td valign="top">This could be an interesting shot. THe bridge is well placed in the frame, and the environment seems appropriately attention gettting. The negative image, however does nothing but make everything confusing.</td>', 'This could be an interesting shot. THe bridge is well placed in the frame, and the environment seems appropriately attention gettting. The negative image, however does nothing but make everything confusing.', '2003-03-14 23:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237492, 13581, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. The angle of the bridge is interesting. I''m not so sure about the figure on the left. Up close like this, she doesn''t seem "alone" as much as some other choices might have. I''m sure folks have mentioned the blurr in the center of the photo. That is probably a reflection of light on your camera lens.</td>', 'I like this idea. The angle of the bridge is interesting. I''m not so sure about the figure on the left. Up close like this, she doesn''t seem "alone" as much as some other choices might have. I''m sure folks have mentioned the blurr in the center of the photo. That is probably a reflection of light on your camera lens.', '2003-03-14 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237493, 13838, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bit dark when I want to see details here, but I do think that the converging lines make your title come to life.</td>', 'A bit dark when I want to see details here, but I do think that the converging lines make your title come to life.', '2003-03-14 23:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237494, 13608, 6870, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, but a good perspective. Waiting for more interesting light would have really helped you here, in my opinion, and would have made your highlights much more dramatic and dynamic.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, but a good perspective. Waiting for more interesting light would have really helped you here, in my opinion, and would have made your highlights much more dramatic and dynamic.', '2003-03-14 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237495, 13670, 6870, '<td valign="top">The bridge is interesting, and the path that leads to it is a good choice. The grass, however, isn''t near as exciting as the bridge or the water, and it ends up being negative space that doesn''t balance the bridge.</td>', 'The bridge is interesting, and the path that leads to it is a good choice. The grass, however, isn''t near as exciting as the bridge or the water, and it ends up being negative space that doesn''t balance the bridge.', '2003-03-14 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237497, 13719, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and placement of the bridge. Light is interesting, especially on the snow. The resolution of your image is quite poor, making some of your lines jagged. It also seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Nice composition and placement of the bridge. Light is interesting, especially on the snow. The resolution of your image is quite poor, making some of your lines jagged. It also seems a bit out of focus.', '2003-03-14 23:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237498, 13581, 2279, '<td valign="top">It looks like your lens has a huge water drop on it and plus you cut off your models head.</td>', 'It looks like your lens has a huge water drop on it and plus you cut off your models head.', '2003-03-14 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(237499, 13936, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve a good eye for patterns, and I like the patterns of water reflection here. It might be more effective to actually zero in on them, if that''s your subject. THey are in steep competition with lots of other objects here that do not capture my interest.</td>', 'You''ve a good eye for patterns, and I like the patterns of water reflection here. It might be more effective to actually zero in on them, if that''s your subject. THey are in steep competition with lots of other objects here that do not capture my interest.', '2003-03-14 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(237500, 13711, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and composition, though I''d zoom in just a bit more. I like your perspective. It is out of focus. You might try this shot when there is more interesting light.</td>', 'Nice lines and composition, though I''d zoom in just a bit more. I like your perspective. It is out of focus. You might try this shot when there is more interesting light.', '2003-03-14 23:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(237501, 13767, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot one of my favorites. One thing I would do after the challenge is clone out those telephone wires in PS. Then it would look like the traintracks to nowhere. Good job.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot one of my favorites. One thing I would do after the challenge is clone out those telephone wires in PS. Then it would look like the traintracks to nowhere. Good job.', '2003-03-14 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237503, 13708, 6870, '<td valign="top">Seems a little washed, though I like the composition contrasting the two archways. It may improve with more interesting light.</td>', 'Seems a little washed, though I like the composition contrasting the two archways. It may improve with more interesting light.', '2003-03-14 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(237504, 13697, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good perspective for contrasting these two bridges. Quite out of focus,however, and may be even more dramatic with more interesting light.</td>', 'Good perspective for contrasting these two bridges. Quite out of focus,however, and may be even more dramatic with more interesting light.', '2003-03-14 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237505, 13603, 2279, '<td valign="top">Holy Sh*t thats scary looking. Where is that?</td>', 'Holy Sh*t thats scary looking. Where is that?', '2003-03-14 23:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237506, 13844, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good placement of bridge in the frame. It is a bit out of focus, however. This shot might improve with more interesting light, say at sunset or sunrise?</td>', 'Good placement of bridge in the frame. It is a bit out of focus, however. This shot might improve with more interesting light, say at sunset or sunrise?', '2003-03-14 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237507, 13833, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sparkles of water get my attention here. It seems you''ve placed the bridge in the frame in order to show its relation to its environment, which is a good idea and almost works except that everything is out of focus slightly,and the leading lines aren''t strong enough to take my eye to the bridge itself, so everything is slightly confused and busy, especially with your limited color pallette.</td>', 'Sparkles of water get my attention here. It seems you''ve placed the bridge in the frame in order to show its relation to its environment, which is a good idea and almost works except that everything is out of focus slightly,and the leading lines aren''t strong enough to take my eye to the bridge itself, so everything is slightly confused and busy, especially with your limited color pallette.', '2003-03-15 00:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237508, 13852, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really super idea for a shot, and great cropping and composition. I just wish it were in focus and that the figures stood out more.</td>', 'Really super idea for a shot, and great cropping and composition. I just wish it were in focus and that the figures stood out more.', '2003-03-15 00:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237509, 13761, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot. The bridge acts as a frame for the heron and the scene beyond. The heron, however, is out of focus and the light isn''t very interesting to me.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot. The bridge acts as a frame for the heron and the scene beyond. The heron, however, is out of focus and the light isn''t very interesting to me.', '2003-03-15 00:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237510, 13738, 6870, '<td valign="top">The niftiest light is in the sky beyond. I''d like the bridge itself to display some interesting light. Your lines are interesting and well used here.</td>', 'The niftiest light is in the sky beyond. I''d like the bridge itself to display some interesting light. Your lines are interesting and well used here.', '2003-03-15 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237512, 13735, 6870, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. I do like the patterns of the arches here that to which you''ve drawn attention with the snow and sky, but this shot could use some interesting light added to your good composition.</td>', 'Out of focus. I do like the patterns of the arches here that to which you''ve drawn attention with the snow and sky, but this shot could use some interesting light added to your good composition.', '2003-03-15 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237513, 13809, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your perspective here draws attention tothe massiveness of the bridge, which is nice. I''m not sure what function the mud in the foreground serves, however. It may be better to crop closer to the bridge, however interesting the mud. The most interesting light here is in the water and mud, too--I''d like to see it on the bridge.</td>', 'Your perspective here draws attention tothe massiveness of the bridge, which is nice. I''m not sure what function the mud in the foreground serves, however. It may be better to crop closer to the bridge, however interesting the mud. The most interesting light here is in the water and mud, too--I''d like to see it on the bridge.', '2003-03-15 00:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237514, 13971, 6870, '<td valign="top">Appropriate and subtle title for a good idea. The image is out of focus, however, and a little dark for your purposes here (to show the transitions).</td>', 'Appropriate and subtle title for a good idea. The image is out of focus, however, and a little dark for your purposes here (to show the transitions).', '2003-03-15 00:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237515, 13821, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines here with the trees countering the smooth arc of the bridge. Everything is out of focus, though, and the image seems a bit washed. More contrast might highlight the nifty lines.</td>', 'Very nice lines here with the trees countering the smooth arc of the bridge. Everything is out of focus, though, and the image seems a bit washed. More contrast might highlight the nifty lines.', '2003-03-15 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237516, 13570, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good title for what you are trying to do in this photograph. The busy-ness of the image works, but it is also busy simply because it is confusing and slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Good title for what you are trying to do in this photograph. The busy-ness of the image works, but it is also busy simply because it is confusing and slightly out of focus.', '2003-03-15 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237517, 13668, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nifty bridge. I like the towers, but it does make the bridge less striking. Your most interesting light is in the water near the foreground just before the calm water. It should probably be on the bridge itself.</td>', 'Nifty bridge. I like the towers, but it does make the bridge less striking. Your most interesting light is in the water near the foreground just before the calm water. It should probably be on the bridge itself.', '2003-03-15 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237518, 13680, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, though the bridge is not highlighted in any way. Is there a way to make our attention rest on the bridge instead of being distracted by shadowy reflections?</td>', 'Fun idea, though the bridge is not highlighted in any way. Is there a way to make our attention rest on the bridge instead of being distracted by shadowy reflections?', '2003-03-15 00:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237519, 13744, 6870, '<td valign="top">Two bridges in one! I like your use of lines here with the two "roads" converging in the distance (at least we can interpolate). Is there any way to bring out attention to the two bridges equally? Right now, the bridge in the road gets most of our attention while the other bridge is much more interesting.</td>', 'Two bridges in one! I like your use of lines here with the two "roads" converging in the distance (at least we can interpolate). Is there any way to bring out attention to the two bridges equally? Right now, the bridge in the road gets most of our attention while the other bridge is much more interesting.', '2003-03-15 00:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(237521, 13580, 6870, '<td valign="top">The inverse negativity of this image is an interesting choice that helps to highlight the chain link fence patterns and contrast them with the trees beyond. The rest just distracts my eyes. Try cropping even further to zero in on what is most interesting.</td>', 'The inverse negativity of this image is an interesting choice that helps to highlight the chain link fence patterns and contrast them with the trees beyond. The rest just distracts my eyes. Try cropping even further to zero in on what is most interesting.', '2003-03-15 00:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237523, 13978, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting of these arch ways. You have a few bothersome shadows that are distracting. It may be good to wait for more interesting light.</td>', 'Nice contrasting of these arch ways. You have a few bothersome shadows that are distracting. It may be good to wait for more interesting light.', '2003-03-15 00:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237524, 13653, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting shot. I like your focus on the supports of this bridge. A slightly different perspective, say to your left a few yars, would draw attention to them even further. They are also a bit out of focus.</td>', 'INteresting shot. I like your focus on the supports of this bridge. A slightly different perspective, say to your left a few yars, would draw attention to them even further. They are also a bit out of focus.', '2003-03-15 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(237525, 13779, 6870, '<td valign="top">It''s a bridge, and a clever idea.  The image is kind of lackluster for me. Have you experimented with composition, cropping and framing?</td>', 'It''s a bridge, and a clever idea.  The image is kind of lackluster for me. Have you experimented with composition, cropping and framing?', '2003-03-15 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237526, 13595, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good placement of bridge in the frame. It is out of focus, however. The street doesn''t make that interesting of a foreground, either. The most interesting thing are the struts of the bridge; it may be good to get a little closer and really focus on those.</td>', 'Good placement of bridge in the frame. It is out of focus, however. The street doesn''t make that interesting of a foreground, either. The most interesting thing are the struts of the bridge; it may be good to get a little closer and really focus on those.', '2003-03-15 00:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237527, 13679, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea. Too bad the pigeons are out of focus. In fact, the whole image seems slightly out of focus. I do like your light levels and contrasts. The lines work for me, too.</td>', 'Really nice idea. Too bad the pigeons are out of focus. In fact, the whole image seems slightly out of focus. I do like your light levels and contrasts. The lines work for me, too.', '2003-03-15 00:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237529, 13723, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tiny image, but looks well composed. If you use Photoshop, try the "Save for Web" feature and save it as a jpg. Adjust the quality level to as high as you can to come as close to the 150 kb max allowed for the challenge. You can also adjust the image size and dpi.</td>', 'Tiny image, but looks well composed. If you use Photoshop, try the "Save for Web" feature and save it as a jpg. Adjust the quality level to as high as you can to come as close to the 150 kb max allowed for the challenge. You can also adjust the image size and dpi.', '2003-03-15 00:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237531, 13846, 2352, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful bridge shot! The colors and shapes work well together. The waterfall is a perfect complement to offset  the bridge, and the exposure is well done on that. Composition is good. It seems to be a bit over processed or out of focus a tad. This shot is a trophy for your efforts to get up there and get it. Congratulations and good luck! ... Just curious... Is this the bridge to Comet Falls?<br/>-Clicker-</td>', 'This is a beautiful bridge shot! The colors and shapes work well together. The waterfall is a perfect complement to offset  the bridge, and the exposure is well done on that. Composition is good. It seems to be a bit over processed or out of focus a tad. This shot is a trophy for your efforts to get up there and get it. Congratulations and good luck! ... Just curious... Is this the bridge to Comet Falls?-Clicker-', '2003-03-15 00:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(237532, 13804, 6855, '<td valign="top">Love the tonal finish, and the panoramic size adds to the length of the bridge.  Cool shot!</td>', 'Love the tonal finish, and the panoramic size adds to the length of the bridge.  Cool shot!', '2003-03-15 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(237533, 13657, 6855, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a gorgeous place!  The lighting is amazing - really a very cool shot.</td>', 'Wow, what a gorgeous place!  The lighting is amazing - really a very cool shot.', '2003-03-15 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(237535, 13840, 6855, '<td valign="top">I like your angle - what a gorgeous area!</td>', 'I like your angle - what a gorgeous area!', '2003-03-15 01:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237536, 13843, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and the placement of the bridge in the frame.The two palm trees serve to make the whole scene off balance in a good way. Note that the palm trees have the focus here, not the bridge. Is that what you want? Out of focus.</td>', 'I like the reflection and the placement of the bridge in the frame.The two palm trees serve to make the whole scene off balance in a good way. Note that the palm trees have the focus here, not the bridge. Is that what you want? Out of focus.', '2003-03-15 01:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(237537, 13811, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. I''m guessing htat the pallet is your bridge here. It stands out well where it is placed and received appropriate contrast. It is out of focus, though,and I don''t find your light very interesting.</td>', 'Clever idea. I''m guessing htat the pallet is your bridge here. It stands out well where it is placed and received appropriate contrast. It is out of focus, though,and I don''t find your light very interesting.', '2003-03-15 01:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237538, 13741, 6855, '<td valign="top">What a fun twist on this challenge!  Is this your home??? really amazing landscaping!  Good luck!</td>', 'What a fun twist on this challenge!  Is this your home??? really amazing landscaping!  Good luck!', '2003-03-15 01:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237539, 13529, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very small image; it is difficult to make out what your subject is. The title helps. Note that the object getting the most attention is the broken parts of the bridge at the left. We wouldn''t know it was a bridge if not for your title. Is there a way to make sure we know what you want us to look at and see?</td>', 'Very small image; it is difficult to make out what your subject is. The title helps. Note that the object getting the most attention is the broken parts of the bridge at the left. We wouldn''t know it was a bridge if not for your title. Is there a way to make sure we know what you want us to look at and see?', '2003-03-15 01:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237540, 13772, 6855, '<td valign="top">This is a great night shot, but it seems a little too dark to me..still very fun to look at and the lines are great - I also love the title.</td>', 'This is a great night shot, but it seems a little too dark to me..still very fun to look at and the lines are great - I also love the title.', '2003-03-15 01:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237541, 13706, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, nice tones, interesting contrasts. Out of focus.</td>', 'Nice lines, nice tones, interesting contrasts. Out of focus.', '2003-03-15 01:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237542, 13655, 6855, '<td valign="top">I just have to give your points for the clever title, and the shot is good too - it does come across a little flat, but there''s only so much you can do with crummy March weather, right??</td>', 'I just have to give your points for the clever title, and the shot is good too - it does come across a little flat, but there''s only so much you can do with crummy March weather, right??', '2003-03-15 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237544, 13889, 6870, '<td valign="top">The barn is in focus and gets the attention here. Did you mean for that to happen? The bridge itself is out of focus. Try to find (or wait for) more interesting light.</td>', 'The barn is in focus and gets the attention here. Did you mean for that to happen? The bridge itself is out of focus. Try to find (or wait for) more interesting light.', '2003-03-15 01:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(237545, 13911, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. The crane adds a good tough. I like the horizontal patterns here. More interesting light would make this photo a lot better.</td>', 'Nice lines. The crane adds a good tough. I like the horizontal patterns here. More interesting light would make this photo a lot better.', '2003-03-15 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(237546, 13692, 6855, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky, clever title!</td>', 'Gorgeous sky, clever title!', '2003-03-15 01:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237547, 13539, 6870, '<td valign="top">The lines and the dog make this bridge very interesting. It is out of focus, though, and could use more contrasts to increase the tone and drama.</td>', 'The lines and the dog make this bridge very interesting. It is out of focus, though, and could use more contrasts to increase the tone and drama.', '2003-03-15 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237548, 13753, 6855, '<td valign="top">Awesome angle and the night colors are gorgoeous.  Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome angle and the night colors are gorgoeous.  Very nice.', '2003-03-15 01:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237549, 13662, 6855, '<td valign="top">The colors make this an awesome shot, but it seems too small - like I want to see more..really fascinating.</td>', 'The colors make this an awesome shot, but it seems too small - like I want to see more..really fascinating.', '2003-03-15 01:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237550, 13713, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting bridge; I like your perspective, though it does look as if the tree is growing out of it. The light is unengaging to me. Try waiting for interesting light.</td>', 'Interesting bridge; I like your perspective, though it does look as if the tree is growing out of it. The light is unengaging to me. Try waiting for interesting light.', '2003-03-15 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(237552, 13668, 6855, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool bridge!  Seems a little flat, but it works, and I love the blue tones - gorgeous.</td>', 'That''s a really cool bridge!  Seems a little flat, but it works, and I love the blue tones - gorgeous.', '2003-03-15 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237553, 13940, 6870, '<td valign="top">A rainy day. The rain helps your colors here, especially the grass. The sky is a bit overexposed, making the whole image too bright. I like your perspective. The yellow and black sign doesn''t do much for me. I''m not sure of its purpose in your image.</td>', 'A rainy day. The rain helps your colors here, especially the grass. The sky is a bit overexposed, making the whole image too bright. I like your perspective. The yellow and black sign doesn''t do much for me. I''m not sure of its purpose in your image.', '2003-03-15 01:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237554, 13571, 6870, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, but I like your light/dark contrasts here. It sets an appropriate "old" feel to the image.</td>', 'Out of focus, but I like your light/dark contrasts here. It sets an appropriate "old" feel to the image.', '2003-03-15 01:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237555, 13880, 6855, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I can see this hanging in a hotel easily.  Gorgeous shot and the colors are amazing!  Really, this is one you should be very proud of - you get a 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this!  I can see this hanging in a hotel easily.  Gorgeous shot and the colors are amazing!  Really, this is one you should be very proud of - you get a 10 from me.', '2003-03-15 01:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237556, 13588, 6855, '<td valign="top">Your angle on this is awesome! I love the red - seems cropped a little tight at the top, but this is still fun to look at and very unique!</td>', 'Your angle on this is awesome! I love the red - seems cropped a little tight at the top, but this is still fun to look at and very unique!', '2003-03-15 01:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237557, 13681, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting lights and darks. The bridge, however, becomes lost in the gray sky, though the snow is helping in the foreground to bring out attn to the bridge.The telephone pole is annoying. Perhaps a better perspective may have helped.</td>', 'Nice contrasting lights and darks. The bridge, however, becomes lost in the gray sky, though the snow is helping in the foreground to bring out attn to the bridge.The telephone pole is annoying. Perhaps a better perspective may have helped.', '2003-03-15 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(237558, 13531, 6855, '<td valign="top">What a cool bridge!  It seems cropped a little too tight at the top with too much white space to the right - I would love to see a full photo of this bridge, as it looks magnificent.  I love the tonal finish and your angle is very original.</td>', 'What a cool bridge!  It seems cropped a little too tight at the top with too much white space to the right - I would love to see a full photo of this bridge, as it looks magnificent.  I love the tonal finish and your angle is very original.', '2003-03-15 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(237559, 13625, 6870, '<td valign="top">Promising photo. The two bridges are interesting here. To highlight both, you might try a different perspective, perhaps closer to get a good view of both bridges. The sky does nothing to help this image: try either waiting for more interesting light or crop most of it out.</td>', 'Promising photo. The two bridges are interesting here. To highlight both, you might try a different perspective, perhaps closer to get a good view of both bridges. The sky does nothing to help this image: try either waiting for more interesting light or crop most of it out.', '2003-03-15 01:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237560, 13639, 6855, '<td valign="top">This is really a fascinating photo - it has a very antique look to it that I love.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This is really a fascinating photo - it has a very antique look to it that I love.  Nicely done!', '2003-03-15 01:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237561, 13843, 6855, '<td valign="top">Oh to be where you are! Great reflection</td>', 'Oh to be where you are! Great reflection', '2003-03-15 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237562, 13664, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good lines that hightlight the patterns here. B/W is also a good choice. It''s a little washed at the edges, though I like the darker center. Unappealing sky: it''s just a void. Try waiting for an interesting sky or try to minimize it in the photo.</td>', 'Good lines that hightlight the patterns here. B/W is also a good choice. It''s a little washed at the edges, though I like the darker center. Unappealing sky: it''s just a void. Try waiting for an interesting sky or try to minimize it in the photo.', '2003-03-15 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237563, 13777, 6855, '<td valign="top">Wow, great angle with the train!!</td>', 'Wow, great angle with the train!!', '2003-03-15 01:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237564, 13768, 6870, '<td valign="top">A fun idea. It is a bit busy and out of focus, however. Try a different background (like pure black or pure white, for example), and see if you can get some interesting light in the shot.</td>', 'A fun idea. It is a bit busy and out of focus, however. Try a different background (like pure black or pure white, for example), and see if you can get some interesting light in the shot.', '2003-03-15 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(237565, 13944, 6870, '<td valign="top">If you focus is on the rust, you might try some means of focusing our attention on it. For me, the yellow train sticks out more. The whole is a bit out of focus, and the lighting is uninteresting.</td>', 'If you focus is on the rust, you might try some means of focusing our attention on it. For me, the yellow train sticks out more. The whole is a bit out of focus, and the lighting is uninteresting.', '2003-03-15 01:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237566, 13785, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice title,and the curves here do add solemnity. Nice composition wit the arches at the left. The image is a bit washed. I''d like to see a more interesting sky, or have the sky eliminated or minimized. Try waiting till sunset or something?</td>', 'Nice title,and the curves here do add solemnity. Nice composition wit the arches at the left. The image is a bit washed. I''d like to see a more interesting sky, or have the sky eliminated or minimized. Try waiting till sunset or something?', '2003-03-15 01:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(237567, 13749, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the water in this shot lead my eye to the all important sign that makes the shot make sense. Nice tones, too. Unappealing sky, however. You can''t change the sky, but perhaps you can wait for more interesting light, or try a different perspective to minimize it.</td>', 'I like how the water in this shot lead my eye to the all important sign that makes the shot make sense. Nice tones, too. Unappealing sky, however. You can''t change the sky, but perhaps you can wait for more interesting light, or try a different perspective to minimize it.', '2003-03-15 01:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237568, 13552, 6870, '<td valign="top">Promising shot. Nice bridges, captured well through contrasts of line and shadow. The bridge in the foreground don''t do much here but block our vision of the grand bridges behind. More contrasts might be nice, too.</td>', 'Promising shot. Nice bridges, captured well through contrasts of line and shadow. The bridge in the foreground don''t do much here but block our vision of the grand bridges behind. More contrasts might be nice, too.', '2003-03-15 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237569, 13547, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good eye,and I like the tones and contrasts here. THe art is out of focus, though.</td>', 'Good eye,and I like the tones and contrasts here. THe art is out of focus, though.', '2003-03-15 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237570, 13750, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like these bridges. Note how the water isn''t that interesting, yet it takes up so much of the frame. It does not serve the function of negative space well because it does not counterbalance the bridge or the house beyond; its just a void to me.</td>', 'I like these bridges. Note how the water isn''t that interesting, yet it takes up so much of the frame. It does not serve the function of negative space well because it does not counterbalance the bridge or the house beyond; its just a void to me.', '2003-03-15 01:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237571, 13729, 6870, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to see the bridge here. Different lighting or a dif. perspective may help.</td>', 'It is difficult to see the bridge here. Different lighting or a dif. perspective may help.', '2003-03-15 01:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237572, 13691, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wrong title: it should be: Bridge Near the Mountains. If you wanted the bay to get more attn, try a higher vantagepoint. I like how the bridge contrasts well with the water and the shadowy mountain behind.</td>', 'Wrong title: it should be: Bridge Near the Mountains. If you wanted the bay to get more attn, try a higher vantagepoint. I like how the bridge contrasts well with the water and the shadowy mountain behind.', '2003-03-15 01:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(237573, 13721, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines that lead they eye across the bridge. You may have used "unsharp mask" too strongly.</td>', 'Lovely lines that lead they eye across the bridge. You may have used "unsharp mask" too strongly.', '2003-03-15 01:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237575, 13787, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever and clear. What this photo needs is a bit more cropping and some more engaging light. (to me anyway).</td>', 'Clever and clear. What this photo needs is a bit more cropping and some more engaging light. (to me anyway).', '2003-03-15 01:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237576, 13562, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point to show tangle of roads. The image in my mind could use more contrast to emphasize the lines even more. Dull sky could be cropped, or you could wait for more interesting light.</td>', 'Nice vantage point to show tangle of roads. The image in my mind could use more contrast to emphasize the lines even more. Dull sky could be cropped, or you could wait for more interesting light.', '2003-03-15 01:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(237578, 13584, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I do like your use of line and perspective here. I feel the image could use a bit more cropping, especially from the bottom,and more contrast to emphasize the interesting lines more.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I do like your use of line and perspective here. I feel the image could use a bit more cropping, especially from the bottom,and more contrast to emphasize the interesting lines more.', '2003-03-15 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237579, 13882, 6870, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject and shot. I like the placement of the towers in the image. It could use some more interesting light.</td>', 'An interesting subject and shot. I like the placement of the towers in the image. It could use some more interesting light.', '2003-03-15 01:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(237580, 13611, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever title, but there is more grass and junk than water here. The bridge does indeed look troubled, but so do the trees, which actually steal my attn away here.</td>', 'Clever title, but there is more grass and junk than water here. The bridge does indeed look troubled, but so do the trees, which actually steal my attn away here.', '2003-03-15 01:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(237583, 13846, 6803, '<td valign="top">Great shot ! , yet out of focus or blured with compression</td>', 'Great shot ! , yet out of focus or blured with compression', '2003-03-15 02:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237585, 13778, 6172, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see just a little more space at the top.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Would have liked to see just a little more space at the top.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-15 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
