(237588, 13944, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice touch getting it when the train was on the bridge.</td>', 'Nice touch getting it when the train was on the bridge.', '2003-03-15 02:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237590, 13562, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very vivid! You captured this one well, I especially like the perspective of the lower bridge leading into the middle. Good job.</td>', 'Very vivid! You captured this one well, I especially like the perspective of the lower bridge leading into the middle. Good job.', '2003-03-15 03:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237591, 13903, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! This is an excellent photo, the fog gives this image so much charachter, especially the way the lines disappear into nothingness.</td>', 'Wonderful! This is an excellent photo, the fog gives this image so much charachter, especially the way the lines disappear into nothingness.', '2003-03-15 03:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(237599, 13609, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well taken - so many people have gone for a symmetrical composition with this kind of shot, and this is so much more interesting. Also one of thhe few b&amp;w shots that really looks like it benfits from the monochrome. Like the contrast of the horizontal and vertical iron-work too. A really top photo, great work.</td>', 'Well taken - so many people have gone for a symmetrical composition with this kind of shot, and this is so much more interesting. Also one of thhe few b&w shots that really looks like it benfits from the monochrome. Like the contrast of the horizontal and vertical iron-work too. A really top photo, great work.', '2003-03-15 06:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237600, 13573, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is so much better than it looks as a thumbnail - not sure how much affect that has. I''m willing to bet that you''ve had a bunch of ''too dark'' comments though :-) Giving you a 9 rather than a ten because I only allow myself one 10 a week and this isn''t quite my favourite ... v close though ... can almost here the stillness of the river. great work</td>', 'This is so much better than it looks as a thumbnail - not sure how much affect that has. I''m willing to bet that you''ve had a bunch of ''too dark'' comments though :-) Giving you a 9 rather than a ten because I only allow myself one 10 a week and this isn''t quite my favourite ... v close though ... can almost here the stillness of the river. great work', '2003-03-15 06:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237601, 13543, 6999, '<td valign="top">I expect you''ve been told that this is very dark - don''t listen to them! great contrast, and one of the few b&amp;w shots that doesn''t look like a deperate attempt to be arty. One small criticism: the brightness of that white building just across the bridge, and the fact that it''s placed on the strong vertical makes that the real subject of the picture: my eye is always drawn from the bridge or the church to it.</td>', 'I expect you''ve been told that this is very dark - don''t listen to them! great contrast, and one of the few b&w shots that doesn''t look like a deperate attempt to be arty. One small criticism: the brightness of that white building just across the bridge, and the fact that it''s placed on the strong vertical makes that the real subject of the picture: my eye is always drawn from the bridge or the church to it.', '2003-03-15 06:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237602, 13740, 6999, '<td valign="top">So difficult to capture the dynamic range in these shots - and this is a pretty damn good effort. Would love to have seen a little more detail in the bridge, but obviously so difficult to keep the sky from flaring out. Graduated filter required? Top photo though, good work</td>', 'So difficult to capture the dynamic range in these shots - and this is a pretty damn good effort. Would love to have seen a little more detail in the bridge, but obviously so difficult to keep the sky from flaring out. Graduated filter required? Top photo though, good work', '2003-03-15 06:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237628, 13668, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, just wish there was a bit more contrast between the bridge and the sky. Also like the reflection in the water alot.</td>', 'Very nice composition, just wish there was a bit more contrast between the bridge and the sky. Also like the reflection in the water alot.', '2003-03-15 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237631, 13641, 4049, '<td valign="top">?????? weird, lol</td>', '?????? weird, lol', '2003-03-15 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237632, 13889, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice country pastoral scene</td>', 'Very nice country pastoral scene', '2003-03-15 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237633, 13573, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I''ve never have seen this view of the Dumbarton. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, I''ve never have seen this view of the Dumbarton. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-15 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(237637, 13864, 4793, '<td valign="top">If you could have gotten around that chain link fence, this would be a wonderful shot, the colors are nice.</td>', 'If you could have gotten around that chain link fence, this would be a wonderful shot, the colors are nice.', '2003-03-15 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237638, 13797, 6870, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective and lines and shadows. More contrast would help this photo even more, I feel.</td>', 'Beautiful perspective and lines and shadows. More contrast would help this photo even more, I feel.', '2003-03-15 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237639, 13845, 6870, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bridge; good perspective for the shot. Seems slightly out of focus and might be better with more interesting light.</td>', 'Beautiful bridge; good perspective for the shot. Seems slightly out of focus and might be better with more interesting light.', '2003-03-15 10:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237640, 13612, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yes, I would call this place heaven! Nice perspective. I wish heaven were more in focus. Everything seems just slightly out of focus here.</td>', 'Yes, I would call this place heaven! Nice perspective. I wish heaven were more in focus. Everything seems just slightly out of focus here.', '2003-03-15 10:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237641, 13766, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is good here, adding a certain glow over things. The mother and child do not get much focus, though you highlight them in your title. There may also be some other vantage points that provide a more interesting perspective that include more diagonals; that''s a choice, and yours is valid, but I''m just looking for more interest here.</td>', 'Your lighting is good here, adding a certain glow over things. The mother and child do not get much focus, though you highlight them in your title. There may also be some other vantage points that provide a more interesting perspective that include more diagonals; that''s a choice, and yours is valid, but I''m just looking for more interest here.', '2003-03-15 10:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(237648, 13912, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would be more effective showing a little more of the sky.  I think it would also bring this pic into a little better size perspective.  Nice crisp photo with excellent natural lighting.</td>', 'I think this picture would be more effective showing a little more of the sky.  I think it would also bring this pic into a little better size perspective.  Nice crisp photo with excellent natural lighting.', '2003-03-15 10:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(237649, 13697, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be a much better shot if it were clearer.  The composition has some nice elements to it with both bridges side by side.  The old bridge is far more interesting.  A lot of perspectives are possible for this place that could be very effective in terms of conveying a little message.</td>', 'This would be a much better shot if it were clearer.  The composition has some nice elements to it with both bridges side by side.  The old bridge is far more interesting.  A lot of perspectives are possible for this place that could be very effective in terms of conveying a little message.', '2003-03-15 10:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237652, 13671, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is difficult to determine what the subject is.  I''m assuming its a bridge part of some sort, but that determination is strictly based on the challenge title.  This serves as more of an abstract.</td>', 'This is difficult to determine what the subject is.  I''m assuming its a bridge part of some sort, but that determination is strictly based on the challenge title.  This serves as more of an abstract.', '2003-03-15 10:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237653, 13621, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I have mixed emotions though.  As cool as this first appears, I''m very turned off by the amount of flash created by the star filter.  I think that this is a quality subject and a great idea, but the exposure is probably a bit too long and the noise from the filter is excessive.  Good shot, but not a great one.</td>', 'Wow!  I have mixed emotions though.  As cool as this first appears, I''m very turned off by the amount of flash created by the star filter.  I think that this is a quality subject and a great idea, but the exposure is probably a bit too long and the noise from the filter is excessive.  Good shot, but not a great one.', '2003-03-15 10:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237657, 13903, 326, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-03-15 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
