(237700, 13581, 6523, '<td valign="top">What''s the blurry/fuzzy area in the middle of the third rail fo the bridge in this photo?  Is it a blemish?  Is this a "ghost photo"?  It can''t be a blemish on the print because this is a digital photo, right?  I''m really curious about it.</td>', 'What''s the blurry/fuzzy area in the middle of the third rail fo the bridge in this photo?  Is it a blemish?  Is this a "ghost photo"?  It can''t be a blemish on the print because this is a digital photo, right?  I''m really curious about it.', '2003-03-15 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
