(237714, 13794, 2352, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a contrast in colors! Beautiful work!  Composition is excellent!<br/>Good luck and congratulations on a beauty!  -Clicker-</td>', 'Wow, what a contrast in colors! Beautiful work!  Composition is excellent!Good luck and congratulations on a beauty!  -Clicker-', '2003-03-15 15:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
