(237758, 13543, 3735, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful i gave you a 10</td>', 'This is so beautiful i gave you a 10', '2003-03-15 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237759, 13873, 3735, '<td valign="top">The mist added a lot to your beautiful photo</td>', 'The mist added a lot to your beautiful photo', '2003-03-15 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(237762, 13761, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way the way the background bridge and heron are framed by the foreground bridge and also like the color of the water. The only thing I think is missing here is some tone to the sky, but good work nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the way the way the background bridge and heron are framed by the foreground bridge and also like the color of the water. The only thing I think is missing here is some tone to the sky, but good work nonetheless.', '2003-03-15 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(237763, 13766, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think the picture is a little too busy and underexposed. Also wish the rails of the bridge were not blocking out the houses in the background.</td>', 'I think the picture is a little too busy and underexposed. Also wish the rails of the bridge were not blocking out the houses in the background.', '2003-03-15 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(237764, 13565, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I think it would have been better without the shatdow in the bottom right corner</td>', 'Nice colors, but I think it would have been better without the shatdow in the bottom right corner', '2003-03-15 21:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237774, 13816, 6900, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of McDonalds sign (can I get a whopper, fries and coke?). :) 9</td>', 'Reminds me of McDonalds sign (can I get a whopper, fries and coke?). :) 9', '2003-03-15 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237778, 13878, 5585, '<td valign="top">would have been top three in "Leading Lines"....9</td>', 'would have been top three in "Leading Lines"....9', '2003-03-15 21:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237779, 13673, 6900, '<td valign="top">I think the border kills this shot.  I like the colors, but why add a subtraction?</td>', 'I think the border kills this shot.  I like the colors, but why add a subtraction?', '2003-03-15 21:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237780, 13864, 6900, '<td valign="top">I get the foreground, but with that water, that skyline and that bridge, I''d crop post to fence (like you were closer).</td>', 'I get the foreground, but with that water, that skyline and that bridge, I''d crop post to fence (like you were closer).', '2003-03-15 21:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(237783, 13749, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well done. Several goos elements in here. The bright water, balanced with the dark space on the left. Build up of layers in the height. Leading line to the date 1921. The houses in the background are unfortunate, but not a major problem. I also have the sense for why this bridge is here.</td>', 'Well done. Several goos elements in here. The bright water, balanced with the dark space on the left. Build up of layers in the height. Leading line to the date 1921. The houses in the background are unfortunate, but not a major problem. I also have the sense for why this bridge is here.', '2003-03-15 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237784, 13822, 6325, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2003-03-15 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237785, 13678, 6325, '<td valign="top">Great location and composition. I have trouble seeing the stone bridge with the mid tones so strong - it seems monotone in that region. Maybe adjust the Levels  in the middle range. Still very nice.</td>', 'Great location and composition. I have trouble seeing the stone bridge with the mid tones so strong - it seems monotone in that region. Maybe adjust the Levels  in the middle range. Still very nice.', '2003-03-15 22:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(237788, 13563, 6325, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little bridge. Good, straight forward compositon. I find that that there is no deep black and the range is maybe a little too narrow to really set it off. (BTW, I do not know how to achieve this - I am still trying to make that work as well.)</td>', 'Beautiful little bridge. Good, straight forward compositon. I find that that there is no deep black and the range is maybe a little too narrow to really set it off. (BTW, I do not know how to achieve this - I am still trying to make that work as well.)', '2003-03-15 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(237789, 13708, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice bridge composed well. Execution-wise, I think it is too bright. The border points out the crooked pillars.</td>', 'Nice bridge composed well. Execution-wise, I think it is too bright. The border points out the crooked pillars.', '2003-03-15 22:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237790, 13818, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the water! Good composition. I wish the bridge highlights had more punch - Sharping may have helped. Still, one of the best so far.</td>', 'Nice effect with the water! Good composition. I wish the bridge highlights had more punch - Sharping may have helped. Still, one of the best so far.', '2003-03-15 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237792, 13628, 6325, '<td valign="top">Godd compostion - gets across the point. I would feel very depresed if I lived in one of those houses.  Execution would have been improved with squaring and a different time of day - the image is flat and not focused well.</td>', 'Godd compostion - gets across the point. I would feel very depresed if I lived in one of those houses.  Execution would have been improved with squaring and a different time of day - the image is flat and not focused well.', '2003-03-15 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237794, 13903, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good composition - different from what is usually seen. I like the cable from the front span disappearing into the fog and the way the cars come out of the fog. Execution-wise, the brdige looks crooked and the border just points this out by giving a square reference.</td>', 'Good composition - different from what is usually seen. I like the cable from the front span disappearing into the fog and the way the cars come out of the fog. Execution-wise, the brdige looks crooked and the border just points this out by giving a square reference.', '2003-03-15 23:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237796, 13673, 6325, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good photo. I find the border confining and not a value adding.</td>', 'This is a pretty good photo. I find the border confining and not a value adding.', '2003-03-15 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(237801, 13944, 6325, '<td valign="top">This is one of a very few examples of a bridge actually doing something! Good planning to be there at the right time. Good execution given what looks like an overcast day.</td>', 'This is one of a very few examples of a bridge actually doing something! Good planning to be there at the right time. Good execution given what looks like an overcast day.', '2003-03-15 23:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237802, 13612, 6325, '<td valign="top">Incredible dof. Nice effect with the water. Bridge seems to be hanging there - good.  But the bridge seems like an after thought. The good features could have been preserved and the bridge enhanced with alonger lens or tighter crop.</td>', 'Incredible dof. Nice effect with the water. Bridge seems to be hanging there - good.  But the bridge seems like an after thought. The good features could have been preserved and the bridge enhanced with alonger lens or tighter crop.', '2003-03-15 23:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237803, 13794, 6325, '<td valign="top">Highway to Heaven? Good shot. A little crooked - the border helped me see that.</td>', 'Highway to Heaven? Good shot. A little crooked - the border helped me see that.', '2003-03-15 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237805, 13889, 2000, '<td valign="top">Deep, rich colors - almost like a postcard.  The area under the bridge is very dark, making the bridge almost non-apparent since I really can''t see anything under it.  Also, IMO, there may be a little too much unnecessary space included at the top of the piocture - I think this might look better to me in a more panoramic shape.</td>', 'Deep, rich colors - almost like a postcard.  The area under the bridge is very dark, making the bridge almost non-apparent since I really can''t see anything under it.  Also, IMO, there may be a little too much unnecessary space included at the top of the piocture - I think this might look better to me in a more panoramic shape.', '2003-03-16 00:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237806, 13683, 2000, '<td valign="top">This looks like you were holding the camera as you moved through the bridge.  I like the idea, though there''s a bit too much ''motion'' visible here.  The only staionary portion of the photo is the bar along the top, and to me that makes this photo a bit dizzying.  I''m not sure how that could be corrected and still have the effect, but that''s what strikes me about this photo.</td>', 'This looks like you were holding the camera as you moved through the bridge.  I like the idea, though there''s a bit too much ''motion'' visible here.  The only staionary portion of the photo is the bar along the top, and to me that makes this photo a bit dizzying.  I''m not sure how that could be corrected and still have the effect, but that''s what strikes me about this photo.', '2003-03-16 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(237807, 13746, 6325, '<td valign="top">Same bridge as "She''ll Be Coming Around the Mountain"?</td>', 'Same bridge as "She''ll Be Coming Around the Mountain"?', '2003-03-16 00:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237810, 13532, 2000, '<td valign="top">I find this photo to be far too dark - maybe it''s underexposed, maybe it''s just too late in the day, but this photo is so dark it''s hard to make out much detail.  As such, I''m assuming that crane in the foreground is the subject, but since I really can''t see it, it''s hard to rate.</td>', 'I find this photo to be far too dark - maybe it''s underexposed, maybe it''s just too late in the day, but this photo is so dark it''s hard to make out much detail.  As such, I''m assuming that crane in the foreground is the subject, but since I really can''t see it, it''s hard to rate.', '2003-03-16 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237811, 13551, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great geometry, arches and lines.</td>', 'Great geometry, arches and lines.', '2003-03-16 00:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237812, 13873, 5792, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2003-03-16 00:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(237814, 13543, 5792, '<td valign="top">Stunning...  the dark forebodding look of this image is perfect for this scene.<br/> <br/>Great composition. It is as if the bridge seems like a foundation supporting  the town, but is not overpowered by it.<br/> <br/>A good photograph evokes a feeling. This one is a fantasy looking like  Transyvannia and Dracula''s Castle.</td>', 'Stunning...  the dark forebodding look of this image is perfect for this scene. Great composition. It is as if the bridge seems like a foundation supporting  the town, but is not overpowered by it. A good photograph evokes a feeling. This one is a fantasy looking like  Transyvannia and Dracula''s Castle.', '2003-03-16 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237815, 13671, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice curves</td>', 'Nice curves', '2003-03-16 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237817, 13729, 2000, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, beautiful reflection in the lake.  I don''t really see anything to complain about here - very nice.</td>', 'Pretty scene, beautiful reflection in the lake.  I don''t really see anything to complain about here - very nice.', '2003-03-16 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(237818, 13818, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Using a longer exposure time to capture te flowing motion of the water puts this a cut above most of the others.</td>', 'Nicely done. Using a longer exposure time to capture te flowing motion of the water puts this a cut above most of the others.', '2003-03-16 00:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237819, 13561, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least it''s beading up -- don''t want to ruin an instrument for a photo.</td>', 'At least it''s beading up -- don''t want to ruin an instrument for a photo.', '2003-03-16 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(237820, 13573, 2000, '<td valign="top">This is one scene where I think the dark, and backlight that creates it, works well to shadow the bridge.  However, I think the sky is too dark as well, where just a little bit lighter would have created more contrast on the bridge to make this photograph pretty close to perfect.</td>', 'This is one scene where I think the dark, and backlight that creates it, works well to shadow the bridge.  However, I think the sky is too dark as well, where just a little bit lighter would have created more contrast on the bridge to make this photograph pretty close to perfect.', '2003-03-16 00:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(237821, 13803, 5792, '<td valign="top">The twisting ribbon-like quality is brought well by the exceptional placement in the overpass intersection in the lower left quadrant.<br/> <br/>The sinuous quality is outstanding. It is emphasized by the two parts of the overpass stretching to opposite sides of the image. Well cropped.<br/> <br/>Simple is better and that is certainly true of this image.</td>', 'The twisting ribbon-like quality is brought well by the exceptional placement in the overpass intersection in the lower left quadrant. The sinuous quality is outstanding. It is emphasized by the two parts of the overpass stretching to opposite sides of the image. Well cropped. Simple is better and that is certainly true of this image.', '2003-03-16 00:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(237822, 13673, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like this scene, but I guess the snow just washes out the sky a bit.  One or two ''compression quality'' points might have bumped the size of the file closer to 150k, which I have seen makes a difference in detail and in what looks washed out.</td>', 'I like this scene, but I guess the snow just washes out the sky a bit.  One or two ''compression quality'' points might have bumped the size of the file closer to 150k, which I have seen makes a difference in detail and in what looks washed out.', '2003-03-16 00:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237823, 13873, 2000, '<td valign="top">Neat effect - i like the mist here.  The sepia treatment works well too.</td>', 'Neat effect - i like the mist here.  The sepia treatment works well too.', '2003-03-16 00:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237824, 13573, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed. I think maybe the old Dumbarton was more "picturesque." Should be some good upcoming photo-ops as the east span of the Bay Bridge is replaced.</td>', 'Nicely framed. I think maybe the old Dumbarton was more "picturesque." Should be some good upcoming photo-ops as the east span of the Bay Bridge is replaced.', '2003-03-16 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(237825, 13816, 6172, '<td valign="top">Showing too much water</td>', 'Showing too much water', '2003-03-16 00:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237826, 13528, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job catching the wave action. Seems loke it could be either sharper or softer (like on a foggy day) -- this seems a bit in between.<br/>I think if you cropped a bit more foreground (just below the big seaweed in the middle) you would have a stronger image, with more emplasis on the bridge and the horizon at about the 1/3 line. Most people also recommend straightening the horizon if not tilting it markedly for artistic effect.</td>', 'Good job catching the wave action. Seems loke it could be either sharper or softer (like on a foggy day) -- this seems a bit in between.I think if you cropped a bit more foreground (just below the big seaweed in the middle) you would have a stronger image, with more emplasis on the bridge and the horizon at about the 1/3 line. Most people also recommend straightening the horizon if not tilting it markedly for artistic effect.', '2003-03-16 01:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237827, 13638, 6172, '<td valign="top">You could submit a larger photo size!  I have to deduct a little for that, a photo this small is hard to judge.</td>', 'You could submit a larger photo size!  I have to deduct a little for that, a photo this small is hard to judge.', '2003-03-16 01:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(237828, 13843, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not focused very well</td>', 'Not focused very well', '2003-03-16 01:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237829, 13648, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not focused very well</td>', 'Not focused very well', '2003-03-16 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(237830, 13803, 1031, '<td valign="top">Glad to see someone else use freeway ramps...like your cropping/framing.</td>', 'Glad to see someone else use freeway ramps...like your cropping/framing.', '2003-03-16 01:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(237831, 13747, 1031, '<td valign="top">Try flipping this over...</td>', 'Try flipping this over...', '2003-03-16 01:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(237832, 13584, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think you could completely crop out the cars at the bottom and have a stronger, more cohesive image.</td>', 'I think you could completely crop out the cars at the bottom and have a stronger, more cohesive image.', '2003-03-16 01:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(237833, 13602, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field. I wish the picture had not been split in the middle - more sky or more grass.</td>', 'Good depth of field. I wish the picture had not been split in the middle - more sky or more grass.', '2003-03-16 01:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237834, 13625, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very nice timing and framing.</td>', 'Very nice timing and framing.', '2003-03-16 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237835, 13652, 1031, '<td valign="top">Must be hard to get this close these days!</td>', 'Must be hard to get this close these days!', '2003-03-16 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(237836, 13608, 1031, '<td valign="top">Tacoma Narrows?</td>', 'Tacoma Narrows?', '2003-03-16 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237837, 13814, 6325, '<td valign="top">Maybe increasing saturation and contrast wouls have brought out the graffiti.</td>', 'Maybe increasing saturation and contrast wouls have brought out the graffiti.', '2003-03-16 01:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(237838, 13562, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think it would be a stronger "bridge" picture if you cropped out all the vehicles at the bottom and rotated it slightly clockwise.</td>', 'I think it would be a stronger "bridge" picture if you cropped out all the vehicles at the bottom and rotated it slightly clockwise.', '2003-03-16 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(237839, 13602, 6803, '<td valign="top">wow!  perfect bridge shot</td>', 'wow!  perfect bridge shot', '2003-03-16 02:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237840, 13695, 6803, '<td valign="top">I like the bridge, but the sky is over exposed. I''ve had the same problem and I''m going <br/>to try using filters to improve my photoos</td>', 'I like the bridge, but the sky is over exposed. I''ve had the same problem and I''m going to try using filters to improve my photoos', '2003-03-16 02:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(237842, 13670, 6803, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-03-16 02:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(237847, 13589, 6892, '<td valign="top">Exquisite how the arch of the bridge seems to frame the snow: love your composition.</td>', 'Exquisite how the arch of the bridge seems to frame the snow: love your composition.', '2003-03-16 03:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237848, 13974, 6892, '<td valign="top">Love the dreamy quality of this photograph.</td>', 'Love the dreamy quality of this photograph.', '2003-03-16 03:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(237849, 13602, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very rustic, isn''t it? This entry really does tell a story: how many generations have passed here?</td>', 'Very rustic, isn''t it? This entry really does tell a story: how many generations have passed here?', '2003-03-16 03:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237850, 13878, 6892, '<td valign="top">Makes a nice black and white.</td>', 'Makes a nice black and white.', '2003-03-16 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237851, 13538, 6892, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast between the land and water: the bridge almost seems part of the snow.</td>', 'Lovely contrast between the land and water: the bridge almost seems part of the snow.', '2003-03-16 03:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237853, 13603, 6892, '<td valign="top">Great landscape, but it overpowers the bridge.</td>', 'Great landscape, but it overpowers the bridge.', '2003-03-16 03:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(237854, 13745, 6892, '<td valign="top">I like the curvature of the origin of the bridge, leading to who knows where?</td>', 'I like the curvature of the origin of the bridge, leading to who knows where?', '2003-03-16 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(237855, 13535, 6892, '<td valign="top">Whoa- what angle was this shot taken from? This is obviously not a conventional suspension bridge.</td>', 'Whoa- what angle was this shot taken from? This is obviously not a conventional suspension bridge.', '2003-03-16 03:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(237856, 13536, 6892, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and great lighting.</td>', 'Lovely colors and great lighting.', '2003-03-16 03:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(237876, 13822, 7320, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2003-03-16 07:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(237887, 13777, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome color and very clear.  The subject is not really blowing me away as far as the bridge goes.  The train is a little more interesting.   Definitely meets the challenge though and is extremely well taken.</td>', 'Awesome color and very clear.  The subject is not really blowing me away as far as the bridge goes.  The train is a little more interesting.   Definitely meets the challenge though and is extremely well taken.', '2003-03-16 08:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(237888, 13564, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of this lense. Good image of a bridge spanning different worlds.</td>', 'Very nice use of this lense. Good image of a bridge spanning different worlds.', '2003-03-16 08:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237889, 13659, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome handrails!  This is a really cool bridge.  I don''t think this perspective though is doing it justice.  Its gorgeous really.  Nice and clear picture just I think you need to try some different angles to really make the bridge a little more accessible.  Following the line of stones around the bank to lead up to the bridge would be one way.  Use the stones as a leading line up to the bridge.  Cool bridge though.</td>', 'Awesome handrails!  This is a really cool bridge.  I don''t think this perspective though is doing it justice.  Its gorgeous really.  Nice and clear picture just I think you need to try some different angles to really make the bridge a little more accessible.  Following the line of stones around the bank to lead up to the bridge would be one way.  Use the stones as a leading line up to the bridge.  Cool bridge though.', '2003-03-16 08:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(237891, 13609, 3540, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo were a little wider.  I can''t see why the edges would be cut off unless there were something there that were unsightly.  This is extremely well taken and I''m giving it an 8 anyway.  I just wish it were a wider photo showing the sides of the bridge.  Well done</td>', 'I wish this photo were a little wider.  I can''t see why the edges would be cut off unless there were something there that were unsightly.  This is extremely well taken and I''m giving it an 8 anyway.  I just wish it were a wider photo showing the sides of the bridge.  Well done', '2003-03-16 08:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(237893, 13603, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous scene and a cool bridge.  The color of the snow though is neon blue and that is not helping.  The shot looks sort of grainy as well.  Not grainy like a high ISO grainy, but like a very large picture was made very small.  or maybe one too many sharpens.  I''m not sure, but it doesn''t look "right"  Awesome scene though that is definitely worth photographing</td>', 'This is a gorgeous scene and a cool bridge.  The color of the snow though is neon blue and that is not helping.  The shot looks sort of grainy as well.  Not grainy like a high ISO grainy, but like a very large picture was made very small.  or maybe one too many sharpens.  I''m not sure, but it doesn''t look "right"  Awesome scene though that is definitely worth photographing', '2003-03-16 09:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(237894, 13977, 3540, '<td valign="top">The tree in the upper right is a serious distraction for me when I look at this pic.  Nice bridge, well framed and shot.  I would''ve considered doing this in color, since there seems to be quite a few trees with leaves and open water.</td>', 'The tree in the upper right is a serious distraction for me when I look at this pic.  Nice bridge, well framed and shot.  I would''ve considered doing this in color, since there seems to be quite a few trees with leaves and open water.', '2003-03-16 09:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(237895, 13930, 3540, '<td valign="top">This bridge is too camoflauged into the cityscape.  Its very difficult to see with this lighting.</td>', 'This bridge is too camoflauged into the cityscape.  Its very difficult to see with this lighting.', '2003-03-16 09:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(237898, 13764, 3320, '<td valign="top">I would just have framed a little less of the bridge and a little more of the trees. But nice picture.</td>', 'I would just have framed a little less of the bridge and a little more of the trees. But nice picture.', '2003-03-16 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(237902, 13785, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sky is too bright.  Everything else is really picturesque.  Great shot</td>', 'The sky is too bright.  Everything else is really picturesque.  Great shot', '2003-03-16 09:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237903, 13947, 3540, '<td valign="top">Postcard shot, all the way.  This is definitely one of the most well composed photos of this challenge.  Just a pinch soft on the focus probably due to the longer exposure time.  Great shot</td>', 'Postcard shot, all the way.  This is definitely one of the most well composed photos of this challenge.  Just a pinch soft on the focus probably due to the longer exposure time.  Great shot', '2003-03-16 09:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(237913, 13843, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Nice framing.  A little clearer and this would really be an outstanding pic.</td>', 'Great composition.  Nice framing.  A little clearer and this would really be an outstanding pic.', '2003-03-16 11:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(237914, 13589, 3540, '<td valign="top">great background, great foreground. Love the colors and its all very well captured on "film" so to speak.  Awesome - 10</td>', 'great background, great foreground. Love the colors and its all very well captured on "film" so to speak.  Awesome - 10', '2003-03-16 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(237916, 13543, 6325, '<td valign="top">Wonderful layerng in the composition. Great tonal range.</td>', 'Wonderful layerng in the composition. Great tonal range.', '2003-03-16 11:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237924, 13581, 6817, '<td valign="top">This catches and keeps my eye for some reason. I''m not quite sure what I like about it but I like it. Good job.</td>', 'This catches and keeps my eye for some reason. I''m not quite sure what I like about it but I like it. Good job.', '2003-03-16 12:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(237925, 13535, 6817, '<td valign="top">Not much to say...Gorgeous!</td>', 'Not much to say...Gorgeous!', '2003-03-16 12:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(237926, 13691, 6817, '<td valign="top">Basically nice composition. I would have like a little less sky. But the overall picture is beautiful.</td>', 'Basically nice composition. I would have like a little less sky. But the overall picture is beautiful.', '2003-03-16 12:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237927, 13811, 6817, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what''s happening here. So for this particular category it leaves me wondering.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what''s happening here. So for this particular category it leaves me wondering.', '2003-03-16 12:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237931, 13903, 6817, '<td valign="top">Now I like this version of Golden Gate bridge. Good job catching the fog and putting it into black and white. I would have like to see a little more bridge and less land to the left...but that may not have been possible.</td>', 'Now I like this version of Golden Gate bridge. Good job catching the fog and putting it into black and white. I would have like to see a little more bridge and less land to the left...but that may not have been possible.', '2003-03-16 13:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237932, 13591, 6817, '<td valign="top">Wow...this looks like an old picture from 1828 or something. Nice job. Great composition.</td>', 'Wow...this looks like an old picture from 1828 or something. Nice job. Great composition.', '2003-03-16 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(237933, 13716, 6817, '<td valign="top">Interesting coloration.</td>', 'Interesting coloration.', '2003-03-16 13:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(237934, 13609, 6817, '<td valign="top">Good crop. I like the coloring too.</td>', 'Good crop. I like the coloring too.', '2003-03-16 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(237935, 13541, 5628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Unfortunately the thick border is realy distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Unfortunately the thick border is realy distracting.', '2003-03-16 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237936, 13770, 6817, '<td valign="top">Extremely interesting composition. Great job!</td>', 'Extremely interesting composition. Great job!', '2003-03-16 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237937, 13832, 6817, '<td valign="top">I may have left this one in color, for interest sake.</td>', 'I may have left this one in color, for interest sake.', '2003-03-16 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(237938, 13793, 6817, '<td valign="top">Very interesting coloration. Great job.</td>', 'Very interesting coloration. Great job.', '2003-03-16 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(237939, 13953, 6817, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, however, if this weren''t in the bridges category I would not recognize that there was a bridge in the photo. I''m still not 100% positive which is the bridge. Only going below avg because of the subject to category relevance. This maybe should have been entered in a different category.</td>', 'Great photograph, however, if this weren''t in the bridges category I would not recognize that there was a bridge in the photo. I''m still not 100% positive which is the bridge. Only going below avg because of the subject to category relevance. This maybe should have been entered in a different category.', '2003-03-16 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237941, 13751, 6817, '<td valign="top">Something about this angle distracts me, but it''s a nice image.</td>', 'Something about this angle distracts me, but it''s a nice image.', '2003-03-16 13:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(237942, 13697, 6817, '<td valign="top">Image is a little soft. I don''t know if that was intentional.</td>', 'Image is a little soft. I don''t know if that was intentional.', '2003-03-16 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(237946, 13536, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bridge shot, nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful bridge shot, nice work.', '2003-03-16 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(237948, 13528, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I love it, looks a bit out of focus on the bottom left, but that may be my laptop monitor, good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I love it, looks a bit out of focus on the bottom left, but that may be my laptop monitor, good luck.', '2003-03-16 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(237952, 13975, 2104, '<td valign="top">The reflections and the shades of green are wickedly captured. Only thing that looks out of place is the park bench (?) in the distance, but there is nothing you can really do about that. Excellent capture - looks like a very enchanting place to be :)</td>', 'The reflections and the shades of green are wickedly captured. Only thing that looks out of place is the park bench (?) in the distance, but there is nothing you can really do about that. Excellent capture - looks like a very enchanting place to be :)', '2003-03-16 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(237953, 13544, 4224, '<td valign="top">the color of the picture adds a lot to it</td>', 'the color of the picture adds a lot to it', '2003-03-16 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(237955, 13776, 4224, '<td valign="top">i dont get it, is the web a bridge?  then why the woman...</td>', 'i dont get it, is the web a bridge?  then why the woman...', '2003-03-16 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(237956, 13779, 2104, '<td valign="top">Falconbridge, Ontario? Interesting take on the theme. Would be nice if more contrast between the water tower and the sky - perhaps at sunset or sunrise.</td>', 'Falconbridge, Ontario? Interesting take on the theme. Would be nice if more contrast between the water tower and the sky - perhaps at sunset or sunrise.', '2003-03-16 14:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(237957, 13793, 4224, '<td valign="top">such a stunning picture, beautiful color</td>', 'such a stunning picture, beautiful color', '2003-03-16 14:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(237966, 13793, 554, '<td valign="top">..........suitable for framing.   Very nice work. Could very well be first place in many contests. Thanks for sharing.</td>', '..........suitable for framing.   Very nice work. Could very well be first place in many contests. Thanks for sharing.', '2003-03-16 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(237967, 13673, 554, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this.....nice frame too.</td>', 'I love shots like this.....nice frame too.', '2003-03-16 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(237969, 13594, 554, '<td valign="top">not too crazy about the bridge itself but you sure photographed it well...10</td>', 'not too crazy about the bridge itself but you sure photographed it well...10', '2003-03-16 15:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(237974, 13559, 554, '<td valign="top">not just another photo of a bridge.....nice shot. I like it better cropped on the bottom just short of the vertical post....leaving only a couple of bricks below the post.  Nice one though, one of my favorites. Great focus.</td>', 'not just another photo of a bridge.....nice shot. I like it better cropped on the bottom just short of the vertical post....leaving only a couple of bricks below the post.  Nice one though, one of my favorites. Great focus.', '2003-03-16 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(237975, 13657, 554, '<td valign="top">wow, what fantastic lighting</td>', 'wow, what fantastic lighting', '2003-03-16 15:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
