(237985, 13612, 554, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful scene</td>', 'what a beautiful scene', '2003-03-16 16:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(237999, 13880, 6097, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I love that you used a slower shutter to capture and blur the movement of the water.  Very nice.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I love that you used a slower shutter to capture and blur the movement of the water.  Very nice.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2003-03-16 17:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(238000, 13561, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I love that you didn''t just go out and photograph a bridge structure (like I did).  Very creative.  A few people had similar ideas this week but this is by far the best.  This is my favorite pic for this challenge this week.  I like the lighting that you have used in this shot and how the photograph fades to black in the upper right corner.  With that being said, I also am appreciative that you well lit the bridge so that it is evenly lit.  After all, it is the main subject here.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent!  I love that you didn''t just go out and photograph a bridge structure (like I did).  Very creative.  A few people had similar ideas this week but this is by far the best.  This is my favorite pic for this challenge this week.  I like the lighting that you have used in this shot and how the photograph fades to black in the upper right corner.  With that being said, I also am appreciative that you well lit the bridge so that it is evenly lit.  After all, it is the main subject here.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2003-03-16 17:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(238003, 13663, 3469, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but<br/>1) you probably had to promise Katherine that she would not be in focus, as a consequence you have a poor picture, since nothing here is in focus<br/>2) a bridge is going from somewhere to someplace else. In this picture Katherine is not ''bridging'' anything.<br/>Any points that this picture gets go to Katherine rather than to you as photographer.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but1) you probably had to promise Katherine that she would not be in focus, as a consequence you have a poor picture, since nothing here is in focus2) a bridge is going from somewhere to someplace else. In this picture Katherine is not ''bridging'' anything.Any points that this picture gets go to Katherine rather than to you as photographer.', '2003-03-16 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(238005, 13802, 3469, '<td valign="top">The title in combination with the flag at this point in History are working against you in a global contest. Other than that a very nice picture.</td>', 'The title in combination with the flag at this point in History are working against you in a global contest. Other than that a very nice picture.', '2003-03-16 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(238007, 13878, 3469, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, poor title</td>', 'Nice pic, poor title', '2003-03-16 17:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238012, 13963, 5664, '<td valign="top">Wher is bridge</td>', 'Wher is bridge', '2003-03-16 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(238024, 13831, 6740, '<td valign="top">Nicely done,  a little bright on top, a little dark on the bottom but there is nothing you could have done. My congrats.</td>', 'Nicely done,  a little bright on top, a little dark on the bottom but there is nothing you could have done. My congrats.', '2003-03-16 18:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(238025, 13878, 6740, '<td valign="top">Wish my entry was as good as yours.</td>', 'Wish my entry was as good as yours.', '2003-03-16 18:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(238027, 13535, 6740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo</td>', 'Beautiful photo', '2003-03-16 18:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(238029, 13873, 6740, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. Wish mine was as good. Job well done</td>', 'Wonderful photo. Wish mine was as good. Job well done', '2003-03-16 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(238044, 13536, 6740, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!</td>', 'Very very nice!', '2003-03-16 19:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(238072, 13639, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, though I''m not sure what the title is referring to. However, the shadows and lines of the bridge bring my eye there pretty quickly, and then I shift to the watercraft. This image is a bit grainy for me, even though I like grain a lot; I just can''t see the purpose here.  A bit blurry, too. Still, I like the lines and composition of this shot.</td>', 'I like the composition here, though I''m not sure what the title is referring to. However, the shadows and lines of the bridge bring my eye there pretty quickly, and then I shift to the watercraft. This image is a bit grainy for me, even though I like grain a lot; I just can''t see the purpose here.  A bit blurry, too. Still, I like the lines and composition of this shot.', '2003-03-16 19:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(238074, 13690, 6870, '<td valign="top">Appropriate and clever title. The whole image appeals to me, and I feel it is well composed. I also sense that it is a bit washed and blurry, when detail of the broken bridge would bring its "troubled-ness" into more, well, focus.</td>', 'Appropriate and clever title. The whole image appeals to me, and I feel it is well composed. I also sense that it is a bit washed and blurry, when detail of the broken bridge would bring its "troubled-ness" into more, well, focus.', '2003-03-16 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(238075, 13637, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the way the branches come between the bridge and me. It is like a symbolic "oldness," which fits your title well. Since your title is about reflections, I would reallywant that  hightlighed in some way: perhaps by waiting for more interesting light, or having the reflection higher in the frame.</td>', 'I like the way the branches come between the bridge and me. It is like a symbolic "oldness," which fits your title well. Since your title is about reflections, I would reallywant that  hightlighed in some way: perhaps by waiting for more interesting light, or having the reflection higher in the frame.', '2003-03-16 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(238077, 13948, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones of this image. The bridge is a bit blurry, but I really love how you''ve used shadows to emphasize the bridge.</td>', 'I love the tones of this image. The bridge is a bit blurry, but I really love how you''ve used shadows to emphasize the bridge.', '2003-03-16 19:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(238078, 13619, 6870, '<td valign="top">A nice image, with interesting lines and shadows. The light that is present, however, is not that exciting. You might try early morning or sunset to capture some really interesting light here; that would, I feel, make this image even better.</td>', 'A nice image, with interesting lines and shadows. The light that is present, however, is not that exciting. You might try early morning or sunset to capture some really interesting light here; that would, I feel, make this image even better.', '2003-03-16 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(238079, 13840, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the organizational composition in this image with the placement of the bridge behind those big boulders, however, the tones are pretty much even over the whole image, so I''m not sure where to look. There may be a time of day when the light would make that bridge stand out more. Nice focus and depth of field.</td>', 'I like the organizational composition in this image with the placement of the bridge behind those big boulders, however, the tones are pretty much even over the whole image, so I''m not sure where to look. There may be a time of day when the light would make that bridge stand out more. Nice focus and depth of field.', '2003-03-16 19:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(238080, 13918, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. I like the overal composition here, with the crooked books providing interesting angles to look at. Now note the light highlight on "Taliesin," which obscures the image. And I feel your tones are all so simillar that it makes it uninteresting. Try a lighter or darker background, and different colors of books?</td>', 'Clever idea. I like the overal composition here, with the crooked books providing interesting angles to look at. Now note the light highlight on "Taliesin," which obscures the image. And I feel your tones are all so simillar that it makes it uninteresting. Try a lighter or darker background, and different colors of books?', '2003-03-16 19:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238081, 13827, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the bridge makes a large sweep at the right of the frame, but I also think that this line, though interesting, moves our eye away from the bridge itself so I ultimately focus on the conifers in the lower left foreground.</td>', 'I like how the bridge makes a large sweep at the right of the frame, but I also think that this line, though interesting, moves our eye away from the bridge itself so I ultimately focus on the conifers in the lower left foreground.', '2003-03-16 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(238082, 13741, 6870, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot with lots to look at. Perhaps too much. Your use of line and shadow do not bring attn. to the bridge, which with all of what''s going on seems not as exciting as, say the palm trees, which ARE given attention because of the lines and circles.</td>', 'An interesting shot with lots to look at. Perhaps too much. Your use of line and shadow do not bring attn. to the bridge, which with all of what''s going on seems not as exciting as, say the palm trees, which ARE given attention because of the lines and circles.', '2003-03-16 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(238083, 13687, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the castle provides a barrier that we want to peek around: giving attn tothe bridge. At least I think it''s a bridge. Perhaps some closer cropping or different light would let me know for sure.</td>', 'I like how the castle provides a barrier that we want to peek around: giving attn tothe bridge. At least I think it''s a bridge. Perhaps some closer cropping or different light would let me know for sure.', '2003-03-16 19:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(238084, 13556, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and tones here. Simple and direct, it is well composed. I find it somehow not very exciting, though. It has kind of a textbook feel to it. Perhaps some different light or cropping would help.</td>', 'Nice lines and tones here. Simple and direct, it is well composed. I find it somehow not very exciting, though. It has kind of a textbook feel to it. Perhaps some different light or cropping would help.', '2003-03-16 19:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(238085, 13837, 6870, '<td valign="top">A really unique approach. I wish the supports and ice around them were in focus: at least around one of them.</td>', 'A really unique approach. I wish the supports and ice around them were in focus: at least around one of them.', '2003-03-16 19:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(238086, 13716, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and use of night lights. The lines of the image lead me to the van. Is that where I should be looking?</td>', 'Nice perspective and use of night lights. The lines of the image lead me to the van. Is that where I should be looking?', '2003-03-16 19:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(238087, 13975, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your interesting perspective here and how the bridge creates a line for our eyes to follow and enjoy the picture. Too bad its out of focus.</td>', 'I like your interesting perspective here and how the bridge creates a line for our eyes to follow and enjoy the picture. Too bad its out of focus.', '2003-03-16 19:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(238088, 13963, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and a nice landscape. I enjoy how the rocks (too bad they are out of focus) go out at a certain angle which is then taken over by the curve of the river. Very soothing colors.</td>', 'Clever idea and a nice landscape. I enjoy how the rocks (too bad they are out of focus) go out at a certain angle which is then taken over by the curve of the river. Very soothing colors.', '2003-03-16 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(238089, 13846, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this image with the waterfall unde the bridge. The tones of the photo, however are either similar or contrasting, so it is difficult to see what''s going on. This shot may look better at sunset or sunrise, when the light is less harsh.</td>', 'I like the idea of this image with the waterfall unde the bridge. The tones of the photo, however are either similar or contrasting, so it is difficult to see what''s going on. This shot may look better at sunset or sunrise, when the light is less harsh.', '2003-03-16 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(238090, 13638, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lines that draw the eye to and beyond the bridge. It seems out of focus, or maybe you used "unsharp mask" too enthusiastically.</td>', 'Nice composition and lines that draw the eye to and beyond the bridge. It seems out of focus, or maybe you used "unsharp mask" too enthusiastically.', '2003-03-16 19:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(238092, 13645, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting light, especially sky. The building seems, however, inappropriately to have the focus here, with its overexposed whiteness. The tree is interesting, too, but I''d like to see the bridge have the focus here.</td>', 'Interesting light, especially sky. The building seems, however, inappropriately to have the focus here, with its overexposed whiteness. The tree is interesting, too, but I''d like to see the bridge have the focus here.', '2003-03-16 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(238093, 13698, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point and perspective on an interesting bridge. The photo as a whole, though, seems washed out, having so many of the same tones. Try fiddling with the contrast levels to provide more dynamic tones.</td>', 'Nice vantage point and perspective on an interesting bridge. The photo as a whole, though, seems washed out, having so many of the same tones. Try fiddling with the contrast levels to provide more dynamic tones.', '2003-03-16 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(238099, 13825, 4340, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  I think i would''ve liked to be a bit closer to see a little more detail</td>', 'beautiful.  I think i would''ve liked to be a bit closer to see a little more detail', '2003-03-16 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
