(238128, 13573, 1686, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the light on both the water and the clouds. Great Colors</td>', 'Good capture of the light on both the water and the clouds. Great Colors', '2003-03-16 20:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(238129, 13776, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t see the bridge here.  Unless there is something about webs that I don''t know.  Maybe the web is refered to as a bridge?  Either way, I don''t see the purpose of the person in this photo.  is the focus suposed to be here, or the spider, or the web.  Her teeth are so white, and in such a place that I find myself staring at the teeth.  lighting is a little harsh on the web in a couple spots it''s a bit too white.  the sepia tones are good, but not sure if this helps the photo or not.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I guess I don''t see the bridge here.  Unless there is something about webs that I don''t know.  Maybe the web is refered to as a bridge?  Either way, I don''t see the purpose of the person in this photo.  is the focus suposed to be here, or the spider, or the web.  Her teeth are so white, and in such a place that I find myself staring at the teeth.  lighting is a little harsh on the web in a couple spots it''s a bit too white.  the sepia tones are good, but not sure if this helps the photo or not.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(238130, 13789, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a shot OF a bridge, but related to bridges.  I would like to see this straightened up a bit.  It''s kind of leaning to the left.  focus and charity are good, and the lighting conditions seem ok for the shot as well.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not exactly a shot OF a bridge, but related to bridges.  I would like to see this straightened up a bit.  It''s kind of leaning to the left.  focus and charity are good, and the lighting conditions seem ok for the shot as well.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(238132, 13767, 3080, '<td valign="top">The first thing that jumps out at me in this shot is the focus and clarity.  Excelent job with that.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well. I like the seperation of the dark tracks and the light sky.  great perspective as well.  good shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The first thing that jumps out at me in this shot is the focus and clarity.  Excelent job with that.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well. I like the seperation of the dark tracks and the light sky.  great perspective as well.  good shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(238133, 13749, 3080, '<td valign="top">The bridge its self doesn''t make me want to jump out of my seat with excitement...however, this shot is very nicely done.  focus and clarity are great, and the lighting conditions are also good.  angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I do wonder what the rest of this bridge looks like.  you did a nice job of keeping your eye on the background to make sure the houses weren''t leaning badly one way or another.  technically well done. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The bridge its self doesn''t make me want to jump out of my seat with excitement...however, this shot is very nicely done.  focus and clarity are great, and the lighting conditions are also good.  angle and framing/cropping are nice.  I do wonder what the rest of this bridge looks like.  you did a nice job of keeping your eye on the background to make sure the houses weren''t leaning badly one way or another.  technically well done. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(238134, 13575, 5313, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite places in the world!</td>', 'This is one of my favorite places in the world!', '2003-03-16 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(238136, 13797, 3080, '<td valign="top">wow.  i''ve never seen anything like this in person before.  what a nice find.  I love the arches and the texture in the brick.  The angle is good to show the length of the bridge.  my eyes move from the hill on the bridge to the front of the photo.  while this is a good shot, I would also like to see this from a direct on side view to see those arches.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'wow.  i''ve never seen anything like this in person before.  what a nice find.  I love the arches and the texture in the brick.  The angle is good to show the length of the bridge.  my eyes move from the hill on the bridge to the front of the photo.  while this is a good shot, I would also like to see this from a direct on side view to see those arches.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-16 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(238137, 13806, 5313, '<td valign="top">I''ve been over that bridge many times in days gone by!</td>', 'I''ve been over that bridge many times in days gone by!', '2003-03-16 20:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(238139, 13816, 1686, '<td valign="top">Interesting bridge I would have cropped out some of the water and enlarged the view of the bridge.</td>', 'Interesting bridge I would have cropped out some of the water and enlarged the view of the bridge.', '2003-03-16 21:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(238140, 13663, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract look</td>', 'Nice abstract look', '2003-03-16 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(238141, 13794, 554, '<td valign="top">great job on a truly beautiful scene.  Nite time setting with starburst lights and the orange glow......WOW</td>', 'great job on a truly beautiful scene.  Nite time setting with starburst lights and the orange glow......WOW', '2003-03-16 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
