(238178, 13777, 3102, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot -- one that I keep coming back to.  The sharpness is great, and it''s a subject that interests me quite a bit.  Nice work!</td>', 'A wonderful shot -- one that I keep coming back to.  The sharpness is great, and it''s a subject that interests me quite a bit.  Nice work!', '2003-03-16 22:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(238179, 13876, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting twist to the challenge -- I like it!  There are many angles of the Golden Gate Bridge that we''re so used to seeing -- this is one that I don''t recall viewing before.  Thanks for a refreshing shot!</td>', 'An interesting twist to the challenge -- I like it!  There are many angles of the Golden Gate Bridge that we''re so used to seeing -- this is one that I don''t recall viewing before.  Thanks for a refreshing shot!', '2003-03-16 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(238180, 13564, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting shot!  A great use of the fish-eye lens.  I''d be curious to see what this looks like in color.  This is a refreshingly unique shot for the challenge!</td>', 'Quite an interesting shot!  A great use of the fish-eye lens.  I''d be curious to see what this looks like in color.  This is a refreshingly unique shot for the challenge!', '2003-03-16 22:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(238181, 13748, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting shot!  I must admit that I''ve looked at it several times, and I didn''t realize until now that it''s apparently a double exposure (more specifically, a long exposure that duplicates the arch by moving the camera midway through).  A clever technique, very well executed -- congrats!</td>', 'Quite an interesting shot!  I must admit that I''ve looked at it several times, and I didn''t realize until now that it''s apparently a double exposure (more specifically, a long exposure that duplicates the arch by moving the camera midway through).  A clever technique, very well executed -- congrats!', '2003-03-16 22:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(238185, 13892, 6172, '<td valign="top">The buillding in the background is distracting, it stops your eye from following the lines of the bridge.</td>', 'The buillding in the background is distracting, it stops your eye from following the lines of the bridge.', '2003-03-16 22:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(238186, 13589, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite a shot!  I love the mountains in the background, and the very-well exposed snow in the foreground.  It''s an overall great shot, although something bothers me about the way it''s split in the middle.  I honestly can''t even put my finger on it.  I''m wondering if I would have found it to be stronger with the bridge at more of an angle instead of nearly head-on?  It almost looks like two separate pictures -- a mountain-scape and the bridge.  Whatever the case (since I''m finding that I''m not making a shred of sense) it''s a 9 in my book :)</td>', 'Quite a shot!  I love the mountains in the background, and the very-well exposed snow in the foreground.  It''s an overall great shot, although something bothers me about the way it''s split in the middle.  I honestly can''t even put my finger on it.  I''m wondering if I would have found it to be stronger with the bridge at more of an angle instead of nearly head-on?  It almost looks like two separate pictures -- a mountain-scape and the bridge.  Whatever the case (since I''m finding that I''m not making a shred of sense) it''s a 9 in my book :)', '2003-03-16 22:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(238187, 13580, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m honestly not too fond of the editing effects on this one... it just doesn''t seem to strengthen the image in my opinion.</td>', 'I''m honestly not too fond of the editing effects on this one... it just doesn''t seem to strengthen the image in my opinion.', '2003-03-16 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238189, 13878, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The use of perspective is perfect.  Good job catching the fog and the reflection.</td>', 'Very nice.  The use of perspective is perfect.  Good job catching the fog and the reflection.', '2003-03-16 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(238190, 13552, 3102, '<td valign="top">I think the bridge is an interesting one, but I''m not crazy about the way it was done.  It appears that it was taken out the window while driving.  The railing in the foreground serves as a big distraction, I''m afraid.  And I''m sure you''re also hearing a lot about the timestamp, which I''d certainly try to turn off.</td>', 'I think the bridge is an interesting one, but I''m not crazy about the way it was done.  It appears that it was taken out the window while driving.  The railing in the foreground serves as a big distraction, I''m afraid.  And I''m sure you''re also hearing a lot about the timestamp, which I''d certainly try to turn off.', '2003-03-16 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(238191, 13794, 3102, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot of a part of the world I''d love to visit!  I guess my only nitpick would be that I''ve seen this from the same vantage point many times before.  It would have been interesting to see it from a new angle, aside from what we''re used to seeing.  I actually have a post card hanging on my refrigerator as we speak that looks just like this.  The shot is very well done, but it''s just a bit cliche for this particular bridge.</td>', 'A beautiful shot of a part of the world I''d love to visit!  I guess my only nitpick would be that I''ve seen this from the same vantage point many times before.  It would have been interesting to see it from a new angle, aside from what we''re used to seeing.  I actually have a post card hanging on my refrigerator as we speak that looks just like this.  The shot is very well done, but it''s just a bit cliche for this particular bridge.', '2003-03-16 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(238192, 13663, 3102, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that this won''t score especially high this week, but there are a few of us who will give bonus points for naked babes :)  In all seriousness, I think it is a bit washed out, but it''s certainly a nice refreshing shot for the challenge.</td>', 'I have a feeling that this won''t score especially high this week, but there are a few of us who will give bonus points for naked babes :)  In all seriousness, I think it is a bit washed out, but it''s certainly a nice refreshing shot for the challenge.', '2003-03-16 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
