(238235, 13963, 5705, '<td valign="top">Thxs to all who commented.. I know this wasn''t a typical bridge, but it caught my eye and reminded my of a foot-bridge that someone may have created.  By definition a bridge is something that allows you to croos water, and if completed this would have, Hence , Incomplete Bridge..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-17 00:12:27.</i></td>', 'Thxs to all who commented.. I know this wasn''t a typical bridge, but it caught my eye and reminded my of a foot-bridge that someone may have created.  By definition a bridge is something that allows you to croos water, and if completed this would have, Hence , Incomplete Bridge..', '2003-03-17 00:11:53.000000', '2003-03-17 00:12:27.000000', 0),
