(238298, 13873, 2011, '<td valign="top">WAY TO GO SHER!!!!!!!!!  This is so awesome, and I am SO happy for you.  Hving crossed over this very bridge millions of times myself I can REALLY apreciate this one.  Keep up the good work. Anf again AWESOME!</td>', 'WAY TO GO SHER!!!!!!!!!  This is so awesome, and I am SO happy for you.  Hving crossed over this very bridge millions of times myself I can REALLY apreciate this one.  Keep up the good work. Anf again AWESOME!', '2003-03-17 00:49:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(238306, 13575, 5313, '<td valign="top">I''m so proud of you too, Anthony!    As Sonja has said, just keep on submitting!  I love that bridge and that village and that whole area.  I just wish that I could be over on that side of the big pond to take more photos of that area.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m so proud of you too, Anthony!    As Sonja has said, just keep on submitting!  I love that bridge and that village and that whole area.  I just wish that I could be over on that side of the big pond to take more photos of that area. ', '2003-03-17 00:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(238316, 13903, 714, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot.  I love the angle and the way you captured that little road down below.  The fog is perfect. Great use of negative space. Congrats on 3rd.</td>', 'This is an incredible shot.  I love the angle and the way you captured that little road down below.  The fog is perfect. Great use of negative space. Congrats on 3rd.', '2003-03-17 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(238318, 13873, 4877, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your win!  Amazing photo, and well deserved.  This was one of my favourites for a winner this week!  Look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'Congratulations on your win!  Amazing photo, and well deserved.  This was one of my favourites for a winner this week!  Look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2003-03-17 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 0),
